 %s.'=>'%s nambah acara %s menyang %s.','%s allows you to modify some or all of the formats used by Events Manager to generate your content. You can choose to override default formats and customize them to your needs. You do not lose your previously defined custom formats should you enable/disable %s or choose to not override a certain set of formats, they\'ll appear again once you enable %s again for that content.'=>'%s ngidini sampéyan ngowahi sawetara utāwā kabèh format sing digunakaké Events Manager kanggo nggawé isi sampéyan. Sampéyan bisa milih nimpa format gawan lan nyetel miturut kabutuhan sampéyan. Format racikan sing wis ditetepaké ora bakal ilang yèn sampéyan nonaktifake %s utāwā milih ora nimpa sawetara format, format kasebut bakal metu maneh yèn sampéyan ngaktifaké %s maneh kanggo isi kasebut.','%s are a <a href="%s" target="_blank">WordPress custom taxonomy</a>.'=>'%s yaiku <a href="%s" target="_blank">taksonomi kustom WordPress</a>.','%s are also accepted, for example %s equals 1 month and 12 hours before the event starts.'=>'%s uga ditampa, contone %s witjara 1 wulan lan 12 jam sadurungé acara diwiwiti.','%s belonging to other sub-sites will have an extra slug prepended to it so that your main site can differentiate between its own %s and those belonging to other sites in your network.'=>'%s sing kagolong ing sub-situs liyane bakal ditambahi slug ekstra ing ngarepe supaya situs utama sampeyan bisa mbedakake %s dhewe saka sing kagolong ing situs liyane ing jaringan sampeyan.','%s can be displayed just like normal WordPress custom taxonomies in an archive-style format, however Events Manager by default allows you to completely change the standard look of these archives and use our own <a href="%s">custom formatting</a> methods.'=>'%s bisa katampilaké kaya taksonomi kustom WordPress biasa ing format arsip, nanging Events Manager kanthi gawan ngidinaké sampéyan ngowahi sakabèhé tampilan arsip standar lan nganggo cara <a href="%s">pamormatan kustom</a> kita dhéwé.','%s cannot be used for a hybrid event, because it gives every booking virtual access.'=>'%s ora bisa dienggo kanggo acara hibrida, amarga menehi akses virtual marang saben pemesanan.','%s could not be deleted'=>'%s ora bisa dibusak','%s could not be deleted.'=>'%s ora bisa dibusak.','%s created.'=>'%s digawé.','%s custom post types can have archives, just like normal WordPress posts. If enabled, should you visit your base slug url %s and you will see an post-formatted archive of previous %s'=>'Tipe pos racikan %s bisa nduwèni arsip, kaya pos WordPress biasa. Yèn diaktifaké, yèn sampéyan ngunjungi url slug dasar sampéyan %s sampéyan bakal weruh arsip mawa format pos saka %s sadurungé','%s deleted'=>'%s dibusak','%s excerpt'=>'Kutipan %s','%s excerpt fallback'=>'Kutipan cadhangan %s','%s includes every add-on sold here.'=>'%s kalebu kabèh add-on sing didol ing kéné.','%s is attending %s of the group %s.'=>'%s bakal rawuh ing %s saka grup %s.','%s is attending %s.'=>'%s bakal rawuh ing %s.','%s is replaced by username, %s is replaced by the user password and %s is replaced by a link to create a password.'=>'%s diganti nganggo jeneng panganggo, %s diganti nganggo sandhi panganggo lan %s diganti nganggo pranālā kanggo nggawé sandhi.','%s is required.'=>'%s dibutuhaké.','%s item'=>'%s item' . "\0" . '%s item','%s list footer format'=>'Format sikil dhaptar %s','%s list header format'=>'Format sesirahan dhaptar %s','%s list item format'=>'Format item dhaptar %s','%s must be set to yes for this to work.'=>'%s kudu disetel Yā supaya iki bisa kerja.','%s overrides all formatting choices, which will be be taken from the settings defined on this page. If you want to override only certain formatting, choose the %s instead.'=>'%s nimpa kabèh pilihan format, sing bakal dijupuk saka setélan ing kācā iki. Yèn sampéyan namung péngin nimpa format tartamtu, pilihen %s.','%s page'=>'Kācā %s','%s parameters will be permitted in shortcode.'=>'Parameter %s bakal diparengaké ing shortcode.','%s row'=>'%s baris' . "\0" . '%s baris','%s successfully deleted'=>'%s kasil dibusak','%s successfully deleted.'=>'%s kasil dibusak.','%s successfully duplicated.'=>'%s kasil digandakaké.','%s users cancelled bookings.'=>'%s panganggo mbatalaké pemesanan.','%s will be replaced by a link to your site privacy policy page.'=>'%s bakal diganti pranālā menyang kācā kabijakan privasi situs sampéyan.','%s will not be attending %s anymore.'=>'%s ora bakal rawuh manèh ing %s.','%s will not be attending %s of group %s anymore.'=>'%s ora bakal rawuh manèh ing %s saka grup %s.','(New)'=>'(Anyar)','(always available)'=>'(tansah sumadya)','(not applicable with event ownership on presently, coming soon!)'=>'(durung bisa dienggo nalika kepemilikan acara aktif, bakal teka mbesuk!)','1,2,3 or 2 (0 = all)'=>'1,2,3 utawa 2 (0 = kabèh)','1. Match columns'=>'1. Cocokaké kolom','2 for every second day, week, month or year. Leave empty for every one.'=>'2 kanggo saben rong dina, minggu, wulan utawa taun. Kosongaké kanggo saben siji.','2. Options'=>'2. Opsi','3. Preview'=>'3. Pratinjau','<a href="%s">See some more information</a> on how %s work when overriding with formats.'=>'<a href="%s">Delengen informasi liyané</a> babagan cara kerjané %s nalika ditimpa nganggo format.','<a href="%s">Visit our blog</a> for the latest news about recent updates.'=>'<a href="%s">Tilikana blog kita</a> kanggo kabar paling anyar bab nganyaran.','<li>No events in this location</li>'=>'<li>Ora ana acara ing lokasi iki</li>','<p>Events Manager is ready to go! It is highly recommended you read the <a href=\'%s\'>Getting Started</a> guide on our site, as well as checking out the <a href=\'%s\'>Settings Page</a></p>'=>'<p>Events Manager wis siyap dienggo! Disaranaké banget sampéyan maca pandhuan <a href=\'%s\'>Miwiti</a> ing situs kita, lan uga mirsani <a href=\'%s\'>Kācā Setélan</a></p>','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Couldn&#8217;t register you... please contact the <a href="mailto:%s">webmaster</a> !'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Ora bisa ndaftaraké sampéyan... mangga hubungi <a href="mailto:%s">webmaster</a> !','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Please enter a username.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Mangga lebokna jeneng panganggo.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Please type your e-mail address.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Mangga ketik alamat e-mail sampéyan.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: The email address isn&#8217;t correct.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Alamat email ora bener.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This email is already registered, please choose another one.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Email iki wis kadaftar, mangga pilih liyané.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This username is already registered, please choose another one.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Jeneng panganggo iki wis kadaftar, mangga pilih liyané.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This username is invalid because it uses illegal characters. Please enter a valid username.'=>'<strong>SULAYA</strong>: Jeneng panganggo iki ora valid amarga nganggo karakter sing ora diolèhaké. Mangga lebokna jeneng panganggo sing valid.','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account (i.e. you can overbook). Emails are not resent automatically.'=>'<strong>Catetan:</strong> Kasedhiyan tiket ora dipertimbangake (tegese sampeyan bisa overbooking). Email ora dikirim ulang kanthi otomatis.','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account when approving new bookings (i.e. you can overbook).'=>'<strong>Catetan:</strong> Kasedhiyan tiket ora dipertimbangake nalika nyetujoni pemesanan anyar (tegese sampeyan bisa overbooking).','<strong>Warning : </strong> By enabling this, registered users will not be able to see bookings they make as guests in their "My Bookings" page.'=>'<strong>Pènget : </strong> Kanthi ngaktifaké iki, panganggo sing kadaftar ora bakal bisa ndeleng pemesanan sing ditindakaké minangka tamu ing kācā "Pemesanan Kula" wong kasebut.','<strong>Warning : </strong> Various features afforded to users with an account will not be available, e.g. viewing bookings. Once you enable this and select a user, modifying these values will prevent older non-user bookings from displaying the correct information.'=>'<strong>Pènget : </strong> Macem-macem fitur kanggo panganggo sing nduwé akun ora bakal sumadya, contone ndeleng pemesanan. Sawisé sampéyan ngaktifaké iki lan milih panganggo, ngowahi nilai-nilai iki bakal nyegah pemesanan lawas tanpa panganggo nampilaké informasi sing bener.','A booking intent cannot have its status changed.'=>'Status niat pemesanan ora bisa diganti.','A booking was cancelled'=>'Ana pemesanan sing dibatalake','A booking\'s payment gateway is set when the booking is made and cannot be changed.'=>'Gateway pembayaran pemesanan disetel nalika pemesanan digawé lan ora bisa diganti.','A guest-accessible cancellation flow for the EU statutory <strong>right of withdrawal</strong>. Enable this only if you sell to consumers who have a right of withdrawal — <strong>fixed-date events are generally exempt</strong>. Events Manager provides the mechanism; you supply your own legal withdrawal policy text below.'=>'Alur pambatalan sing bisa diakses tamu kanggo <strong>hak mbatalake</strong> miturut hukum EU. Aktifaké iki mung yèn sampéyan adol marang konsumen sing duwé hak mbatalake, <strong>acara kanthi tanggal tetep umumé dikecualèkaké</strong>. Events Manager nyadyakaké mekanismené; sampéyan nyadyakaké teks kabijakan pambatalan hukum dhéwé ing ngisor.','A hybrid event needs a physical venue.'=>'Acara hibrida mbutuhaké papan fisik.','A list of further dates, such as 2027-03-11|2027-03-18, used alone or with a rule.'=>'Daftar tanggal tambahan, kayata 2027-03-11|2027-03-18, bisa dienggo piyambak utawa bareng aturan.','A location with this name is already on this site (location %d).'=>'Lokasi kanthi jeneng iki wis ana ing situs iki (lokasi %d).','A location with this name is already on this site.'=>'Lokasi kanthi jeneng iki wis ana ing situs iki.','A new event has been published by #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Edit this event - #_EDITEVENTURL <br/> View this event - #_EVENTURL'=>'Acara anyar wis dipacak déning #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Jeneng : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Tanggal : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Wektu : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Nyunting acara iki - #_EDITEVENTURL <br/> Nonton acara iki - #_EVENTURL','A new event has been submitted by #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Please visit #_EDITEVENTURL to review this event for approval.'=>'Acara anyar wis dikirim déning #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Jeneng : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Tanggal : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Wektu : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Mangga bukak #_EDITEVENTURL kanggo mriksa acara iki supaya disetujoni.','A new event was created'=>'Acara anyar digawé','A new user account has been created for you. Please check your email for access details.'=>'Akun panganggo anyar wis digawé kanggo sampéyan. Mangga priksa email sampéyan kanggo rincian akses.','A previously published event has been modified by #_CONTACTNAME, and this event is now unpublished and pending your approval.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Please visit #_EDITEVENTURL to review this event for approval.'=>'Acara sing wis dipacak sadurungé wis diowahi déning #_CONTACTNAME, lan acara iki saiki ora dipacak lan ngenteni persetujuan sampéyan.<br/>Jeneng : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Tanggal : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Wektu : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Mangga bukak #_EDITEVENTURL kanggo mriksa acara iki supaya disetujoni.','A repeating event needs a repeat-until date or a number of times.'=>'Acara bola-balik mbutuhaké tanggal pungkasan baleni utawa jumlah baleni.','A test email will be sent to your account email - %s'=>'Email uji bakal dikirim menyang email akun sampeyan - %s','A token is required.'=>'Token dibutuhaké.','A user cancelled a booking'=>'Ana panganggo sing mbatalaké pemesanan','A valid Expo push token is required.'=>'Token push Expo sing sah dibutuhaké.','A valid blog ID must be provided, you can only reset one blog at a time.'=>'ID blog sing valid kudu diwenehake, sampeyan mung bisa nyetel ulang siji blog saben wektu.','A valid email'=>'Email sing sah','A virtual event can hold its link back until shortly before it starts. Until then, visitors and attendees see a short text in place of the link, and join links sent to attendees only start working at that time.'=>'Acara virtual bisa nyimpen pranalané nganti sadélok sadurungé diwiwiti. Nganti wektu iku, pengunjung lan peserta ndelok teks cendhak minangka gantiné pranala, lan pranala melu sing dikirim marang peserta mung bakal makarya ing wektu iku.','AFTER the withdrawal period — please review carefully'=>'SAWISÉ wektu pambatalan, mangga ditinjau kanthi premati','AI / MCP Setup'=>'Setélan AI / MCP','Abbreviated weekdays'=>'Dinā disingkat','Abbreviated weekdays?'=>'Dinā disingkat?','Abilities that create, update, delete, or otherwise modify Events Manager data.'=>'Kemampuan sing nggawé, nganyari, mbusak, utawa ngowahi data Events Manager.','Access'=>'Akses','Accordion'=>'Akordion','Account Connection'=>'Sambungan Akun','Acknowledgment email'=>'Email pangalembānā tampa','Acknowledgment email body'=>'Isi email pangalembānā tampa','Acknowledgment email subject'=>'Subyek email pangalembānā tampa','Actions'=>'Aksi','Activate license'=>'Aktifaké lisènsi','Activate plugin'=>'Aktifaké plugin','Active'=>'Aktif','Add %s'=>'Tambah %s','Add Dates '=>'Tambah Tanggal ','Add Event'=>'Nambah Acara','Add Location'=>'Nambah Lokasi','Add New'=>'Tambah Anyar','Add New %s'=>'Tambah %s Anyar','Add New Archetype'=>'Tambah Archetype Anyar','Add New Event'=>'Tambah Acara Anyar','Add New Event Category'=>'Tambah Kategori Acara Anyar','Add New Event Tag'=>'Tambah Tenger Acara Anyar','Add New Location'=>'Tambah Lokasi Anyar','Add New Repeating Event'=>'Tambah Acara Bola-balik Anyar','Add Note'=>'Tambah Catetan','Add Repeating Event'=>'Tambah Acara Bola-balik','Add Reply-To booker?'=>'Tambahaké Reply-To sing mesen?','Add Reply-To event owner?'=>'Tambahaké Reply-To pemilik acara?','Add Time Slot'=>'Tambah Slot Wektu','Add To Calendar'=>'Tambah Menyang Tanggalan','Add a negative number or minus sign to the start of the date interval to allow cancellations after events have started.'=>'Tambahna angka negatif utawa tandha minus ing wiwitan interval tanggal kanggo ngidinaké pembatalan sawisé acara diwiwiti.','Add a start or end date (or both) to impose time constraints on ticket availability. Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Tambahna tanggal wiwitan utawa pungkasan (utawa loro-lorone) kanggo mbatesi wektu kasedhiyané tiket. Kosongna salah siji supaya ora ana wates ndhuwur/ngisor.','Add a tax rate to your ticket prices (entering 10 will add 10% to the ticket price).'=>'Tambahna tarif pajeg menyang rega tiket sampéyan (ngetik 10 bakal nambah 10% menyang rega tiket).','Add any of these columns to an events file. A row with none of them filled in is a single event.'=>'Tambahaké salah siji kolom iki menyang berkas acara. Baris sing ora ana isiné siji waé yaiku acara tunggal.','Add br tags to HTML emails?'=>'Tambahake tag br menyang email HTML?','Add location'=>'Tambah lokasi','Add new ticket'=>'Tambah tiket anyar','Add or remove %s'=>'Tambah utawa buwang %s','Add or remove events'=>'Nambah utawa mbuwang acara','Add tax to ticket price?'=>'Tambah pajeg menyang rega tiket?','Add to your table from the columns below.'=>'Tambahaké menyang tabel sampéyan saka kolom ing ngisor.','Add-ons'=>'Add-on','Add-ons and prices are up to date.'=>'Add-on lan rega wis anyar.','Add-ons are separate plugins that work with the free Events Manager plugin, so you do not need Events Manager Pro to use them.'=>'Add-on yaiku plugin kapisah sing makarya bareng plugin Events Manager gratis, dadi sampeyan ora butuh Events Manager Pro kanggo nggunakaké.','Additional CSS'=>'Tambahan CSS','Address'=>'Alamat','Address line 2'=>'Baris alamat 2','Address only'=>'Alamat waé','Address:'=>'Alamat:','Adds a checkbox below the location options that limits results to events attendees can join virtually, including hybrid events.'=>'Nambah kotak centhang ing sangisoring opsi lokasi sing mbatesi asil menyang acara sing bisa diikuti peserta kanthi virtual, kalebu acara hibrida.','Adds a guest-accessible withdrawal flow and, optionally, a site-wide footer link.'=>'Nambah alur pambatalan sing bisa diakses tamu lan, manawa dikarepaké, pranālā ing sikil kācā ing saindhenging situs.','Adds the time and the hidden text to the event editor, so each event can set its own. If not, every event uses the defaults below.'=>'Nambah wektu lan teks sing didelikake menyang tukang ndandani acara, supaya saben acara bisa nyetèl dhéwé. Yèn ora, saben acara nganggo gawan ing ngisor.','Admin Icon'=>'Ikon Admin','Admin Tools'=>'Perkakas Admin','Administrator Email'=>'Email Administrator','Advanced'=>'Tutug','Advanced Mode'=>'Mode Tutug','Advanced Search Fields'=>'Kolom Nggoleki Tutug','Advanced search mode'=>'Mode panggolékan tutug','Advanced search style'=>'Gagrag panggolékan tutug','Advanced settings'=>'Setélan lanjutan','After'=>'Sawisé','All'=>'Kabèh','All %s'=>'Kabèh %s','All Ascending'=>'Kabèh Munggah','All Blogs'=>'Kabèh Blog','All Categories'=>'Kabéh Kategori','All Cities/Towns'=>'Kabèh Kuthā/Kitha','All Countries'=>'Kabèh Nagara','All Day'=>'Sedina Muput','All Day Message'=>'Pesen Sedina Muput','All Descending'=>'Kabèh Mudhun','All Event Categories'=>'Kabèh Kategori Acara','All Event Tags'=>'Kabèh Tenger Acara','All Event Types'=>'Kabèh Tipe Acara','All Events'=>'Kabèh Acara','All Regions'=>'Kabèh Wilayah','All States'=>'Kabèh Negara Bagian','All Tags'=>'Kabéh Tenger','All Time'=>'Sakabehe Wektu','All Timeslots'=>'Kabeh Slot Wektu','All confirmed and pending bookings will be emailed a general event cancellation notification.'=>'Kabèh pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi lan ngenténi bakal dikirimi email kabar pambatalan acara umum.','All countries text'=>'Teks kabèh negara','All day'=>'Sedina muput','All day (yes or no)'=>'Sedina muput (yes utawa no)','All events'=>'Kabèh acara','All events link text?'=>'Teks pranālā kabèh acara?','All events will be moved to trash.'=>'Kabèh acara bakal dipindhah menyang kranjang runtah.','All options below relate to data that may have been submitted by or collected from the user requesting their personal data, which would also include events and locations where they are the author.'=>'Kabèh pilihan ing ngisor gegayutan karo data sing bisa wis dikirim utawa dikumpulaké saka panganggo sing njaluk data pribadiné, kalebu acara lan lokasi sing dadi panulisé.','All our sold add-ons'=>'Kabèh add-on kita sing didol','All regions text'=>'Teks kabèh wilayah','All settings, events and bookings for every site on this network will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Kabeh setelan, acara lan pemesanan kanggo saben situs ing jaringan iki bakal dibusak kanthi permanen. Iki ora bisa dibatalake.','All states text'=>'Teks kabèh negara bagéan','All towns/cities text'=>'Teks kabèh kutha/kuthā','All translations of this event will be detached from the recurring event.'=>'Kabèh terjemahan acara iki bakal dicopot saka acara bola-balik.','All your settings and events will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Kabeh setelan lan acara sampeyan bakal dibusak kanthi permanen. Iki ora bisa dibatalake.','All your settings, including email templates and template formats for Events Manager will be deleted.'=>'Kabeh setelan sampeyan, kalebu cithakan email lan format cithakan kanggo Events Manager bakal dibusak.','Allow %s to appear in the built-in search results.'=>'Ngidinaké %s katon ing kasil panggolékan bawaan.','Allow Maybe?'=>'Idinaké Mbok Menawa?','Allow Multiple Uploads'=>'Olèhaké Unggah Pirang-pirang','Allow RSVP Actions'=>'Idinaké Tindakan RSVP','Allow WordPress post-style archives.'=>'Ngidinaké arsip gaya pos WordPress.','Allow anonymous event submissions?'=>'Ngidinaké pangiriman acara anonim?','Allow bookings with registered emails?'=>'Idinaké pemesanan nganggo email sing wis kadaftar?','Allow double bookings?'=>'Idinaké pemesanan ganda?','Allow format shortcode parameters?'=>'Idinaké parameter format shortcode?','Allow guest bookings?'=>'Idinaké pemesanan tamu?','Allow overbooking when approving?'=>'Idinaké pemesanan kluwih nalika nyetujoni?','Allow subsites to create their own'=>'Idinaké subsitus nggawé dhéwé','Allow users to respond with a \'Maybe\' status rather than Attending or Not Attending'=>'Idinaké panganggo mangsuli nganggo status \'Mbok Menawa\' tinimbang Melu utawa Ora Melu','Allowed Extensions'=>'Ekstensi sing Diidinake','Already Booked'=>'Wis Dipesen','Already attending'=>'Wis melu','Already booked'=>'Wis dipesen','Already have a license? Download the plugin from %s, upload it under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Wis duwé lisènsi? Undhuh plugin saka %s, unggah ing Plugin > Tambah Anyar, banjur aktifaké lisènsi saka setélané.','Already migrated: %s'=>'Wis dipindhah: %s','Also, the following will occur:'=>'Uga, prakara ing ngisor iki bakal kelakon:','Always check the latest stable version?'=>'Tansah priksa versi stabil paling anyar?','Always show and ask for consent'=>'Tansah tampilaké lan jaluk persetujuan','An email will be sent to an administrator of your choice when an event is published by users who are not administrators.'=>'Email bakal dikirim menyang administrator pilihan sampéyan nalika acara dipacak déning panganggo sing dudu administrator.','An email will be sent to the event contact if someone cancels their booking.'=>'Email bakal dikirim menyang kontak acara yèn ana wong mbatalaké pemesanané.','An email will be sent to the event owner when their event is approved. Users requiring event approval do not have the <code>publish_events</code> capability.'=>'Email bakal dikirim menyang pemilik acara nalika acarané disetujoni. Panganggo sing butuh persetujuan acara ora duwé kapabilitas <code>publish_events</code>.','An email will be sent to your administrator emails when an event is submitted and pending approval.'=>'Email bakal dikirim menyang email administrator sampéyan nalika acara dikirim lan ngenteni persetujuan.','An error has occurred, not all sites were upgraded successfully.'=>'Ana kesalahan, ora kabèh situs kasil diupgrade.','An error occurred.'=>'Ana kesalahan.','An event with no bookings.'=>'Acara tanpa pemesanan.','An event with this name and start is already on this site (event %d).'=>'Acara kanthi jeneng lan wiwitan iki wis ana ing situs iki (acara %d).','An import is running. Wait for it to finish, or pause it first.'=>'Impor lagi mlaku. Entènana nganti rampung, utawa jeda dhisik.','An organizer with this name is already on this site.'=>'Panyelenggara kanthi jeneng iki wis ana ing situs iki.','And much more'=>'Lan isih akèh manèh','Anonymous Submitter Info'=>'Info Pengirim Anonim','Anonymous event submissions'=>'Pangiriman acara anonim','Anonymous submitters cannot see or modify their event once submitted. You can customize the success message they see here.'=>'Pangirim anonim ora bisa mirsani utawa ngowahi acarané sawisé dikirim. Sampéyan bisa natani pesen kasil sing katon ing kéné.','Another request is already updating this online location.'=>'Panyuwunan liyané wis nganyari lokasi online iki.','Any Type'=>'Tipe Apa Waé','Appears as the first default search option.'=>'Katon minangka pilihan nggoleki gawan sing pisanan.','Appears as the label for this search option.'=>'Katon minangka label kanggo pilihan nggoleki iki.','Appears on the text search filter above the categories list.'=>'Katon ing panyaring panggolékan teks ing ndhuwur daftar kategori.','Appears on the text search filter above the tags list.'=>'Katon ing panyaring panggolékan teks ing ndhuwur daftar tetenger.','Appears within the input box.'=>'Katon ing njero kothak input.','Apply global capabilities?'=>'Trapaké kapabilitas global?','Approval Required?'=>'Perlu Persetujuan?','Approve'=>'Setujoni','Approved'=>'Disetujoni','Archetype'=>'Arketipe','Archetypes UI Builder'=>'Pembangun UI Archetype','Are current events past events?'=>'Apa acara saiki dianggep acara kepungkur?','Are you sure you want to cancel your booking?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbatalake pemesanan sampéyan?','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep nerusaké?','Are you sure you want to convert all repeating events into recurring events?'=>'Apa sampeyan yakin arep ngowahi kabeh acara baleni dadi acara bola-balik?','Are you sure you want to convert this repeating event?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep ngowahi acara bola-balik iki?','Are you sure you want to delete all recurrences of this event?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak kabèh pengulangan acara iki?','Are you sure you want to delete this archetype? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak archetype iki? Tindakan iki ora bisa dibatalaké.','Are you sure you want to delete this file? It will be deleted upon submission.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak berkas iki? Berkas bakal dibusak nalika dikirim.','Are you sure you want to delete this item? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak item iki? Aksi iki ora bisa dibatalake.','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak tiket iki?','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket? All bookings related to this ticket will be deleted once you save this %s.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak tiket iki? Kabèh pemesanan sing gandhèng karo tiket iki bakal dibusak yèn sampéyan nyimpen %s iki.','Are you sure you want to delete?'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak?','Are you sure you want to delete? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep mbusak? Aksi iki ora bisa dibatalake.','Are you sure you want to detach this event? By doing so, this event will be independent of the recurring set of events.'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep nyopot acara iki? Mangkono, acara iki bakal mandiri saka set acara bola-balik.','Are you sure you want to disable bookings? If you do this and save, you will lose all previous bookings. If you wish to prevent further bookings, reduce the number of spaces available to the amount of bookings you currently have'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep nonaktifaké pemesanan? Yèn sampéyan nindakaké iki lan nyimpen, sampéyan bakal kélangan kabèh pemesanan sadurungé. Yèn sampéyan arep nyegah pemesanan manèh, kurangana jumlah panggonan sing sumadya dadi jumlah pemesanan sing saiki sampéyan duwé','Are you sure you want to proceed? We recommend you back up your database first, just in case!'=>'Apa sampéyan yakin arep nerusaké? Kita nyaranaké sampéyan nyerep basis data dhisik, mung supaya aman!','Are you sure you want to reset Events Manager?'=>'Apa sampeyan yakin arep nyetel ulang Events Manager?','Are you sure you want to uninstall Events Manager?'=>'Apa sampeyan yakin arep nyopot pasang Events Manager?','As a site admin, you see all group events, users will only be able to choose groups they are admins of.'=>'Minangka admin situs, sampéyan weruh kabèh acara klompok, dene panganggo mung bisa milih klompok sing dikelola dhewe.','Ascending'=>'Munggah','Aside from pages we automatically generate and include certain jQuery files, if you are using Widgets, Shortcode or PHP to display specific items you may need to tell us where you are using them for them to work properly. Below are options for you to include specific jQuery dependencies only on certain pages.'=>'Saliyané kācā sing kita gawé kanthi otomatis lan nyakup berkas jQuery tartamtu, yèn sampéyan nggunakaké Widget, Shortcode utawa PHP kanggo nuduhake item tartamtu, sampéyan mbok menawa kudu ngandhani kita ing ngendi sampéyan nggunakaké supaya bisa mlaku kanthi bener. Ing ngisor iki ana pilihan kanggo nyakup dependensi jQuery tartamtu mung ing kācā tartamtu.','Attachment ID not found.'=>'ID lampiran ora ditemokaké.','Attendee %d'=>'Peserta %d','Attendee %s'=>'Peserta %s','Attendee (Per Space Booked)'=>'Peserta (Saben Panggonan sing Dipesen)','Attendee names, answers to attendee fields and check-in status are copied and kept with each ticket. Without Events Manager Pro they are not shown, so you will see each booking, its tickets and the person who booked.'=>'Jeneng peserta, wangsulan kolom peserta, lan status check-in disalin lan disimpen bareng saben tiket. Tanpa Events Manager Pro iku ora ditampilake, mula sampeyan bakal weruh saben pemesanan, tiket-tiketé, lan wong sing mesen.','Attendees'=>'Peserta','Attending'=>'Melu','Attributes'=>'Atribut','AutoTLS'=>'AutoTLS','Avail. Spaces'=>'Panggonan Sumadya','Availability'=>'Kasedhiyan','Available'=>'Sumadya','Available Archetypes'=>'Archetype sing Sumadya','Available Spaces'=>'Panggonan sing Sumadya','Available for'=>'Kasedhiya kanggo','Available from'=>'Kasedhiya wiwit','Available spaces'=>'Panggonan sing kasedhiya','Available until'=>'Kasedhiya nganti','Average Sale'=>'Rata-rata Dodolan','Average Ticket'=>'Rata-rata Tiket','Awaiting Online Payment'=>'Ngenteni Pembayaran Online','Awaiting Payment'=>'Ngenteni Pembayaran','Bar Graph'=>'Grafik Batang','Base Event Settings'=>'Setélan Acara Dhasar','Base Location Settings'=>'Setélan Lokasi Dhasar','Base font size'=>'Ukuran fon dasar','Base font weight'=>'Bobot fon dasar','Base line height'=>'Dhuwuré baris dasar','Basic HTML is allowed in ticket labels and descriptions.'=>'HTML dhasar diparengaké ing label lan katrangan tiket.','Basic Only'=>'Dasar Waé','Be aware that some themes will not work with this option, if so (or you want to make your own changes), you can create a file named <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the WordPress codex</a>, and leave this set to Posts.'=>'Élinga yèn sawetara tema ora bakal mlaku mawa pilihan iki, yèn mengkono (utawa sampéyan pengin nggawé owahan dhéwé), sampéyan bisa nggawé berkas kanthi jeneng <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>kaya sing dituduhaké ing codex WordPress</a>, lan ninggalaké iki diset menyang Pos.','Before'=>'Sadurungé','Before you save your changes, you can quickly send yourself a test email by clicking this button.'=>'Sadurunge nyimpen owahan sampeyan, sampeyan bisa kanthi cepet ngirim email uji menyang awak dhewe kanthi ngeklik tombol iki.','Below are translations for your location address. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Ing ngisor iki terjemahan kanggo alamat lokasi sampéyan. Yèn dikosongaké, bāsā acara asli bakal dienggo.','Below are translations for your tickets. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Ing ngisor iki terjemahan kanggo tiket sampéyan. Yèn dikosongaké, bāsā acara asli bakal dienggo.','Below you will find texts that will be displayed to users in various areas during the bookings process, particularly on booking forms.'=>'Ing ngisor iki sampéyan bakal nemu teks sing bakal ditampilaké marang panganggo ing macem-macem area nalika proses pemesanan, utamané ing formulir pemesanan.','Block Editor (Gutenberg)'=>'Tukang ndandani Blok (Gutenberg)','Block Editor development is still ongoing, switch back to the Classic Editor if you experience issues.'=>'Pangembangan Tukang ndandani Blok isih lumaku, bali menyang Tukang ndandani Klasik yèn sampéyan nemoni masalah.','Block editor layout'=>'Tata letak tukang ndandani blok','Blog Default Timezone'=>'Zona Wektu Gawan Blog','Body Classes'=>'Kelas Body','Book Now'=>'Pesen Saiki','Book Now!'=>'Pesen Saiki!','Booked'=>'Dipesen','Booked Spaces'=>'Panggonan sing Dipesen','Booked User Emails'=>'Email Panganggo sing Mesen','Booked/Available'=>'Dipesen/Sumadya','Booking'=>'Pemesanan','Booking %s'=>'Pemesanan %s','Booking %s.'=>'Pemesanan %s.','Booking Actions'=>'Aksi Pemesanan','Booking Cancellation Warning'=>'Pènget Pembatalan Pemesanan','Booking Cancelled'=>'Pemesanan Dibatalake','Booking Chart'=>'Bagan Pemesanan','Booking Comment'=>'Komentar Pemesanan','Booking Confirmation'=>'Konfirmasi Pemesanan','Booking Confirmed'=>'Pemesanan Wis Dikonfirmasi','Booking Cut-Off Date'=>'Tanggal Pungkasan Pemesanan','Booking Data'=>'Data Pemesanan','Booking Date'=>'Tanggal Pemesanan','Booking Details'=>'Detil Pemesanan','Booking Email Templates'=>'Cithakan Email Pemesanan','Booking Form'=>'Formulir Pemesanan','Booking ID'=>'ID Pemesanan','Booking ID.'=>'ID pemesanan.','Booking Intent'=>'Niat Pemesanan','Booking Management Pages'=>'Kācā Manajemen Pemesanan','Booking Meta'=>'Meta Pemesanan','Booking Notes'=>'Catetan Pemesanan','Booking Pending'=>'Pemesanan Ngenteni','Booking RSVP'=>'RSVP Pemesanan','Booking RSVP status set to \'%s\'.'=>'Status RSVP pemesanan disetel dadi \'%s\'.','Booking Rejected'=>'Pemesanan Ditolak','Booking Related Placeholders'=>'Placeholder Related Pemesanan','Booking Status'=>'Status Pemesanan','Booking Statuses'=>'Status Pemesanan','Booking Submit Button'=>'Tombol Kirim Pemesanan','Booking Summary'=>'Ringkesan Pemesanan','Booking admin pages'=>'Kācā admin pemesanan','Booking already made'=>'Pemesanan wis ditindakaké','Booking button feedback messages'=>'Pesen umpanbalik tombol pemesanan','Booking cancellation emails are not sent.'=>'Email pambatalan pemesanan ora dikirim.','Booking cancellation emails will be sent.'=>'Email pambatalan pemesanan bakal dikirim.','Booking cancellations'=>'Pambatalan pemesanan','Booking cancelled'=>'Pemesanan dibatalake','Booking cancelled email'=>'Email pemesanan dibatalake','Booking cancelled email subject'=>'Subyek email pemesanan dibatalake','Booking cannot be made, not enough spaces available!'=>'Pemesanan ora bisa digawé, panggonan sing sumadya ora cukup!','Booking complete'=>'Pemesanan rampung','Booking confirmed email'=>'Email pemesanan wis dikonfirmasi','Booking confirmed email subject'=>'Subyek email pemesanan wis dikonfirmasi','Booking could not be %s.'=>'Pemesanan ora bisa %s.','Booking could not be created'=>'Pemesanan ora bisa digawé','Booking could not be deleted.'=>'Pemesanan ora bisa dibusak.','Booking could not be saved.'=>'Pemesanan ora bisa disimpen.','Booking data is invalid.'=>'Data pemesanan ora valid.','Booking error'=>'Kesalahan pemesanan','Booking form feedback messages'=>'Pesen umpanbalik formulir pemesanan','Booking form section headers'=>'Sesirahan bagéan formulir pemesanan','Booking form texts/messages'=>'Teks/pesen formulir pemesanan','Booking in progress'=>'Pemesanan lagi diproses','Booking not found.'=>'Pemesanan ora ketemu.','Booking note successfully added.'=>'Cathetan pemesanan kasil ditambahaké.','Booking pending email'=>'Email pemesanan ngenteni','Booking pending email subject'=>'Subyek email pemesanan ngenteni','Booking reference'=>'Referensi pemesanan','Booking rejected email'=>'Email pemesanan ditolak','Booking rejected email subject'=>'Subyek email pemesanan ditolak','Booking status could not be changed.'=>'Status pemesanan ora bisa diowahi.','Booking status is invalid.'=>'Status pemesanan ora valid.','Booking successful, pending confirmation (you will also receive an email once confirmed).'=>'Pemesanan kasil, ngenteni konfirmasi (sampéyan uga bakal éntuk email yèn wis dikonfirmasi).','Booking successful.'=>'Pemesanan kasil.','Booking summary default text'=>'Teks gawan ringkesan pemesanan','Booking...'=>'Lagi mesen...','Bookings'=>'Pemesanan','Bookings %s. Mails Sent.'=>'Pemesanan %s. Email wis dikirim.','Bookings Consent Error'=>'Kesalahan Persetujuan Pemesanan','Bookings Forms'=>'Formulir Pemesanan','Bookings Stats'=>'Statistik Pemesanan','Bookings Table Settings'=>'Setélan Tabel Pemesanan','Bookings View'=>'Tampilan Pemesanan','Bookings are closed for this event.'=>'Pemesanan wis ditutup kanggo acara iki.','Bookings are disabled in Events Manager. Migrating tickets turns them on.'=>'Pemesanan dinonaktifaké ing Events Manager. Mindhahake tiket bakal ngaktifaké maneh.','Bookings closed'=>'Pemesanan ditutup','Bookings data'=>'Data pemesanan','Bookings disabled'=>'Pemesanan dinonaktifaké','Bookings for %s'=>'Pemesanan kanggo %s','Bookings have closed (e.g. event has started).'=>'Pemesanan wis ditutup (contone acara wis diwiwiti).','Bookings that are uncancelled are returned to their previous state (if available), the %1$s PHP constant value or if previous options are not available then pending/approved according to your booking approval settings.'=>'Pemesanan sing ora dadi dibatalake bakal dibalèkaké menyang kahanan sadurungé (yèn ana), nilai konstanta PHP %1$s utawa yèn opsi sadurungé ora ana banjur ngenteni/disetujoni miturut setélan persetujuan pemesanan sampéyan.','Bookings to individual %s recurrences will be preserved unless you delete tickets or choose to reschedule and delete rescheduled recurrences.'=>'Pemesanan ing saben pengulangan %s bakal dilestarèkaké kajaba sampéyan mbusak tiket utawa milih ngatur ulang jadwal lan mbusak pengulangan sing dijadwal ulang.','Bookings to individual event recurrences will be preserved if event times and ticket settings are not modified.'=>'Pemesanan ing saben pengulangan acara bakal dilestarèkaké yèn wektu acara lan setélan tiket ora diowahi.','Bookings will be automatically cancelled.'=>'Pemesanan bakal dibatalake kanthi otomatis.','Bookings will not be confirmed until the event administrator approves it.'=>'Pemesanan ora bakal dikonfirmasi nganti administrator acara nyetujoni.','Bookings/Registration'=>'Pemesanan/Registrasi','Buffer'=>'Panyangga','Bulk Actions'=>'Aksi Borongan','Bulk actions'=>'Aksi Borongan','Button & page labels'=>'Label tombol & kācā','Buy %s'=>'Tuku %s','Buy on Woo.com'=>'Tuku ing Woo.com','By default, event spaces become unavailable once there are enough CONFIRMED bookings. To reserve spaces even if unapproved, choose yes.'=>'Sacara gawan, panggonan acara dadi ora sumadya yèn wis ana pemesanan DIKONFIRMASI sing cukup. Kanggo nyadhangaké panggonan senajan durung disetujoni, pilih Yā.','By default, events that have an end date later than today will be included in searches, set this to yes to consider events that started \'yesterday\' as past.'=>'Kanthi gawan, acara sing tanggal rampungé sakwisé dinā iki bakal dilebokaké ing panggolékan, setel iki menyang ya kanggo nganggep acara sing diwiwiti \'wingi\' minangka kepungkur.','By default, if a calendar day only has one event, it display a single event when clicking on the link of that calendar date. If you select Yes here, you will get always see a list of events.'=>'Kanthi gawan, yèn dinā tanggalan namung duwé siji acara, siji acara bakal katon nalika ngeklik pranālā tanggal tanggalan kasebut. Yèn sampéyan milih Yā ing kéné, sampéyan bakal tansah weruh daftar acara.','By default, if a guest tries to book an event using the email of a user account on your site they will be asked to log in, selecting yes will bypass this security measure.'=>'Sacara gawan, yèn tamu nyoba mesen acara nganggo email akun panganggo ing situs sampéyan, wong kasebut bakal dijaluk mlebu log, milih Yā bakal ngliwati ukuran keamanan iki.','By default, when a booking is made by a user, this booking is tied to a user account, if the user is not registered nor logged in and guest bookings are enabled, an account will be created for them.'=>'Sacara gawan, nalika panganggo nindakaké pemesanan, pemesanan iki disambungaké menyang akun panganggo, yèn panganggo durung kadaftar utawa mlebu log lan pemesanan tamu diaktifaké, akun bakal digawé kanggo wong kasebut.','By editing your primary recurrence set, you will change all subsequent default values of your other recurrences.'=>'Kanthi nyunting set pengulangan utama sampéyan, sampéyan bakal ngowahi kabèh nilai gawan sabanjuré ing pengulangan liyané.','By using formats, you can control how your %s are displayed from within the Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Formatting</a> tab above without having to edit your theme files.'=>'Kanthi nggunakaké format, sampéyan bisa ngontrol carané %s sampéyan katon saka tab <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Pamormatan</a> Events Manager ing dhuwur tanpa kudu ndandani berkas tema sampéyan.','CPT'=>'CPT','CPT (Plural)'=>'CPT (Jamak)','CPT (Single)'=>'CPT (Tunggal)','CPT name (plural) must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'Jeneng CPT (jamak) kudu isi mung huruf cilik, angka, lan garis ngisor.','CPT name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'Jeneng CPT kudu isi mung huruf cilik, angka, lan garis ngisor.','CPTs'=>'CPT','CSS File'=>'Berkas CSS','CSV file'=>'Berkas CSV','CSV file does not appear to contain valid data.'=>'Berkas CSV katon ora ngandhut data sing valid.','Calendar'=>'Tanggalan','Calendar Day Event List Settings'=>'Setélan Daftar Acara Dinā Tanggalan','Calendar Selection'=>'Pilihan Tanggalan','Calendar Size'=>'Ukuran Tanggalan','Calendar events/day limit'=>'Watesan acara/dinā tanggalan','Calendar settings'=>'Setélan tanggalan','Calendar size'=>'Ukuran tanggalan','Call get-booking-requirements with this event\'s ID for the exact required fields, their payload locations (attendee fields go under em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), and a ready-to-submit example.'=>'Celuken get-booking-requirements nganggo ID acara iki kanggo olèh kolom sing dibutuhaké pas, panggonan payload-é (kolom peserta manggon ing em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), lan conto sing siap dikirim.','Calling em_get_option() too early whilst EM\\Archetypes class is not available.'=>'Nceluk em_get_option() kaawal nalika kelas EM\\Archetypes durung sumadya.','Can attendees change their RSVP status? You can choose whether they can uncancel an RSVP below as well.'=>'Apa peserta bisa ngowahi status RSVP-né? Sampéyan uga bisa milih apa wong kasebut bisa mbatalaké pembatalan RSVP ing ngisor iki.','Can be in form of pixels or a percentage such as %s or %s.'=>'Bisa awujud piksel utawa persentase kayata %s utawa %s.','Can users cancel their booking?'=>'Apa panganggo bisa mbatalaké pemesanané?','Can users uncancel their booking?'=>'Apa panganggo bisa mbatalaké pembatalan pemesanané?','Cancel'=>'Batal','Cancel Ticket Recreation'=>'Batalake Gawé Tiket Manèh','Cancel all confirmed and pending bookings automatically.'=>'Mbatalaké kabèh pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi lan sing ngenténi kanthi otomatis.','Cancel bookings?'=>'Mbatalaké pemesanan?','Cancelation complete'=>'Pembatalan rampung','Cancelation error'=>'Kesalahan pembatalan','Cancelation in progress'=>'Pembatalan lagi diproses','Canceling...'=>'Lagi mbatalake...','Cancellation'=>'Pembatalan','Cancellation Actions'=>'Tindakan Pambatalan','Cancellations'=>'Pembatalan','Cancellations are not permitted for this booking.'=>'Pembatalan ora diolèhaké kanggo pemesanan iki.','Cancelled'=>'Dibatalake','Cancelled event email'=>'Email acara dibatalake','Cannot create a Archetype CPT name %s, this must be at most 20 characters long, containing letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Ora bisa nggawé jeneng CPT Archetype %s, kudu paling dawa 20 karakter, namung ngemot hurup, angka, tanda minus, lan garis ngisor.','Canvas tabs'=>'Tab kanvas','Categories'=>'Kategori','Categories dropdown label'=>'Label dropdown kategori','Categories list page'=>'Kācā dhaptar kategori','Category'=>'Kategori','Category IDs'=>'ID Kategori','Category Related Placeholders'=>'Placeholder Related Kategori','Category pages'=>'Kācā kategori','Category:'=>'Kategori:','Change'=>'Ganti','Changed timeslots get %s'=>'Slot wektu sing diowahi bakal %s','Changes a booking status, such as approving, rejecting, or cancelling it.'=>'Ngowahi status pemesanan, kayata nyetujoni, nolak, utawa mbatalaké.','Changes saved'=>'Owahan disimpen','Changes saved.'=>'Owahan kasimpen.','Changing the location of this event will delete its %s meeting or broadcast, and anyone holding the old link will no longer be able to join.'=>'Ngowahi lokasi acara iki bakal mbusak rapat utawa siaran %s, lan sapa waé sing nyekel pranala lawas ora bisa melu manèh.','Chart Options'=>'Opsi Grafik','Chart Type'=>'Tipe Grafik','Check Dev Versions'=>'Priksa Versi Dev','Check attendees in at the door by scanning tickets, manage events and bookings, and follow booking and sales status from your phone. Available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad. Included with Pro Plus, or available by subscription for any Events Manager site.'=>'Cek-in peserta ing lawang kanthi mindai tiket, kelola acara lan pemesanan, lan pantau status pemesanan lan dodolan saka ponsel sampeyan. Kasedhiya ing App Store kanggo iPhone lan iPad. Kalebu ing Pro Plus, utawa kasedhiya kanthi langganan kanggo situs Events Manager apa waé.','Check this option if you want the event contact to receive an email when someone books places. An email will be sent when a booking is first made (regardless if confirmed or pending)'=>'Centhang pilihan iki yèn sampéyan péngin kontak acara nampa email nalika ana wong mesen panggonan. Email dikirim nalika pemesanan pisanan digawé (ora preduli wis dikonfirmasi utāwā ngenteni)','Check this option if you want to prevent the WordPress registration email from going out when a user anonymously books an event.'=>'Centhang pilihan iki yèn sampéyan péngin nyegah email registrasi WordPress dikirim nalika panganggo mesen acara kanthi anonim.','Check this option to enable Google Map integration.'=>'Centhang pilihan iki kanggo ngaktifaké integrasi Google Map.','Checking for dev versions.'=>'Mriksa versi dev.','Checking for the latest stable version.'=>'Mriksa versi stabil paling anyar.','Checking...'=>'Mriksa...','Checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release, skipping the staggered rollout delay (which can take up to 24 hours). Any newer stable version will appear on your Plugins or Updates page for a manual update.'=>'Mriksa WordPress.org langsung kanggo rilis stabil paling anyar, nglewati wektu tundha peluncuran bertahap (sing bisa nganti 24 jam). Versi stabil sing luwih anyar bakal katon ing kācā Plugin utawa Nganyari sampéyan kanggo nganyari manual.','Choose a color for your %s. You can access this using the %s placeholder.'=>'Pilih kelir kanggo %s sampéyan. Sampéyan bisa ngakses iki nganggo placeholder %s.','Choose a settings file saved from a backup or another Events Manager installation and click the \'%s\' button.'=>'Pilih berkas setélan sing disimpen saka serep utawa instalasi Events Manager liyané lan klik tombol \'%s\'.','Choose an image for your %s, which can be displayed using the %s placeholder.'=>'Pilih gambar kanggo %s sampéyan, sing bisa ditampilaké nganggo placeholder %s.','Choose another file'=>'Pilih berkas liya','Choose from most used %s'=>'Pilih saka %s sing paling sering dienggo','Choose from most used event categories'=>'Pilih saka kategori acara sing paling sering dienggo','Choose from most used event tags'=>'Pilih saka tenger acara sing paling sering dienggo','Choose graph type and stacking view options. Some views and stacking may not be available for all setting combinations.'=>'Pilih tipe grafik lan opsi tampilan tumpukan. Sawetara tampilan lan tumpukan mbok menawa ora kasedhiya kanggo kabeh kombinasi setelan.','Choose how prices are displayed. <code>@</code> will be replaced by the currency symbol, and <code>#</code> will be replaced by the number.'=>'Pilih cara rega ditampilaké. <code>@</code> bakal diganti simbol mata uang, lan <code>#</code> bakal diganti angka.','Choose how timeslots are listed in booking forms for recurring events and events with multiple timeslots.'=>'Pilih cara slot wektu didhaptar ing formulir pemesanan kanggo acara bola-balik lan acara sing nduwé pirang-pirang slot wektu.','Choose how to format your group heading dates. Leave blank for default.'=>'Pilihen carané ngatur format tanggal irah-irahan klompok. Kosongaké kanggo gawan.','Choose how to format your group headings.'=>'Pilihen carané ngatur format irah-irahan klompok.','Choose how to show a information about an event when clicking or hovering over a single event on the calendar.'=>'Pilihen carané nampilaké informasi bab acara nalika ngeklik utāwā ngarahaké kursor ing siji acara ing tanggalan.','Choose the start date for comparing equivalent date ranges. The latest comparison end date is day before main duration start date.'=>'Pilih tanggal wiwitan kanggo mbandhingake rentang tanggal sing padha. Tanggal pungkasan pambandhingan paling anyar yaiku sedina sadurunge tanggal wiwitan durasi utama.','Choose to show events within a specific time range.'=>'Pilih kanggo nuduhake acara ing rentang wektu tartamtu.','Choose what to show users on their booking management page.'=>'Pilih apa sing ditampilaké marang panganggo ing kācā pangaturan pemesanané.','Choose whether or not to display a login form in the booking form area to remind your members to log in before booking.'=>'Pilih apa arep nampilaké formulir mlebu log ing area formulir pemesanan kanggo ngélingaké anggota sampéyan supaya mlebu log sadurungé mesen.','Choose whether to display the main search bar. If disabled, advanced search fields will be shown in \'Inline\' mode automatically. You must also choose to enable at least one advanced search field, to avoid having an emtpy search form.'=>'Pilihen apa bilah nggoleki utama arep ditampilaké. Yèn dinonaktifaké, kolom nggoleki tutug bakal katon kanthi otomatis ing mode \'Inline\'. Sampéyan uga kudu ngaktifaké paling ora siji kolom nggoleki tutug, supaya formulir nggoleki ora kothong.','Choose whether to show a preview of the upcoming events for the date clicked on, or directly link to the calendar day.'=>'Pilihen apa arep nampilaké pratinjau acara sing bakal teka kanggo tanggal sing diklik, utāwā sautaké langsung menyang dinā tanggalan.','Choose which %s account hosts this event.'=>'Pilih akun %s endi sing dadi tuan rumah acara iki.','Choose which order your tickets appear.'=>'Pilih urutan tampilan tiket sampéyan.','Choose your currency for displaying event pricing.'=>'Pilih mata uang sampéyan kanggo nampilaké rega acara.','Choose/Upload Image'=>'Pilih/Ngunggah Gambar','City'=>'Kutha','City/Town'=>'Kuthā/Kutha','City/Town:'=>'Kuthā/Kitha:','Classic Editor'=>'Tukang ndandani Klasik','Clear All'=>'Resiki Kabèh','Click the button below to mass-convert all your repeating events into recurring events.'=>'Klik tombol ing ngisor iki kanggo ngowahi massal kabèh acara bola-balik sampéyan dadi acara pengulangan.','Click to toggle'=>'Klik kanggo ngganti','Clicking these buttons will not have any effect until you save your settings!'=>'Ngeklik tombol-tombol iki ora bakal ana pangaruhé nganti sampéyan nyimpen setélan!','Close Ticket Editor'=>'Tutup Editor Tiket','Collapse All'=>'Nyusutaké Kabèh','Color'=>'Kelir','Column %d'=>'Kolom %d','Column in the file'=>'Kolom ing berkas','Columns for repeating events'=>'Kolom kanggo acara bola-balik','Columns to choose'=>'Kolom sing bisa dipilih','Columns to export'=>'Kolom sing diekspor','Columns to show'=>'Kolom sing katon','Comma-separated address(es) notified of each withdrawal for manual review. Leave blank to use the site admin email.'=>'Alamat sing dipisah koma sing dikabari saben ana pambatalan kanggo ditinjau kanthi manual. Kosongna kanggo nganggo email admin situs.','Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions: %s. Leave blank to allow any.'=>'Dhaptar ekstensi berkas sing diidinake, dipisahake koma: %s. Kosongake kanggo ngidinake apa wae.','Comment'=>'Pangalembana','Communications Consent'=>'Persetujuan Komunikasi','Compare With'=>'Bandhingake Karo','Compare features'=>'Bandhingaké fitur','Compared to'=>'Dibandhingake karo','Configure the base settings for your events. These settings affect how events are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Konfigurasiknā setélan dhasar kanggo acara sampéyan. Setélan iki mengaruhi cara acara disimpen lan diakses ing basis data.','Configure the base settings for your locations. These settings affect how locations are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Konfigurasiknā setélan dhasar kanggo lokasi sampéyan. Setélan iki mengaruhi cara lokasi disimpen lan diakses ing basis data.','Confirm'=>'Konfirmasi','Confirm button'=>'Tombol konfirmasi','Confirmation email could not be sent to admin. Registrant should have gotten their email (only admin see this warning).'=>'Email konfirmasi ora bisa dikirim marang admin. Pendaftar mesthiné wis nampa emailé (mung admin sing weruh pènget iki).','Confirmations'=>'Konfirmasi','Confirmed'=>'Wis Dikonfirmasi','Confirmed Spaces'=>'Panggonan sing Wis Dikonfirmasi','Confirmed booking email'=>'Email pemesanan wis dikonfirmasi','Congratulations! Your email settings work.'=>'Selamat! Setelan email sampeyan makarya.','Connect'=>'Sambungake','Connect Events Manager to MCP-compatible AI clients (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) by exposing Events Manager Abilities through the WordPress MCP Adapter. Clients authenticate through a one-click consent screen and a refreshable Application Password — no manual key juggling.'=>'Sambungaké Events Manager menyang klien AI sing cocog karo MCP (Claude, Cursor, konektor kustom ChatGPT, VS Code, Codex) kanthi mbukak Kemampuan Events Manager liwat WordPress MCP Adapter. Klien ngotentikasi liwat layar persetujuan sak klik lan Application Password sing bisa dianyari, tanpa ngurusi kunci sacara manual.','Connect a %s account in the Events Manager settings before using it as an event location.'=>'Sambungaké akun %s ing setélan Events Manager sadurungé dienggo minangka lokasi acara.','Connect an account'=>'Sambungaké akun','Connect to import events and locations from %s.'=>'Sambung kanggo ngimpor acara lan lokasi saka %s.','Consent'=>'Persetujuan','Consent %s on %s'=>'Persetujuan %s ing %s','Consent Error'=>'Kesalahan Persetujuan','Consent Text'=>'Teks Persetujuan','Consent previously %s on %s'=>'Persetujuan sakdurungé %s ing %s','Consented By Default'=>'Wis Setuju Kanthi Gawan','Contact a site administrator for your password.'=>'Hubungi admin situs kanggo njaluk sandhi sampéyan.','Content supplied within shortcode tags and the %s parameters will be HTML entity-decoded and sanitized.'=>'Isi sing disadhiyakaké ing jero tag shortcode lan parameter %s bakal didekode saka HTML entity lan disanitasi.','Content supplied within shortcode tags like %s will be HTML entity-decoded.'=>'Isi sing disadhiyakaké ing jero tag shortcode kaya %s bakal didekode saka HTML entity.','Control how subsites use Archetypes. Define network-wide types here and decide whether subsites can create, choose, or must use your list. You can also allow/deny renaming specific base settings.'=>'Kontrol cara subsitus nggunakaké Archetype. Temtokaké tipe sak jaringan ing kéné lan putusaké apa subsitus bisa nggawé, milih, utawa kudu nggunakaké dhaptar sampéyan. Sampéyan uga bisa ngidinaké/nolak ngganti jeneng setélan dhasar tartamtu.','Controls how many events being held at a location are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Ngatur pira acara sing dianakaké ing sawijining lokasi katampilaké saben kācā nalika nganggo placeholder kaya %s. Kosongaké yèn tanpa watesan.','Controls how many events belonging to a category are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Ngatur pira acara ing sawijining kategori katampilaké saben kācā nalika nganggo placeholder kaya %s. Kosongaké yèn tanpa watesan.','Controls how many events belonging to a tag are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Ngatur pira acara ing sawijining tenger katampilaké saben kācā nalika nganggo placeholder kaya %s. Kosongaké yèn tanpa watesan.','Convert ALL Repeating Events'=>'Owahi KABEH Acara Baleni','Convert Recurring'=>'Ngowahi Bola-balik','Convert and Deactivate Repeating Events'=>'Owahi lan Nonaktifake Acara Bola-balik','Coordinates'=>'Koordinat','Copies your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %s into Events Manager. Nothing in the original plugin is changed or deleted, so you can run this, check the result, and roll it back or run it again.'=>'Nyalin data %s sampeyan menyang Events Manager. Ora ana sing ing plugin asli diowahi utawa dibusak, mula sampeyan bisa mbukak iki, mriksa asilé, lan mbatalaké utawa mbukak manèh.','Copy default value'=>'Salin nilai gawan','Copy over our new v6 formats to make the best of our new UI design!'=>'Salin format v6 anyar kita supaya bisa nggunakake desain UI anyar kita kanthi maksimal!','Cost'=>'Biaya','Could not check event validation. Saving without pre-check — please verify the event details.'=>'Ora bisa mriksa validasi acara. Disimpen tanpa pamriksa awal, mangga priksa katrangan acara.','Could not open the PDF file for inspection.'=>'Ora bisa mbukak berkas PDF kanggo diperiksa.','Could not open the file for inspection.'=>'Ora bisa mbukak berkas kanggo diperiksa.','Could not read image size information.'=>'Ora bisa maca informasi ukuran gambar.','Count'=>'Jumlah','Country'=>'Negara','Coupons and discount codes'=>'Kupon lan kode diskon','Create %s'=>'Gawé %s','Create Zoom meetings and webinars from the event editor, and register attendees on Zoom when they book. With Pro, attendees are registered once they pay and receive their own join links.'=>'Gawé rapat lan webinar Zoom saka tukang ndandani acara, lan daftaraké peserta ing Zoom nalika padha mesen. Nganggo Pro, peserta didaftaraké sawisé mayar lan nampa pranala melu dhéwé-dhéwé.','Create a location or start typing to search a previously created location.'=>'Gawé lokasi utawa wiwiti ngetik kanggo nggolèki lokasi sing wis digawé sadurungé.','Create booking'=>'Gawé pemesanan','Create event'=>'Gawé acara','Create event ticket'=>'Gawé tiket acara','Create location'=>'Gawé lokasi','Creates a ticket for an Events Manager event.'=>'Nggawé tiket kanggo acara Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Nggawé %s Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager booking. Call get-booking-requirements first to get this event\'s required fields, payload locations, and an example payload.'=>'Nggawé pemesanan Events Manager. Celuken get-booking-requirements dhisik kanggo olèh kolom sing dibutuhaké acara iki, panggonan payload, lan conto payload.','Creates an Events Manager event.'=>'Nggawé acara Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager location.'=>'Nggawé lokasi Events Manager.','Currency'=>'Mata Uang','Currency Format'=>'Format Mata Uang','Currency code'=>'Kode mata uang','Currency position (prefix or suffix)'=>'Posisi mata uang (prefix utawa suffix)','Currency symbol'=>'Simbol mata uang','Currently overridden by the EM_GUTENBERG constant in wp-config.php (%s).'=>'Saiki ditimpa déning konstanta EM_GUTENBERG ing wp-config.php (%s).','Custom Dates'=>'Tanggal Kustom','Custom Link'=>'Pranala Khusus','Custom Links'=>'Pranala Khusus','Custom booking forms and individual attendee forms'=>'Formulir pemesanan khusus lan formulir peserta individu','Custom fields are the same as attributes, except you cannot restrict specific values, users can add any kind of custom field name/value pair. Only available in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Ros racikan padha karo atribut, kajaba sampéyan ora bisa mbatesi nilai tartamtu, panganggo bisa nambah pasangan jeneng/nilai ros racikan apa waé. Mung sumadya ing area admin WordPress.','Customize Feedback Messages'=>'Natani Pesen Umpanbalik','Customize the format of the selected search dates, we recommend a brief format to keep things short.'=>'Setélen format tanggal panggolékan sing dipilih, kita nyaranaké format sing ringkes supaya cendhak.','Customize the message your user sees when they resubmit/update their event.'=>'Natani pesen sing katon kanggo panganggo nalika ngirim manèh/nganyaraké acarané.','Customize the message your user sees when they submitted their event.'=>'Natani pesen sing katon kanggo panganggo sawisé ngirim acarané.','Customizer'=>'Pengracik','Daily'=>'Saben dina','Database Cleanup'=>'Resiké Basis Data','Date'=>'Tanggal','Date Format'=>'Format Tanggal','Date Picker Format'=>'Format Pamilih Tanggal','Date Preview Mode'=>'Mode Pratinjau Tanggal','Date Separator'=>'Pamisah Tanggal','Date and Time'=>'Tanggal lan Wektu','Date and Time formats follow the <a href="%s">WordPress time formatting conventions</a>'=>'Format tanggal lan wektu ngetutaké <a href="%s">kaidah format wektu WordPress</a>','Date and time'=>'Tanggal lan wektu','Date/Time'=>'Tanggal/Wektu','Dates'=>'Tanggal','Dates must have correct formatting. Please use the date picker provided.'=>'Tanggal kudu nganggo format sing bener. Mangga nganggo pamilih tanggal sing disadyakaké.','Dates such as 2027-03-04 or March 4, 2027 are always read the same way.'=>'Tanggal kayata 2027-03-04 utawa March 4, 2027 tansah diwaca kanthi cara sing padha.','Dates written as numbers'=>'Tanggal sing ditulis nganggo angka','Day %d'=>'Dina %d','Day first: 03/04/2027 is April 3'=>'Dina dhisik: 03/04/2027 yaiku 3 April','Days of week'=>'Dina ing minggu','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have requested #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Your booking is currently pending approval by our administrators. Once approved you will receive an automatic confirmation.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Yth. #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Sampéyan wis njaluk #_BOOKINGSPACES panggonan kanggo #_EVENTNAME.<br/>Kapan : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Ing endi : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Pemesanan sampéyan saiki lagi ngenteni persetujuan saka administrator kita. Sawisé disetujoni, sampéyan bakal éntuk konfirmasi otomatis.<br/>Kanthi hormat,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have successfully reserved #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Yth. #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Sampéyan wis kasil nyimpen #_BOOKINGSPACES panggonan kanggo #_EVENTNAME.<br/>Kapan : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Ing endi : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Kanthi hormat,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Yth. #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Pemesanan sing sampéyan jaluk kanggo #_BOOKINGSPACES panggonan ing #_EVENTNAME tanggal #_EVENTDATES wis dibatalake.<br/>Kanthi hormat,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been rejected.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Yth. #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Pemesanan sing sampéyan jaluk kanggo #_BOOKINGSPACES panggonan ing #_EVENTNAME tanggal #_EVENTDATES wis ditolak.<br/>Kanthi hormat,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear %s'=>'Yth. %s','Dear Guest, <br/>We regret to inform you that #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Yth. Tamu, <br/>Kanthi getun kita ngabarake yèn #_EVENTNAME tanggal #_EVENTDATES wis dibatalake.<br/>Kanthi hormat,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'Titik Desimal','Decode shortcode content?'=>'Dekode isi shortcode?','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'Dekode parameter format shortcode?','Default'=>'Gawan','Default %s color'=>'Kelir %s gawan','Default %s list format'=>'Format dhaptar %s gawan','Default %s list options'=>'Pilihan dhaptar %s gawan','Default (site setting)'=>'Gawan (setélan situs)','Default Category'=>'Kategori Gawan','Default Country'=>'Negara Gawan','Default List Scope'=>'Jangkauan Dhaptar Gawan','Default Location'=>'Lokasi Gawan','Default Location Country'=>'Negara Lokasi Gawan','Default Timezone'=>'Zona Wektu Gawan','Default View'=>'Tontonan Gawan','Default archive ordering'=>'Urutan arsip gawan','Default calendar size'=>'Ukuran tanggalan gawan','Default distance'=>'Jarak gawan','Default distance unit'=>'Satuan jarak gawan','Default event archive ordering'=>'Urutan arsip acara gawan','Default event list format'=>'Format daftar acara gawan','Default event list format footer'=>'Sikil format daftar acara gawan','Default event list format header'=>'Sesirahan format daftar acara gawan','Default event list ordering'=>'Urutan daftar acara gawan','Default event style'=>'Gagrag acara gawan','Default font family'=>'Jeneng Famili Fon gawan','Default list ordering'=>'Urutan dhaptar gawan','Default map height'=>'Dhuwuré peta gawan','Default map width'=>'Ambané peta gawan','Default plugin setting'=>'Setélan plugin gawan','Default scope to show your events in shortcodes, widgets and any other displays where scope is not defined. Events page and archive scopes can be defined in the %s settings section.'=>'Jangkauan gawan kanggo nuduhake acara sampéyan ing shortcode, widget lan tampilan liyané sing jangkauané durung ditemtokaké. Jangkauan kācā acara lan arsip bisa ditemtokaké ing bagéan setélan %s.','Default: %s'=>'Gawan: %s','Delete'=>'Ngilangi','Delete %s'=>'Busak %s','Delete User'=>'Busak Panganggo','Delete booking'=>'Busak pemesanan','Delete event'=>'Busak acara','Delete everything migrated from %s (events, locations, tickets, bookings, terms) and restore converted content? The original data is not affected.'=>'Busak kabeh sing dipindhah saka %s (acara, lokasi, tiket, pemesanan, istilah) lan pulihaké konten sing wis diowahi? Data asli ora kena pengaruh.','Delete everything the import of %s created (events, locations, organizers, categories, tags and downloaded images)? Items that were already on the site are not affected.'=>'Busak kabèh sing digawe dening impor %s (acara, lokasi, panyelenggara, kategori, tetenger lan gambar sing diundhuh)? Item sing wis ana ing situs ora kena pengaruh.','Delete location'=>'Busak lokasi','Delete selected'=>'Busak sing kepilih','Delete ticket'=>'Busak tiket','Deleted'=>'Dibusak','Deletes an Events Manager %s.'=>'Mbusak %s Events Manager.','Deletes an Events Manager ticket if it has no bookings.'=>'Mbusak tiket Events Manager yèn ora ana pemesanané.','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager event.'=>'Mbusak utawa mbuwang acara Events Manager menyang kranjang runtah.','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager location.'=>'Mbusak utawa mbuwang lokasi Events Manager menyang kranjang runtah.','Depending on server settings, some sending methods may ignore this settings.'=>'Gumantung setelan server, sawetara cara ngirim bisa nglirwakake setelan iki.','Depending on the nature of your site, you will be subject to one or more national and international privacy/data protection laws such as the %s. Below are some options that you can use to tailor how Events Manager interacts with WordPress privacy tools.'=>'Gumantung sipat situs sampéyan, sampéyan bakal kena siji utawa luwih hukum privasi/pangayoman data nasional lan internasional kayata %s. Ing ngisor ana sawetara pilihan sing bisa sampéyan enggo kanggo nyetel cara Events Manager sesambungan karo piranti privasi WordPress.','Descending'=>'Mudhun','Description'=>'Katrangan','Detach'=>'Dicopot','Details'=>'Detil','Details about the event.'=>'Detil bab acara.','Details about the location.'=>'Katrangan babagan lokasi.','Detect User Country'=>'Deteksi Negara Panganggo','Dev Mode active: Just a friendly reminder that you are updating to development versions. Only admins see this message, and it will go away when you disable this <a href="#pro-api">here</a> in your settings.'=>'Mode Dev aktif: Mung pangeling yen sampeyan lagi nganyari menyang versi pangembangan. Mung admin sing weruh pesen iki, lan bakal ilang yen sampeyan mareni iki <a href="#pro-api">ing kene</a> ing setelan sampeyan.','Development Versions &amp; Updates'=>'Versi Pangembangan &amp; Nganyari','Difference from the price paid at the time of sale'=>'Bedane karo rega sing dibayar nalika dodolan','Direct Link'=>'Pranālā Langsung','Disable'=>'Nonaktifake','Disable  WordPress Thumbnails?'=>'Nonaktifaké Miniatur WordPress?','Disable %s'=>'Nonaktifake %s','Disable new registration email?'=>'Nonaktifake email registrasi anyar?','Disable thumbnails?'=>'Nonaktifaké miniatur?','Disable title rewriting?'=>'Nonaktifaké panulisan ulang judul?','Disabled'=>'Dinonaktifaké','Disconnect'=>'Pedhot','Disconnect All'=>'Medhot Kabèh','Discounts (After Taxes)'=>'Diskon (Sawise Pajeg)','Discounts Before Taxes'=>'Diskon Sadurunge Pajeg','Dismiss'=>'Ilangi','Dismiss Message'=>'Ilangi Pesen','Disonnect'=>'Medhot','Display %s as'=>'Tuduhaké %s minangka','Display %s on your blog.'=>'Tampilaké %s ing blog sampéyan.','Display Settings'=>'Setelan Tampilan','Display Status'=>'Tampilaké Status','Display a geolocation search textbox which syncs with the main search geolocation box (if enabled).'=>'Tampilaké kothak teks panggolékan geolokasi sing disinkronaké karo kothak geolokasi panggolékan utama (yèn diaktifaké).','Display a list of event locations on Events Manager.'=>'Tampilake daftar lokasi acara ing Events Manager.','Display a list of events on Events Manager.'=>'Tampilake daftar acara ing Events Manager.','Display a prominent "Withdraw from contract" link in the site footer, since the law expects the function to be continuously and easily reachable.'=>'Tampilaké pranālā "Mbatalake kontrak" sing gampang katon ing sikil kācā situs, amarga hukum ngarepaké fungsi iki bisa diakses terus-terusan lan gampang.','Display booking summary?'=>'Tampilaké ringkesan pemesanan?','Display calendar in events page?'=>'Tuduhaké tanggalan ing kācā acara?','Display events on your blog.'=>'Tudhuhaké acara ing blog sampéyan.','Display free booking summary?'=>'Tampilaké ringkesan pemesanan gratis?','Display global %s on main blog?'=>'Tampilake %s global ing blog utama?','Display global events on main blog?'=>'Tampilake acara global ing blog utama?','Display locations on your blog.'=>'Tudhuhaké lokasi ing blog sampéyan.','Display login form?'=>'Tampilaké formulir mlebu log?','Display on Frontend'=>'Tampilaké ing Frontend','Display on WP Dashboard'=>'Tampilaké ing Dasbor WP','Display on bookings dashboard'=>'Katonaké ing dasbor pemesanan','Display on event bookings admin'=>'Katonaké ing admin pemesanan acara','Display only locations with upcoming events.'=>'Tudhuhaké mung lokasi sing ana acara sing bakal teka.','Display subsection titles above groups of line items, such as taxes, discounts and surcharges.'=>'Tampilaké judhul subbagéan ing ndhuwur klompok item baris, kayata pajeg, diskon lan biaya tambahan.','Display subsection titles?'=>'Tampilaké judhul subbagéan?','Display taxes separately?'=>'Tampilaké pajeg kanthi kapisah?','Display the booking summary if the event is free. If there are any available tickets worth more than 0 then the event is not considered free.'=>'Tampilaké ringkesan pemesanan yèn acara gratis. Yèn ana tiket sumadya sing regane luwih saka 0 banjur acara ora dianggep gratis.','Display the number of available spaces (or booking status if full/closed/cancelled) in each timeslot button or dropdown option.'=>'Tampilaké cacahé panggonan sumadya (utawa status pemesanan yèn kebak/ditutup/dibatalake) ing saben tombol slot wektu utawa opsi dropdown.','Display the timeslot date as well as the time when viewing a specific calendar day.'=>'Tampilaké tanggal slot wektu uga wektuné nalika ndeleng dinā tanggalan tartamtu.','Display ticket prices without tax and calculate the tax total separately.'=>'Tampilaké rega tiket tanpa pajeg lan etung total pajeg kanthi kapisah.','Display your events in a calendar widget.'=>'Tampilake acara sampéyan ing widget tanggalan.','Displaying %1$s&#8211;%2$s of %3$s'=>'Nuduhaké %1$s&#8211;%2$s saka %3$s','Displays %s from all sites on the network by default. You can still restrict %s by blog using shortcodes and template tags coupled with the <code>blog</code> attribute. Requires global tables to be turned on.'=>'Nampilake %s saka kabeh situs ing jaringan kanthi gawan. Sampeyan isih bisa mbatesi %s miturut blog nganggo shortcode lan tag cithakan bebarengan karo atribut <code>blog</code>. Mbutuhake tabel global diaktifake.','Displays a booking summary including itemized subtotals, taxes, discounts, surcharges and totals where applicable.'=>'Nampilaké ringkesan pemesanan kalebu subtotal rinci, pajeg, diskon, biaya tambahan lan total yèn ana.','Distance Values'=>'Nilai Jarak','Do not import'=>'Aja diimpor','Do not include'=>'Aja disertakaké','Do you already have an account with us? %s'=>'Apa sampéyan wis duwé akun karo kita? %s','Document'=>'Dokumen','Documentation'=>'Dokumentasi','Don\'t have it? Leave this blank and we\'ll email you a secure link to choose your booking.'=>'Ora duwé? Kosongna kolom iki lan kita bakal ngirim pranālā aman menyang email sampéyan kanggo milih pemesanan sampéyan.','Download %s'=>'Undhuh %s','Download featured images given as web addresses'=>'Undhuh gambar unggulan sing diwènèhaké minangka alamat web','Draft'=>'Orèt-orètan','Drafts'=>'Konsep','Dropdown Selection'=>'Pilihan Dropdown','Due to how we change how this custom taxonomy is displayed when overriding with formats it is strongly advised that you assign a %s page below, which increases compatibility with various plugins and themes.'=>'Amarga cara kita ngowahi tampilan taksonomi kustom iki nalika ditimpa nganggo format, disaranaké banget sampéyan nemtokaké kācā %s ing ngisor, supaya luwih cocog karo macem-macem plugin lan tema.','Duplicate'=>'Duplikat','Duplicate %s'=>'Duplikaten %s','Duplicate this event'=>'Gandhakaké acara iki','Duplicating Events and Locations has been disabled by Events Manager, to avoid breaking data. You can use our Events Manager duplication features instead.'=>'Nggandakaké Acara lan Lokasi wis dinonaktifaké déning Events Manager, supaya data ora rusak. Sampéyan bisa nganggo fitur panggandhaan Events Manager.','Duration'=>'Durasi','During'=>'Sajrone','E-mail'=>'E-mail','E-mail: %s'=>'E-mail: %s','ERROR : Email Not Sent.'=>'KESALAHAN: Email ora kekirim.','Each event can have its own timezone if enabled. If set to no, then all newly created events will have the blog timezone, which currently is set to %s'=>'Saben acara bisa nduwèni zona wektu dhéwé yèn diaktifaké. Yèn diset ora, kabèh acara anyar bakal nganggo zona wektu blog, sing saiki diset menyang %s','Earlier Dates'=>'Tanggal Sadurunge','Edit'=>'Edit','Edit %s'=>'Edit %s','Edit Booking'=>'Edit Pemesanan','Edit Details'=>'Edit Detil','Edit Event'=>'Sunting Acara','Edit Event Category'=>'Nyunting Kategori Acara','Edit Event Tag'=>'Nyunting Tenger Acara','Edit Location'=>'Sunting Lokasi','Edit Recurring Event'=>'Nyunting Acara Bola-balik','Edit Repeating Event'=>'Nyunting Acara Bola-balik','Edit User'=>'Sunting Panganggo','Edit events'=>'Sunting acara','Edit location'=>'Edit lokasi','Edit locations'=>'Sunting lokasi','Edit/View'=>'Nyunting/Mirsani','Editor'=>'Tukang ndandani','Email'=>'Email','Email Address'=>'Alamat Email','Email Exists'=>'Email Wis Ana','Email Message'=>'Pesen Email','Email Sent.'=>'Email wis dikirim.','Email Settings'=>'Setelan Email','Email Subject'=>'Subyek Email','Email address'=>'Alamat email','Email event owner?'=>'Kirim email menyang pemilik acara?','Email events admin?'=>'Kirim email menyang admin acara?','Email not sent.'=>'Email ora dikirim.','Email sent successfully to %s'=>'Email kasil dikirim menyang %s','Email: %s'=>'Email: %s','Emails'=>'Email','Embed Display Type'=>'Tipe Tampilan Embed','Enable'=>'Aktifake','Enable %s'=>'Aktifake %s','Enable %s attributes?'=>'Aktifaké atribut %s?','Enable %s custom fields?'=>'Aktifaké ros racikan %s?','Enable All Styling?'=>'Aktifaké Kabèh Gagrag?','Enable Archives?'=>'Aktifaké Arsip?','Enable Code Editor for Formats'=>'Aktifaké Editor Kode kanggo Format','Enable Comments?'=>'Aktifaké Pangalembānā?','Enable Dev Updates?'=>'Aktifake Nganyari Dev?','Enable Event Dynamic Timeslots?'=>'Aktifaké Slot Wektu Dinamis Acara?','Enable Event Status?'=>'Aktifaké Status Acara?','Enable Event Timeslots?'=>'Aktifaké Slot Wektu Acara?','Enable Google Maps integration?'=>'Aktifaké integrasi Google Maps?','Enable No-User Booking Mode?'=>'Aktifake Mode Pemesanan Tanpa Panganggo?','Enable Theme Styling?'=>'Aktifaké Gagrag Tema?','Enable Timezone Support?'=>'Aktifaké Dhukungan Zona Wektu?','Enable Visual Uploader'=>'Aktifake Pangunggah Visual','Enable a code/syntax highlighter when clicking on the larger formatting textbox options below, for easier editing of larger HTML parts.'=>'Aktifaké panyorot kode/sintaks nalika ngeklik pilihan kothak teks format sing luwih gedhé ing ngisor iki, supaya luwih gampang ndandani bagéan HTML sing gedhé.','Enable a modern visual uploader UI.'=>'Aktifake UI pangunggah visual modern.','Enable advanced fields?'=>'Aktifaké kolom tutug?','Enable bookings?'=>'Aktifaké pemesanan?','Enable categories?'=>'Aktifaké kategori?','Enable custom event archetypes?'=>'Aktifake archetype acara racikan?','Enable custom ticket ordering?'=>'Aktifake urutan tiket racikan?','Enable global tables mode?'=>'Aktifake mode tabel global?','Enable locations?'=>'Aktifaké lokasi?','Enable multiple file uploads by default.'=>'Aktifake unggahan pirang-pirang berkas kanthi gawan.','Enable or disable each notification type. The event/item owner and managers can further control their own preferences from the mobile app.'=>'Aktifaké utawa nonaktifaké saben tipe kabar. Sing nduwèni acara/item lan manajer bisa ngatur preferensi dhéwé saka aplikasi seluler.','Enable organizers?'=>'Aktifake panyelenggara?','Enable push notifications?'=>'Aktifaké kabar push?','Enable recurrence?'=>'Aktifaké pengulangan?','Enable registration for this event'=>'Aktifake pendaftaran kanggo acara iki','Enable repeated events?'=>'Aktifaké acara bola-balik?','Enable right-of-withdrawal button?'=>'Aktifaké tombol hak mbatalake?','Enable tags?'=>'Aktifaké tetenger?','Enabled'=>'Diaktifaké','Enabled (off by default)'=>'Diaktifaké (mati kanthi gawan)','Enabled (on by default)'=>'Diaktifaké (urip kanthi gawan)','Enables additional advanced search fields such as dates, country, etc.'=>'Ngaktifaké kolom nggoleki tutug tambahan kayata tanggal, negara, lsp.','Enabling this will prevent us from loading our CSS file on every page, and will only load on specific pages generated by Events Manager.'=>'Ngaktifaké iki bakal nyegah kita mbukak berkas CSS ing saben kācā, lan mung bakal dimuat ing kācā tartamtu sing digawé déning Events Manager.','Encryption is always recommended if your SMTP server supports it. If your server supports TLS, this is also the most recommended method.'=>'Enkripsi tansah dianjurake yen server SMTP sampeyan ndhukung. Yen server sampeyan ndhukung TLS, iki uga cara sing paling dianjurake.','End'=>'Rampung','End Date'=>'Tanggal Pungkasan','End Time'=>'Wektu Pungkasan','End date'=>'Tanggal pungkasan','End time'=>'Wektu pungkasan','End time is required.'=>'Wektu rampung kudu diisi.','Ends in %s'=>'Rampung ing %s','Enjoying Events Manager? Help Us Improve!'=>'Seneng nganggo Events Manager? Bantu Kita Nambah Apik!','Enter a maximum number of spaces (required).'=>'Lebokna jumlah maksimal panggonan (kudu).','Enter a number.'=>'Lebokna angka.','Enter a ticket name.'=>'Lebokna jeneng tiket.','Enter the number of hours before an event starts for when users can cancel a booking. Leave blank for the start time of the event.'=>'Lebokna cacahé jam sadurungé acara diwiwiti nalika panganggo isih bisa mbatalaké pemesanan. Kosongké kanggo wektu wiwitan acara.','Enter your booking reference and email to withdraw. No account or login is required.'=>'Lebokna referensi pemesanan lan email sampéyan kanggo mundur. Ora perlu akun utawa mlebu.','Error mailing user'=>'Kesalahan ngirim email marang panganggo','Error uploading file, please try again!'=>'Kaluputan nalika ngunggah berkas, coba manèh!','Errors'=>'Kesalahan','Event'=>'Acara','Event Admin Emails'=>'Email Admin Acara','Event Admin/Owner Emails'=>'Email Admin/Pemilik Acara','Event Approved'=>'Acara Disetujoni','Event Bookings Dashboard'=>'Dasbor Pemesanan Acara','Event Cancellation'=>'Pembatalan Acara','Event Categories'=>'Kategori Acara','Event Category'=>'Kategori Acara','Event Date(s)'=>'Tanggal Acara','Event Dates'=>'Tanggal Acara','Event Dates '=>'Tanggal Acara ','Event Details'=>'Detil Acara','Event Edit 