abeh blog wis disetel ulang menyang %s.','Event title format'=>'Format judul acara','Event tooltip preview format'=>'Format pratinjau tooltip acara','Event tooltips format'=>'Format tooltip acara','Event website'=>'Situs web acara','Event.'=>'Acara.','Event/Location admin pages'=>'Kācā admin acara/lokasi','Eventful Locations?'=>'Lokasi sing Ana Acarané?','Events'=>'Acara','Events Calendar'=>'Tanggalan Acara','Events Duration'=>'Durasi Acara','Events I\'m Attending'=>'Acara sing Daksuwuri','Events Manager'=>'Events Manager','Events Manager - %s'=>'Events Manager - %s','Events Manager 5.9 introduced timezone functionality, which does not require certain fields in your database. To maintain backwards compatibility with earlier versions, these fields will still be created.'=>'Events Manager 5.9 ngenalaké fungsi zona wektu, sing ora mbutuhaké sawetara kolom ing database sampéyan. Supaya tetep cocog karo versi sakdurungé, kolom-kolom iki isih bakal digawé.','Events Manager 6 onwards has optional styling that maximizes consistency accross different themes. If you\'d like your theme to take over in some or all aspects of our plugin, you can disable our styling here.'=>'Events Manager 6 lan sawisé nduwèni gagrag opsional sing nggedhékaké konsistensi ing macem-macem tema. Yèn sampéyan pengin tema sampéyan ngambil alih ing sawetara utawa kabèh aspek plugin kita, sampéyan bisa nonaktifaké gagrag kita ing kéné.','Events Manager Add-ons'=>'Add-on Events Manager','Events Manager Bookings'=>'Pemesanan Events Manager','Events Manager Data'=>'Data Events Manager','Events Manager Management'=>'Pangelolaan Events Manager','Events Manager Pro'=>'Events Manager Pro','Events Manager Pro %s has received a major security update. Please <a href="%s">read our announcement</a> and log into your account for upgrade options.'=>'Events Manager Pro %s wis éntuk nganyaran keamanan gedhé. Mangga <a href="%s">waca woro-woro kita</a> lan mlebu log menyang akun sampéyan kanggo pilihan upgrade.','Events Manager Settings'=>'Setélan Events Manager','Events Manager Test Email'=>'Email Uji Events Manager','Events Manager app'=>'Aplikasi Events Manager','Events Manager bookings'=>'Pemesanan Events Manager','Events Manager bookings linked to their WooCommerce orders (Events Manager for WooCommerce)'=>'Pemesanan Events Manager sing disambungake karo pesenan WooCommerce-é (Events Manager for WooCommerce)','Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager bisa nyalin acara, papan, panyelenggara, tiket, lan peserta saka %1$s. Ora ana sing ing %1$s diowahi, mula sampeyan bisa mriksa asilé sadurungé mateni.','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager saiki bisa nuduhaké rilis stabil paling anyar sanalika dipacak, kita <b>nyaranaké banget</b> sampéyan nindakaké iki. Aktifaké iki ing %1$s. %2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'Events Manager ora bisa dicopot pasang saka situs iki.','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'Events Manager for WooCommerce','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager nemokaké acara saka %s ing situs iki lan bisa nyalin, bareng papan, panyelenggara, tiket, lan pesertané.','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'Events Manager wis dirumat, dikembangake lan didukung kanthi gratis wiwit dirilis ing taun 2008, ulasan positif minangka salah sijine sing mbantu kita terus maju.','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager wis nyedhiyakaké pirang-pirang cara kanggo mbiyantu nyegah utawa nyuda biaya iki kanthi drastis, mangga priksa kācā %s kanggo informasi luwih lengkap.','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager wis nggawa jinis lokasi, sing bisa kalebu lokasi online kayata URL utawa integrasi karo platform webinar kayata Zoom! Aktifaké jinis lokasi sing béda ing kācā setélan sampéyan, informasi luwih lengkap deleng %s.','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager wis nggawa piranti privasi anyar kanggo mbiyantu sampéyan netepi hukum internasional kayata GDPR, <a href="%s">waca dokumentasi kita</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap.','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'Events Manager ora duwé aturan kanggo %1$s, mula iki diimpor minangka %2$d tanggal.' . "\0" . 'Events Manager ora duwé aturan kanggo %1$s, mula iki diimpor minangka daftar %2$d tanggal.','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'Events Manager ora duwé aturan kanggo %s.','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Events Manager durung duwé aturan kanggo iki. Baris kasebut diimpor minangka daftar tanggal, utawa dilewati yèn sampeyan milih mangkono, lan laporan asil nyebutaké saben-saben.','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager saiki duwé <a href="">aplikasi seluler</a> 🥳 🎉, undhuhen saiki!','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager saiki ndhukung pirang-pirang zona wektu kanggo acara sampéyan! Acara sampéyan wiwitané bakal cocog karo zona wektu blog sampéyan.','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager bisa baleni saben dina, saben minggu, saben wulan ing dina minggu kayata Selasa kapindho, lan saben taun, nganti tanggal pungkasan. Ora ana aturan kanggo dina ing sawijining wulan utawa kanggo mungkasi sawisé sawetara baleni. Ing kasus apa waé laporan asil nyebutaké saben baris.','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'Piranti Events Manager kanggo nggawé lan ngelola acara, pemesanan, lokasi, tiket lan media, kanggo klien AI sing cocog karo MCP.','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'Kesalahan validasi Events Manager saka panyimpenan pungkasan, yèn ana.','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager ora dicopot pasang. Jaringan iki nuduhake siji set tabel acara lan pemesanan, dadi nyopot pasang saka situs iki bakal mbusak acara lan pemesanan saka saben situs ing jaringan kanthi permanen. Copot pasang saka %s.','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Setélan permalink Events Manager diowahi supaya cocog, dadi pranala menyang acara sampeyan tetep makarya tanpa pangalihan.','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'Tipe Acara (Archetype)','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'Acara kanthi Pemesanan Diaktifake','Events can choose their own?'=>'Acara bisa milih dhéwé?','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'Acara bisa nduwèni status, kayata acara sing dibatalaké, sing banjur bisa disaring saka dhaptar panggolékan. Kanthi gawan, utawa yèn dinonaktifaké, acara nduwèni status %s.','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'Acara bisa nduwèni pirang-pirang wektu saben dinā, slot wektu bisa dipilih saka formulir pemesanan, slot wektu ora nduwèni kācā acara dhéwé lan manggon ing acara sing padha.','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'Acara ora bisa diwiwiti sawisé rampung.','Events current and next month'=>'Acara wulan iki lan wulan ngarep','Events date modal preview format'=>'Format pratinjau modal tanggal acara','Events imported from CSV files'=>'Acara sing diimpor saka berkas CSV','Events list page'=>'Kācā dhaptar acara','Events list settings'=>'Setélan daftar acara','Events next month'=>'Acara wulan ngarep','Events on %s'=>'Acara ing %s','Events page'=>'Kācā acara','Events per day'=>'Acara saben dina','Events require a user to own them. In order to allow events to be submitted anonymously you need to assign that event a specific user. We recommend you create a "Anonymous" subscriber with a very good password and use that. Guests will have the same event permissions as this user when submitting.'=>'Acara mbutuhaké panganggo minangka sing nduwèni. Supaya acara bisa dikirim sacara anonim, sampéyan kudu nemtokaké panganggo tartamtu kanggo acara kasebut. Kita nyaranaké sampéyan nggawé pelanggan "Anonim" mawa tembung sandi sing kuwat banget lan nggunakaké iku. Tamu bakal nduwèni idin acara sing padha karo panganggo iki nalika ngirim.','Events this month'=>'Acara wulan iki','Events this month (today onwards)'=>'Acara wulan iki (wiwit dinā iki)','Events this week (today to %s)'=>'Acara minggu iki (dinā iki nganti %s)','Events this whole week (%s to %s)'=>'Acara saminggu muput (%s nganti %s)','Events with multiple dates will appear on each of those dates in the calendar.'=>'Acara kanthi pirang-pirang tanggal bakal katon ing saben tanggal kasebut ing tanggalan.','Events with timeslots can further break up timeslots dynamically by adding timeslot durations, buffers and frequencies to create multiple timeslots from one time range. For example, in the mornings, you can have a timeslot every 45 minutes at the start of each hour.'=>'Acara mawa slot wektu bisa dipérang maneh sacara dinamis kanthi nambah durasi, panyangga lan frekuensi slot wektu kanggo nggawé pirang-pirang slot wektu saka siji rentang wektu. Contoné, ing wayah esuk, sampéyan bisa nduwèni slot wektu saben 45 menit ing wiwitané saben jam.','Events within 12 months'=>'Acara ing 12 wulan','Events within 2 months'=>'Acara ing 2 wulan','Events within 3 months'=>'Acara ing 3 wulan','Events within 6 months'=>'Acara ing 6 wulan','Events won\'t recurr on the following dates:'=>'Acara ora bakal baleni ing tanggal-tanggal iki:','Every Minute'=>'Saben Menit','Everyone'=>'Kabèh wong','Everyone else sees the link text without the link. Attendees whose booking includes virtual access get their own join link once the booking is approved. Without bookings, the link is always shown.'=>'Wong liyané ndelok teks pranala tanpa pranalané. Peserta sing pemesanané kalebu akses virtual olèh pranala melu dhéwé sawisé pemesanan disetujoni. Tanpa pemesanan, pranala tansah katon.','Everything in Pro'=>'Kabèh ing Pro','Everything in Pro, plus every add-on listed here, on a single license.'=>'Kabèh ing Pro, plus saben add-on sing kadhaptar ing kéné, ing siji lisènsi.','Everything on %s is public, so the link appears on the event page and in calendar feeds.'=>'Kabèh ing %s iku umum, mula pranala katon ing kācā acara lan ing feed tanggalan.','Example Input'=>'Contoh Input','Example:'=>'Conto:','Excerpt'=>'Kutipan','Exclude %s'=>'Kejābā %s','Exclude Countries'=>'Kejābakaké Negara','Exclude on'=>'Kejābakaké ing','Exclude taxes from subtotal?'=>'Kejābā pajeg saka subtotal?','Expand All'=>'Ngembangaké Kabèh','Export'=>'Ekspor','Export Bookings'=>'Ekspor Pemesanan','Export CSV'=>'Ekspor CSV','Export Settings'=>'Ekspor Setélan','Export these bookings.'=>'Ekspor pemesanan iki.','Export your Events Manager settings and restore them here or on another website running this plugin.'=>'Ekspor setélan Events Manager sampéyan lan pulihaké ing kéné utawa ing situs web liyané sing nganggo plugin iki.','Exported on %s'=>'Diekspor ing %s','Exporter'=>'Pengekspor','Failed to write upload to temporary file.'=>'Gagal nulis unggahan menyang berkas sauntara.','Fallback panels'=>'Panel cadhangan','Featured'=>'Unggulan','Featured (yes or no)'=>'Unggulan (yes utawa no)','Featured image (web address or media ID)'=>'Gambar unggulan (alamat web utawa ID media)','Fields marked * are needed. A field can be given to one column only.'=>'Kolom sing ditandhani * dibutuhaké. Siji kolom mung bisa diwènèhaké menyang siji kolom berkas.','File'=>'Berkas','File Type'=>'Tipe Berkas','File upload is required'=>'Unggahan berkas kudu ana','File upload is required.'=>'Unggahan berkas kudu ana.','Finalize Timezones Upgrade'=>'Rampungaké Upgrade Zona Wektu','Find more dates from the calendar.'=>'Goleki tanggal liyané saka tanggalan.','Finished'=>'Rampung','Finishing'=>'Lagi ngrampungaké','First Name'=>'Jeneng Ngarep','First page'=>'Kācā pisanan','First row'=>'Baris pisanan','For monthly: first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'Kanggo monthly: first, second, third, fourth utawa last.','For more information see our %s.'=>'Kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap pirsani %s kita.','For more information see our <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a>.'=>'Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap delengen <a href="%s">dokumentasi privasi data</a> kita.','For multiple emails, separate by commas (e.g. email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)'=>'Kanggo luwih saka siji email, pisahna nganggo koma (contoné email1@test.com,email2@test.com,lsp.)','For use with the %s placeholder'=>'Kanggo digunakaké karo placeholder %s','For weekly: one or more, such as Mon, Wed. For monthly: one, used with the week of the month.'=>'Kanggo weekly: siji utawa luwih, kayata Mon, Wed. Kanggo monthly: siji, dienggo bareng minggu ing wulan.','For when start/end %s are present, this will separate the two (include spaces here if necessary).'=>'Kanggo nalika %s wiwitan/pungkasan ana, iki bakal misahaké loro-loroné (lebokna spasi ing kéné yèn perlu).','Force network-defined list (no subsite choice)'=>'Paksa dhaptar sing ditemtokaké jaringan (subsitus ora bisa milih)','Formatting'=>'Pamormatan','Found %d orphaned events, deleted %d successfully'=>'Nemokake %d acara yatim, kasil mbusak %d','Found in %s'=>'Ditemokaké ing %s','Free'=>'Gratis','Free companion plugins'=>'Plugin pendamping gratis','Free plugins from the Events Manager team, available on WordPress.org.'=>'Plugin gratis saka tim Events Manager, kasedhiya ing WordPress.org.','Frequency'=>'Frekuensi','From '=>'Saka ','From %1$s to %2$s'=>'Saka %1$s nganti %2$s','From %s a year'=>'Wiwit %s saben taun','Front-end management pages'=>'Kācā pangelolaan ing ngarep','Full Calendar Options'=>'Pilihan Full Calendar','Full-Size Calendar'=>'Tanggalan Ukuran Pebuh','Fully Booked'=>'Wis Kebak Pesenan','Fully booked'=>'Pemesanan kebak','Further Information'=>'Informasi Luwih Lanjut','Future'=>'Mbesuk','Future Events Only?'=>'Acara Mbesuk Waé?','Future events'=>'Acara sing bakal teka','Future events only'=>'Acara mbesuk waé','Gather panels that can\'t run in the canvas into a tabbed "Event Details" box'=>'Klumpukaké panel sing ora bisa mlaku ing kanvas menyang kothak "Detil Acara" mawa tab','General'=>'Umum','General JS'=>'JS Umum','General Options'=>'Pilihan Umum','General settings'=>'Setélan umum','Geolocation Search'=>'Panggolékan Geolokasi','Get %s'=>'Njupuk %s','Get booking'=>'Jupuk pemesanan','Get booking requirements'=>'Jupuk syarat pemesanan','Get event'=>'Jupuk acara','Get event availability'=>'Jupuk kasedhiyan acara','Get location'=>'Jupuk lokasi','Get ticket'=>'Jupuk tiket','Getting Help for Events Manager'=>'Entuk Pitulungan kanggo Events Manager','Give each date of a recurring event its own meeting link'=>'Wènèhi saben tanggal acara bola-balik pranala rapat dhéwé','Give the file to import with --file=<path>.'=>'Wènèhi berkas sing arep diimpor nganggo --file=<path>.','Global %s slug'=>'Slug %s global','Global Map Format'=>'Format Peta Global','Google Calendar'=>'Google Calendar','Google Map Type'=>'Tipe Google Map','Google Maps API Browser Key'=>'Kunci Browser Google Maps API','Google Maps API provides you with ways to display maps of your locations and help site visitors find events near their desired locations.'=>'Google Maps API nyedhiyakaké cara kanggo nuduhake peta lokasi sampéyan lan mbantu pengunjung situs nemokaké acara ing cedhaké lokasi sing dikarepaké.','Google Maps Style'=>'Gagrag Google Maps','Google Maps Styling Wizard'=>'Wizard Gagrag Google Maps','Google Maps and Location Services'=>'Google Maps lan Layanan Lokasi','Google Maps require an API key, please see our %s page for instructions on obtaining one.'=>'Google Maps mbutuhaké kunci API, mangga pirsani kācā %s kita kanggo pandhuan carané olèh.','Google has introduced new pricing for displaying maps on your site. If you have moderate traffic levels, this may likely affect you with surprise and unexpected costs!'=>'Google wis nggawa rega anyar kanggo nuduhaké peta ing situs sampéyan. Yèn lalu lintas situs sampéyan sedheng, iki bisa nyebabaké biaya sing ora dinyana!','Google may charge you for usage, depending on how much traffic your site receives. For more information about how and where Events Manager uses the Google Maps API, and how to manage costs, please see our %s page.'=>'Google bisa narik biaya kanggo panggunaan, gumantung saka sepira akèh lalu lintas situs sampéyan. Kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap bab carané lan ing ngendi Events Manager nggunakaké Google Maps API, lan carané ngatur biaya, mangga pirsani kācā %s kita.','Google offers different map displays, each with varying prices and free usage allowance. See our %s page for more information on these display options.'=>'Google nawakaké macem-macem tampilan peta, saben-saben mawa rega lan jatah panggunaan gratis sing béda. Pirsani kācā %s kita kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap bab pilihan tampilan iki.','Grid'=>'Kothak','Group By'=>'Klompokake Miturut','Group Events'=>'Acara Grup','Group Ownership'=>'Kepemilikan Grup','Grouped Lists'=>'Daftar Dikelompokaké','Grouped Lists View'=>'Tontonan Daftar Klompok','Grouped list default'=>'Gawan daftar klompok','Grouped list format'=>'Format daftar klompok','Grouped list header'=>'Sesirahan daftar klompok','Guest Default User'=>'Panganggo Gawan Tamu','Guest User'=>'Panganggo Tamu','Guest Users'=>'Panganggo Tamu','HTML Allowed.'=>'HTML Diparengaké.','HTML allowed.'=>'HTML diolèhaké.','HTML entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitized after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.'=>'Isi shortcode sing wis didekode saka HTML entity bakal disanitasi sawisé didekode, kita SANGET nyaranaké supaya iki tetep aktif.','HTML is not accepted.'=>'HTML ora ditampa.','Headings'=>'Irah-irahan','Help'=>'Pitulungan','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'Ing kéné sampéyan bisa nonaktifaké gagrag item individu babar blas utawa mung ngidinaké gagrag dasar. Gagrag dasar bakal nyoba nrapaké struktur umum (kayata struktur tanggalan) nanging ora bakal nggunakaké aturan gagrag Ketat kita.','Hidden Links'=>'Pranala Didelikake','Hidden by default?'=>'Didelikaké kanthi gawan?','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'Didelikake saka daftar (yes utawa no)','Hidden from upcoming'=>'Didhelikaké saka bakal teka','Hidden link text'=>'Teks pranala sing didelikake','Hidden links'=>'Pranala didelikake','Hide'=>'Delikake','Hide Advanced Options'=>'Delikake Opsi Lanjutan','Hide Advanced Search'=>'Delikaké Panggolèkan Tutug','Hide Search'=>'Delikaké Panggolékan','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'Delikaké formulir nganti tiket dipilih?','Hide label'=>'Label ndelikaké','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'Delikake pranala nganti %s menit sadurungé acara diwiwiti','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'Delikaké ing ukuran layar %s?','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'Tahan panggonan nalika mesen?','Hold time'=>'Wektu tahan','Holds'=>'Dicekel','Host account'=>'Akun tuan rumah','Hosted by %s'=>'Dituan rumahi dening %s','Hours'=>'Jam','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'Carané acara katon ing saben dinā tanggalan: pil kanthi label kanggo saben acara, siji titik, siji titik kanggo saben acara (nganti watesan dinā), utāwā ring warna ngubengi tanggal. Timpa ing saben tanggalan nganggo parameter %s.','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'Sapira suwéné sadurungé acara panganggo bisa mbatalaké?','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'Pira menit sadurunge acara diwiwiti pranālā kasebut ditampilake, yen acara kasebut ora duwé wektu dhéwé.','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'Pira menit panggonan sing dipilih ditahan kanggo pengunjung sing durung ngirim pemesanané.','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'Kepriye larik-larik kapisan bakal diimpor kanthi kolom lan opsi kaya pratinjau pungkasan. Durung ana sing disimpen.','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'Nanging, ana sawetara masalah nalika ngirim email konfirmasi marang sampéyan lan/utawa kontak acara. Sampéyan bisa ngubungi dhèwèké langsung lan ngabari bab kaluputan iki.','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'Atusan jam gratis wis dicurahaké kanggo nggawé plugin gratis iki, tuduhna dhukungan sampéyan lan tambahna pranālā cilik menyang situs web plugin ing sikil kācā acara sampéyan.','Hybrid'=>'Hibrida','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Hibrida (Fisik/Virtual)','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Papan Hibrida (Fisik/Virtual)','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'Aku setuju data sing dakkirim dikumpulaké lan disimpen kaya sing diterangaké déning situs %s.','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'Aku setuju informasi kontak sing daktuduhaké dienggo kanggo tujuan komunikasi.','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'Kanthi iki aku mbatalake kontrak kanggo pemesanan ing ngisor iki: %1$s (#%2$d).','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP: %s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'Ikon sing katon ing menu admin dasbor kanggo Archetype iki. Nampa URL menyang gambar PNG/SVG, %s utawa kosongké kanggo gawan.','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'Yen Tipe Berkas uga disetel, mung ekstensi iki ing sajrone Tipe Berkas sing diidinake sing bakal diidinake.','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'Yen email HTML diaktifake, tag br bakal otomatis ditambahake kanggo baris anyar.','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'Yèn ana pemesanan kanggo alamat email kuwi, kita wis ngirim pranālā kanggo ngatur pamundur sampéyan. Mangga priksa kotak mlebu sampéyan.','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'Yèn pemesanan ditindakaké lan email ora bisa dikirim, iki ditambahaké menyang pesen kasil.','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'Yèn dinā tanggalan namung duwé siji acara, sampéyan bisa meksa pranālā langsung menyang acara kasebut (dianjuraké supaya ora ana isi dobel).','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'Yèn panganggo durung tau weneh utawa nyabut persetujuan kanggo jinis data tartamtu sing dikirim (kayata pemesanan), apa kita nganggep panganggo wis setuju kanthi gawan?','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'Yèn wis melu lan pemesanan ganda dinonaktifaké, pesen iki bakal ditampilaké, diterusaké pranālā menyang kācā pemesanan panganggo.','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'Yèn acara ora nduwèni kategori nalika didandani, kategori iki bakal ditemtokaké kanthi otomatis.','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'Yèn acara dibatalaké, tindakan ing ngisor iki bisa ditindakaké nalika pambatalan.','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'Yèn acara dibatalaké, sampéyan bisa ngejābakaké saka dhaptar acara. Sampéyan bisa nuduhake acara sing dibatalaké ing shortcode nganggo parameter %s.','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'Yèn acara suwéné sedina muput, teks iki bakal katon yèn nganggo placeholder %s','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'Yèn dicenthang, saben pemesanan kudu milih siji utawa jumlah minimal tiket iki.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, wangsulan kanggo email otomatis iki bakal dikirim menyang wong sing nggawé pemesanan. Iki luwih diprioritasaké tinimbang Reply-To pemilik acara.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, wangsulan kanggo email otomatis iki bakal dikirim menyang email pemilik acara kanthi gawan.','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, Events Manager mriksa WordPress.org langsung kanggo rilis stabil paling anyar, tanpa ngenteni peluncuran nganyari bertahap sing bisa nganti 24 jam. Rilis sing ditemokaké kanthi cara iki mung ditampilaké kanggo nganyari manual lan ora tau dipasang otomatis, kajaba sampéyan nemtokaké konstanta %1$s. %2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, slot wektu sing kebak dipesen tetep katon nanging ora bisa dipilih.','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, pengunjung tamu bisa nyadhiyakaké alamat email lan akun panganggo bakal digawé otomatis kanggo wong kasebut bareng pemesanané. Wong kasebut uga bakal bisa mlebu log maneh nganggo akun anyar kasebut.','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, kabèh formulir pemesanan bakal katon sawisé panggonan dipilih, utawa yèn tiket wis dipilih sadurungé kanthi panggonan minimum.','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, versi dev paling anyar bakal tansah dipriksa tinimbang versi stabil paling anyar saka plugin.','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, panggonan sing dipilih pengunjung ing formulir pemesanan ditahan kanggo dheweke nalika ngisi bagéan formulir liyané, supaya ora ana wong liya sing bisa njupuk sadurungé dikirim. Panggonan sing ditahan dianggep wis dijupuk kanggo wong liya nganti pemesanan dikirim utawa wektu tahan entek. Tahanan ora bisa luwih gedhé tinimbang siji pemesanan, mula setel jumlah maksimum panggonan saben pemesanan ing acara utawa tiket kanggo mbatesi pira bagéan acara sing bisa ditahan siji pengunjung.','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, panganggo bisa mesen acara luwih saka sepisan.','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, panganggo bisa mbatalaké pemesanané dhéwé saka kācā pemesanané.','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'Yèn tamu ora bisa mesen, wong kasebut bakal dijaluk daftar kanggo mesen. Nanging, ngaktifaké iki isih bakal nampilaké tiket sing sumadya.','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'Yèn aturan kalebu dilebokaké ing ndhuwur, setélan iki ora digatèkaké.','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'Yèn dikosongaké, ora ana email sing dikirim. Pisahna nganggo koma yèn luwih saka siji email.','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Yèn dikosongaké, nilai gawan bakal dienggo.','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'Yèn dikosongaké, email iki ora bakal dikirim.','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'Yèn disetel Yā, kapabilitas bakal ditrapaké ing kabèh blog jaringan sampéyan lan sampéyan ora bisa nyetel kapabilitas racikan kanggo saben blog. Sampéyan bisa milih Ora mengko lan tiliki kācā setélan blog tartamtu kanggo nambah/buwang kapabilitas.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'Yèn diset ya, formulir nggoleki bakal katon pas ing dhuwuré dhaptar acara sampéyan.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'Yèn disetel Yā, formulir panggolèkan bakal katon ing sadhuwuring dhaptar lokasi sampéyan.','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Yèn disetel Yā, kolom nggoleki tutug bisa dibukak-tutup kanthi ngeklik ikon "Panggolékan Tutug".','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Yèn disetel Yā, kolom nggoleki tutug bakal didelikaké kanthi gawan lan bisa dibukak kanthi ngeklik ikon "Panggolékan Tutug".','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'Yèn diset ya, gambar ukuran kebak bakal dienggo lan atribut ambā lan dhuwur HTML bakal dienggo kanggo nemtokaké ukurané.','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'Yèn disetel Yā, FullCalendar bakal dienggo ganti tanggalan standar ing kācā acara.','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'Yen disetel ya, email sampeyan bakal dikirim nganggo format HTML, yen ora nganggo teks biasa.','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'Yèn disetel, jumlah total panggonan kanggo siji pemesanan acara iki ora bisa ngluwihi jumlah iki.','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'Yèn sinkronisasi diaktifaké kanggo status pemesanan ing ngisor iki, nalika panganggo ngisi RSVP, status pemesanan bakal owah otomatis bareng status RSVP.','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'Yèn pemesanan gratis, iki bakal ditampilaké gantiné irah-irahan %s.','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'Yèn kotak centhang persetujuan ora dicenthang nalika pemesanan, kesalahan iki bakal dibalèkaké.','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'Yèn kotak centhang persetujuan ora dicenthang nalika ngirim informasi kayata acara utawa lokasi, kesalahan iki bakal dibalèkaké.','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'Yèn panganggo wis tau mesen lan ora bisa mesen ganda.','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'Yèn panganggo nyoba mesen nganggo panggonan sing ngluwihi cacah maksimum panggonan saben pemesanan.','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'Yèn panganggo nyoba mesen tanpa njaluk panggonan apa wae.','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'Yèn ana nganyaran anyar, saiki sampéyan bakal weruh ing kācā Plugin utawa Nganyari admin sampéyan.','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'Yèn ana tiket khusus anggota, sampéyan bisa milih apa arep nampilaké tiket kasebut marang tamu.','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'Yèn ora ana kolom sing ditampilaké ing bagéan nggoleki utama, tombol iki bakal digunakaké ing ngisor kolom tutug.','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'Yèn iki salah, klik batal lan coba alamat sing luwih spésifik.','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Yèn terjemahan dikosongaké, nilai gawan bakal dienggo.','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'Yèn nonton kācā acara ing tanggal tartamtu, iki judul sing bakal katon. Kanggo nyelehaké nilai tanggal, gunakna <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">karakter format wektu PHP</a> nganggo simbol <code>#</code> sadurungé, contoné <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, lsp.<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'Yen sampéyan nemoni kesalahan nalika nyoba nganggo salah sijining akun iki, coba medhot lan nyambung manèh.','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'Yèn sampéyan ngowahi pola wektu kayata wektu wiwitan utawa durasi, slot wektu apa waé sing wis digawé sadurungé lan tiba ing njaba setélan anyar bakal %s.','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'Yèn sampéyan milih \'Kācā\' banjur %s bakal katon nganggo cithakan kācā gawan tema sampéyan, utawa pilih saka cithakan kācā sing ana ing tema sampéyan.','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'Yèn sampéyan milih mode klompok, kācā acara sampéyan bakal nampilaké acara ing klompok miturut rentang wektu pilihan sampéyan.','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'Yèn sampéyan milih jinis pos Acara nalika Events Manager diaktifaké, sampéyan uga bisa ngunjungi <a href="%s">kācā setélan Events Manager</a> kanggo sawetara pilihan liyané nalika nampilaké informasi acara ing tanggalan sampéyan.','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'Yèn sampéyan milih mbatalake acara sampéyan, sawisé nyimpen acara iki, ora ana pemesanan manèh sing bisa ditindakaké kanggo acara iki.','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'Yèn sampéyan ngumpulaké data pribadi, sampéyan mungkin kudu njaluk persetujuané. Pilihan ing ngisor bakal otomatis nambah kotak centhang sing njaluk persetujuan iki.','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'Yen sampeyan duwe wektu sawetara menit, kita bakal matur nuwun yen sampeyan gelem ninggalake ulasan kanggo kita.','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nonaktifaké lokasi, élinga yèn sampéyan kudu mbuwang kācā lokasi, shortcode lan placeholder sing gandhèng saka <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">format</a> sampéyan.','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'Yèn sampéyan ngaktifaké tips, informasi iki bakal katampilaké lan bisa ngemot HTML.','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nambah dawa utawa nambah tanggal liyané, pengulangan anyar bakal ditambahaké menyang set pengulangan sampéyan tanpa mengaruhi sing wis digawé sadurungé.','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nambah dawa utawa nambah wektu liyané, iki ora bakal mengaruhi slot wektu sadurungé.','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nampa akèh pemesanan sing ngenteni lan sampéyan mutusaké kanggo ngidinaké pemesanan luwih akèh tinimbang panggonan sing ana, nyetel iki menyang Yā bakal ngidinaké sampéyan ngliwati wates panggonan acara nalika nyetujoni sacara manual.','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'Yèn sampéyan wis marem karo pindhahan iki, sampéyan bisa nutup pesen iki lan opsi format lawas sampéyan (yaiku opsi mbaleni iki) bakal dibusak.','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'Yen sampeyan mung pengin mateni plugin, <a href="%s">menyanga kaca plugin sampeyan</a>.','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'Yèn sampéyan ngowahi tanggal sing ora ana pengulangané, pengulangan apa waé sing tiba ing tanggal-tanggal kuwi bakal %s. Pengulangan anyar bakal digawé yèn sampéyan mbusak tanggal ora kasedhiya sing sadurungé ngalang-alangi tanggal pengulangan.','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'Yèn sampéyan luwih seneng tabel tiket kaya nalika ana pirang-pirang tiket, senajan kanggo acara siji tiket, aktifaké iki.','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'Yèn sampéyan milih negara gawan, negara kasebut bakal wis kapilih nalika nggawé lokasi anyar.','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nyepetaké rentang tanggal utawa mbatesi tanggal pengulangan, pengulangan apa waé sing ana ing njaba rentang tanggal anyar bakal %s.','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nganyari data acara iki lan nyimpen, data kuwi bisa katimpa yèn sampéyan nyunting cithakan acara bola-balik. Supaya mandiri, <a href="%s">copot acara iki</a>.','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nggunakaké <a href="%s">shortcode</a> %s, sampéyan bisa nuduhake peta kabèh lokasi lan acara sampéyan, lan setélan ing ngisor iki bakal dienggo.','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nggunakaké <a href="%s">placeholder</a> <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> nalika nuduhake informasi acara lan lokasi siji-siji, setélan ing ngisor iki bakal dienggo.','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'Yen sampeyan pengin ngowahi opsi umum kanggo Events Manager, bukaa %s utama.','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'Yèn sampéyan péngin saben email konfirmasi pemesanan acara dikirim menyang administrator, tulisen email-é ing kéné (kosongaké supaya ora ana email sing dikirim).','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'Yèn sampéyan pengin nambah kelas tambahan menyang tag html body sampéyan nalika kācā %s siji katon, lebokaké ing kéné. Bisa migunani utawa perlu yèn tema sampéyan mbutuhaké jeneng kelas khusus kanggo cithakan tartamtu.','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'Yèn sampéyan pengin nonaktifaké pangalembānā babar blas, pateni iki, yèn ora sampéyan bisa nonaktifaké pangalembānā ing saben %s siji. Élinga yèn %s mawa pangalembānā sing diaktifaké bakal tetep ana nganti sampéyan nyimpen manèh.','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'Yèn sampéyan péngin ngundhuh versi dev, nanging mung sepisan, sampéyan bisa meksa mriksa versi dev kanthi ngeklik tombol ing ngisor iki. Yèn ana sing sumadya, bakal katon ing kācā nganyari plugin sampéyan minangka nganyari biasa.','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'Yen sampeyan luwih seneng supaya kabeh lokasi sampeyan kagolong ing blog utama, panganggo ing sub-situs isih bisa nggawe lokasi, nanging lokasi sing sejatine digawe lan manggon ing blog utama.','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'Yen sampeyan luwih seneng nyelehake kācā iki, tambahna %s ing berkas wp-config.php sampeyan.','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'Yèn sampéyan nggunakake Google Maps, saya rinci katrangan sing sampéyan wènèhaké, saya akurat Google nemokaké lokasi sampéyan. Yèn alamat sampéyan ora ditemokaké, mangga <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>coba ing maps.google.com</a> kanthi nambah kabèh kolom ing ngisor sing dipisahaké koma.','Image'=>'Gambar','Image Dimensions'=>'Dimensi Gambar','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'Input gambar kudu ID lampiran, URL, utawa objek nganggo source_url / content_base64 / file.','Import'=>'Impor','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'Impor %1$s, %2$s','Import Settings'=>'Impor Setélan','Import a %s'=>'Impor %s','Import and Migrate'=>'Impor lan Pindhahake','Import as'=>'Impor minangka','Import as a list of dates'=>'Impor minangka daftar tanggal','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'Impor acara, lokasi utawa panyelenggara saka berkas CSV, utawa salinen acara, papan, panyelenggara, tiket lan peserta saka plugin acara liyane. Loro-lorone bisa dibalèkaké, lan data asli ora diowahi.','Import into Events Manager'=>'Impor menyang Events Manager','Import/Export Settings'=>'Impor/Ekspor Setélan','Imported, with a note'=>'Diimpor, nganggo cathetan','Importing rows'=>'Ngimpor larik','Imports'=>'Impor','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is one row too. Run it, check the result, and roll the import back if it is not what you wanted.'=>'Ngimpor acara, lokasi utawa panyelenggara saka berkas CSV, siji larik kanggo saben item. Acara bola-balik uga mung siji larik. Jalanake, priksa asilé, banjur balèkaké impor yen ora kaya sing dikarepake.','In order to use attributes, you must define some in your templates, otherwise they\'ll never show. Go to Events > Settings > General to add attribute placeholders.'=>'Kanggo nganggo atribut, sampéyan kudu netepaké sawetara ing cithakan sampéyan, yèn ora atribut ora bakal katon. Bukak Events > Settings > General kanggo nambah placeholder atribut.','In single ticket mode, users can only create one ticket per event (and will not see options to add more tickets).'=>'Ing mode tiket tunggal, panganggo mung bisa nggawé siji tiket saben acara (lan ora bakal weruh opsi kanggo nambah tiket liyané).','In the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>, you\'ll find various textboxes where you can edit how event information looks, such as for event and location lists. Using the placeholders below, you can choose what information should be displayed.'=>'Ing <a href=\'%s\'>kaca setelan</a>, sampeyan bakal nemokake macem-macem kothak teks sing bisa sampeyan gunakake kanggo ngowahi tampilan informasi acara, kayata kanggo dhaptar acara lan lokasi. Kanthi nggunakake placeholder ing ngisor iki, sampeyan bisa milih informasi apa sing kudu ditampilake.','In the boxes below, you are expected to write the page IDs. For multiple pages, use comma-separated values e.g. 1,2,3. Entering 0 means EVERY page, -1 means the home page.'=>'Ing kothak ing ngisor, sampéyan kudu nulis ID kācā. Kanggo pirang-pirang kācā, nganggoa nilai sing dipisahaké koma kayata 1,2,3. Ngetik 0 tegesé SAKABÈHING kācā, -1 tegesé kācā joglo.','In this case, a user can confirm their own booking even if the booking is pending.'=>'Ing kasus iki, panganggo bisa ngonfirmasi pemesanané dhéwé senajan pemesanan isih ngenteni.','Include %s'=>'Kalebu %s','Include Countries'=>'Nyakup Negara','Include all'=>'Sertakaké kabèh','Include cancelled events?'=>'Nyakup acara sing dibatalaké?','Include in WordPress Searches?'=>'Lebokaké ing Panggolékan WordPress?','Include on'=>'Lebokaké ing','Include only guest submissions'=>'Sertakaké namung kiriman tamu','Include only these %1$s IDs, for multiple values separate by commas such as %2$s.'=>'Kalebokna namung ID %1$s iki, kanggo pirang-pirang nilai pisahna nganggo koma kayata %2$s.','Include pages where you use shortcode or PHP to display event submission forms.'=>'Lebokaké kācā ing ngendi sampéyan nggunakaké shortcode utawa PHP kanggo nuduhake formulir pangiriman acara.','Include pages where you use shortcodes or widgets to display event search forms.'=>'Lebokaké kācā ing ngendi sampéyan nggunakaké shortcode utawa widget kanggo nuduhake formulir panggolékan acara.','Include past events'=>'Kalebu acara sing wis liwat','Included in %s'=>'Kalebu ing %s','Included with your %s'=>'Kalebu ing %s sampeyan','Includes hybrid events, which can also be attended physically.'=>'Kalebu acara hibrida, sing uga bisa dihadiri sacara fisik.','Incomplete Bookings'=>'Pemesanan Durung Rampung','Individual Components'=>'Komponen Individu','Individual tickets with remaining spaces will not be available if total booking spaces reach this limit. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Tiket individu sing isih ana panggonané ora bakal kasedhiya yèn total panggonan pemesanan tekan wates iki. Kosongna kanggo tanpa wates.','Inherit your theme settings'=>'Warisaké setélan tema sampéyan','Initial lengths'=>'Dawa wiwitan','Inline'=>'Sajrone Kaca','Insert the address of the notification sender.'=>'Lebokna alamat pangirim kabar.','Insert the display name of the notification sender.'=>'Lebokna jeneng tampilan pangirim kabar.','Insert the password to be used to access your SMTP server'=>'Lebokna sandhi sing bakal digunakake kanggo ngakses server SMTP sampeyan','Insert the username to be used to access your SMTP server.'=>'Lebokna jeneng panganggo sing bakal digunakake kanggo ngakses server SMTP sampeyan.','Install'=>'Instal','Installed'=>'Wis diinstal','Installed, not active'=>'Wis diinstal, durung aktif','Invalid Number'=>'Nomer ora cocog','Invalid file upload.'=>'Unggahan berkas ora valid.','Invalid interval format for %s'=>'Format interval ora valid kanggo %s','Invalid request'=>'Panyuwunan ora valid','Invalid source URL.'=>'URL sumber ora valid.','Involid token credentials, the folloiwng are missing: %s.'=>'Kredensial token ora valid, sing kurang yaiku: %s.','Is consent required?'=>'Persetujuan dibutuhaké?','It looks like you have WPML enabled on your site. We advise you also install our extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin which helps the two work better together. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'Katon yen sampeyan ngaktifake WPML ing situs sampeyan. Kita nyaranake sampeyan uga masang plugin tambahan <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> sing mbantu kekarone bisa makarya luwih apik bebarengan. <a href="%s">Ilangi pesen</a>','JavaScript Files'=>'Berkas JavaScript','Join'=>'Melu','Join online'=>'Melu sacara daring','Keep The Events Calendar\'s web addresses for events, venues, organizers, categories and tags'=>'Tetepna alamat web The Events Calendar kanggo acara, papan, panyelenggara, kategori lan tetenger','Keep your current settings, or individuall revert to default formats.'=>'Pertahanaké setélan sampéyan saiki, utawa mbalèkaké siji-siji menyang format gawan.','Kilometers'=>'Kilometer','Label'=>'Label','Labels'=>'Label','Language Booked'=>'Bāsā Pemesanan','Large'=>'Āmbā','Last %d Months'=>'%d Sasi Pungkasan','Last Month'=>'Sasi Kepungkur','Last Name'=>'Jeneng Mburi','Last Year'=>'Taun Kepungkur','Last checked via %1$s on %2$s.'=>'Pungkasan dipriksa liwat %1$s ing %2$s.','Last page'=>'Kācā pungkasan','Last sync failed: %s'=>'Sinkronisasi pungkasan gagal: %s','Latitude'=>'Garis lintang','Learn More'=>'Sinau Luwih Lengkap','Learn more'=>'Sinau luwih lengkap','Leave blank for default archetype setting.'=>'Kosongaké kanggo setélan archetype gawan.','Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Kosongna kanggo tanpa wates.','Leave blank to use the built-in default for your site\'s language.'=>'Kosongna kanggo nganggo gawan bawan miturut bāsā situs sampéyan.','Leave blank to use the default format from Settings.'=>'Kosongna kanggo nggunakake format gawan saka Setélan.','Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Kosongna salah siji supaya ora ana wates ndhuwur/ngisor.','Leave this field empty'=>'Kosongna kolom iki','License expired'=>'Lisensi wis kadaluwarsa','License not activated'=>'Lisensi durung diaktifaké','Licensed'=>'Mawa lisensi','Limit JS file loading?'=>'Mbatesi pemuatan berkas JS?','Limit loading of our CSS files?'=>'Mbatesi pemuatan berkas CSS kita?','Limits the number of events on each calendar day. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Mbatesi cacahé acara ing saben dinā tanggalan. Kosongaké yèn ora ana watesan.','Limits the number of future events shown (0 = unlimited).'=>'Mbatesi cacahé acara mbesuk sing katon (0 = tanpa wates).','Line Graph'=>'Grafik Garis','Link'=>'Pranālā','Link Text'=>'Teks Pranālā','Link directly to event on day with single event?'=>'Sautaké langsung menyang acara ing dinā sing namung duwé siji acara?','Link sub-site %s directly to sub-site?'=>'Tautake %s sub-situs langsung menyang sub-situs?','Link text used for link to user bookings.'=>'Teks pranālā sing digunakaké kanggo pranālā menyang pemesanan panganggo.','List'=>'Daftar','List %s'=>'Dhaptar %s','List Limits'=>'Watesan Dhaptar','List bookings'=>'Dhaptar pemesanan','List event tickets'=>'Dhaptar tiket acara','List events'=>'Dhaptar acara','List events by date title'=>'Judul daftar acara miturut tanggal','List footer format'=>'Format sikil daftar','List header format'=>'Format sesirahan daftar','List item footer format'=>'Format sikil item daftar','List item format'=>'Format daftar item','List item header format'=>'Format sesirahan item daftar','List location countries'=>'Dhaptar negara lokasi','List location regions'=>'Dhaptar wilayah lokasi','List location states'=>'Dhaptar provinsi lokasi','List location towns'=>'Dhaptar kuthā lokasi','List locations'=>'Dhaptar lokasi','Load minified %s files?'=>'Mbukak berkas %s sing diminifikasi?','Load minified/compressed files, reducing the file size, load times and bandwidth usage on your site.'=>'Mbukak berkas sing diminifikasi/dikompres, nyuda ukuran berkas, wektu muat lan panggunaan bandwidth ing situs sampéyan.','Loading Map....'=>'Lagi muat Peta....','Loading...'=>'Ngemot...','Loads our own JS file if no other dependencies are already loaded, which is still needed for many items generated by EM using JavaScript such as Calendars, Maps and Booking Forms/Buttons'=>'Mbukak berkas JS kita dhéwé yèn ora ana dependensi liyané sing wis dimuat, sing isih dibutuhaké kanggo akèh item sing digawé EM nganggo JavaScript kayata Tanggalan, Peta lan Formulir/Tombol Pemesanan','Location'=>'Lokasi','Location ID.'=>'ID lokasi.','Location Image'=>'Gambar Lokasi','Location Name'=>'Jeneng Lokasi','Location Related Placeholders'=>'Placeholder Related Lokasi','Location Submission Forms'=>'Formulir Kiriman Lokasi','Location Type'=>'Tipe Lokasi','Location Types'=>'Tipe Lokasi','Location balloon format'=>'Format balon lokasi','Location coordinates'=>'Koordinat lokasi','Location could not be deleted.'=>'Lokasi ora bisa dibusak.','Location could not be saved.'=>'Lokasi ora bisa disimpen.','Location data is invalid.'=>'Data lokasi ora valid.','Location map and coordinates have been updated. Please re-save your location to update the map.'=>'Peta lan koordinat lokasi wis dianyari. Mangga simpen manèh lokasi sampéyan kanggo nganyari peta.','Location name'=>'Jeneng lokasi','Location name and address'=>'Jeneng lan alamat lokasi','Location not found'=>'Lokasi ora ditemokaké','Location not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Lokasi ora ditemokaké, mula gambar sing diunggah ora disetel minangka gambar fitur.','Location not found.'=>'Lokasi ora ditemokaké.','Location pages'=>'Kācā lokasi','Locations'=>'Lokasi','Locations imported from CSV files'=>'Lokasi sing diimpor saka berkas CSV','Locations list page'=>'Kācā dhaptar lokasi','Locations list settings'=>'Setélan daftar lokasi','Locations on main blog?'=>'Lokasi ing blog utama?','Locations submitted by guest users are not included, unless they are linked to events also submitted by them.'=>'Lokasi sing dikirim panganggo tamu ora kalebu, kajaba ditautaké menyang acara sing uga dikirim déning wong kuwi.','Log'=>'Cathetan','Log In'=>'Mlebu Log','Log in if you already have an account with us.'=>'Mlebu log yèn sampéyan wis duwé akun karo kita.','Logged In Users'=>'Panganggo sing Wis Mlebu','Longitude'=>'Garis bujur','Looking for the rest of the FullCalendar Options? They\'ve moved <a href="%s">here</a>, the options below are for overriding specific bits relevant to Events Manager.'=>'Golèk pilihan FullCalendar liyané? Wis dipindhah <a href="%s">mrene</a>, pilihan ing ngisor iki kanggo nimpa bagéan tartamtu sing gegayutan karo Events Manager.','Lost your password?'=>'Lali sandhi sampéyan?','Mail sending method'=>'Cara ngirim surat','Main Search Fields'=>'Kolom Nggoleki Utama','Main recurrence set %s are required.'=>'%s set pengulangan utama dibutuhaké.','Make this the default view.'=>'Jadikna tampilan gawan.','Makes Events Manager translatable with WPML, including tickets, location addresses, booking forms and email templates. Supports recurring events and multisite. Requires WPML.'=>'Ndadèkaké Events Manager bisa diterjemahaké nganggo WPML, kalebu tiket, alamat lokasi, formulir pemesanan lan cithakan email. Ndhukung acara bola-balik lan multisitus. Mbutuhaké WPML.','Manage %s Bookings'=>'Atur Pemesanan %s','Manage Person\'s Booking'=>'Atur Pemesanan Wong','Manage booking: %s'=>'Atur pemesanan: %s','Manage bookings'=>'Kelola pemesanan','Manage bookings link text'=>'Teks pranālā kelola pemesanan','Manage events, bookings, 