ttending'=>'Ora Melu','Not Required'=>'Ora Kudu','Not Supplied'=>'Ora Diwènèhaké','Not a Group Event'=>'Dudu Acara Klompok','Not approved, spaces full.'=>'Ora disetujoni, panggonan wis kebak.','Not attending any events yet.'=>'Durung melu acara apa waé.','Not enough spaces'=>'Panggonan ora cukup','Not finished'=>'Durung rampung','Not in sync with the provider'=>'Ora sinkron karo panyedhia','Not started'=>'Durung diwiwiti','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default setting, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'Élinga yèn nemtokaké kācā %s ing dhuwur bakal nimpa arsip iki yèn URL-é tabrakan (sing minangka setélan gawan, lan dianjuraké kanggo kompatibilitas plugin maksimal). Sampéyan bisa nduwèni loro-lorone bebarengan, nanging sampéyan kudu mesthekaké yèn slug kācā lan %s sampéyan béda.','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default settings, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'Elinga yèn nemtokaké kācā %s ing dhuwur bakal ngganti arsip iki yèn URL-é padha (iki setélan gawan lan dianjuraké supaya paling cocog karo plugin liyané). Sampéyan bisa nganggo loro-lorone bebarengan, nanging slug kācā lan %s kudu béda.','Note: %s'=>'Cathetan: %s','Notfication email?'=>'Email kabar?','Nothing, migrate the tickets only'=>'Ora ana, pindhahake tiket wae','Notification sender address'=>'Alamat pangirim kabar','Notification sender name'=>'Jeneng pangirim kabar','Notification types'=>'Tipe kabar','Notify admin email(s)'=>'Email admin sing dikabari','Now there are #_BOOKEDSPACES spaces reserved, #_AVAILABLESPACES are still available.'=>'Saiki wis ana #_BOOKEDSPACES panggonan sing dipesen, #_AVAILABLESPACES isih sumadya.','Number of events'=>'Jumlah acara','Number of locations'=>'Jumlah lokasi','OAuth application information incomplete.'=>'Informasi aplikasi OAuth ora lengkap.','On'=>'Ing','On by default hides the link of every virtual event until the default time below. Off by default only hides the link of an event that is given a time of its own.'=>'Yen diuripaké kanthi gawan, pranālā saben acara virtual didelikake nganti wektu gawan ing ngisor. Yen dipateni kanthi gawan, mung pranālā acara sing duwé wektu dhéwé sing didelikake.','Once a booking has been made, you can also allow a user to RSVP that booking, which confirms their intention of attending. This can be independent of the booking status itself.'=>'Sawisé pemesanan ditindakaké, sampéyan uga bisa ngidinaké panganggo ngisi RSVP kanggo pemesanan kasebut, sing ngonfirmasi niyaté melu. Iki bisa mandhiri saka status pemesanan dhéwé.','Once cancelled, you can allow susers to re-instate their booking, provided there are still enough spaces.'=>'Sawisé dibatalake, sampéyan bisa ngidinaké panganggo mulihaké pemesanané, anggere isih ana panggonan sing cukup.','Once you have entered valid API information, you will see a button below to connect your site to %s.'=>'Sawisé sampéyan ngisi informasi API sing sah, sampéyan bakal weruh tombol ing ngisor kanggo nyambungaké situs sampéyan menyang %s.','One Line'=>'Siji Baris','Online bookings are not available for this event.'=>'Pemesanan online ora sumadya kanggo acara iki.','Only %1$d space is left for %2$s.'=>'Mung kari %1$d panggonan kanggo %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Mung kari %1$d panggonan kanggo %2$s.','Only show events starting within a certain time limit on the events page. Default is future events with no end time limit.'=>'Namung tampilaké acara sing diwiwiti ing wektu watesan tartamtu ing kācā acara. Gawan yaiku acara sing bakal teka tanpa watesan wektu rampung.','Only show this link to attendees with virtual access'=>'Tampilake pranālā iki mung kanggo peserta sing duwé akses virtual','Only site admins see these changes.'=>'Mung admin situs sing weruh owah-owahan iki.','Only the selected countries will be included in the country selection list. This takes precedence over excluded countries.'=>'Mung negara sing dipilih bakal kanthi ing dhaptar pilihan negara. Iki luwih diutamakaké tinimbang negara sing dikejābā.','Option value has been reverted. Please save your settings for it to take effect.'=>'Nilai opsi wis dibalèkaké. Mangga simpen setélan sampéyan supaya ngetrapaké.','Optional PHP date format for timeslot dates. Leave blank to use the default event date format. Example: %s'=>'Format tanggal PHP opsional kanggo tanggal slot wektu. Kosongké kanggo nggunakaké format tanggal acara gawan. Conto: %s','Optional PHP date format for timeslot times. Leave blank to use the default event time format. Example: %s'=>'Format tanggal PHP opsional kanggo wektu slot wektu. Kosongké kanggo nggunakaké format wektu acara gawan. Conto: %s','Options'=>'Opsi','Order'=>'Urutan','Order By'=>'Urutaké miturut','Order Tickets By'=>'Urutaké Tiket Miturut','Order by'=>'Urutaké miturut','Order by %s'=>'Urutaké miturut %s','Order by end date, end time, then event name'=>'Urutaké miturut tanggal rampung, wektu rampung, banjur jeneng acara','Order by event name, then event start time'=>'Urutaké miturut jeneng acara, banjur wektu wiwitan acara','Order by event start time, then event name'=>'Urutaké miturut wektu wiwitan acara, banjur jeneng acara','Order by name'=>'Urutaké miturut jeneng','Order by name, end date, then end time'=>'Urutaké miturut jeneng, tanggal rampung, banjur wektu rampung','Order by name, start date, then start time'=>'Urutaké miturut jeneng, tanggal wiwit, banjur wektu wiwit','Order by start date, start time'=>'Urutaké miturut tanggal wiwit, wektu wiwit','Order by start date, start time, then event name'=>'Urutaké miturut tanggal wiwit, wektu wiwit, banjur jeneng acara','Order of the locations'=>'Urutan lokasi','Organizer'=>'Panyelenggara' . "\0" . 'Panyelenggara','Organizer name'=>'Jeneng panyelenggara','Organizer names'=>'Jeneng panyelenggara','Organizers'=>'Panyelenggara','Organizers are shared between events and hold contact details. Show them with #_EVENTORGANIZERS or #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.'=>'Panyelenggara dienggo bareng antarane acara lan nyimpen rincian kontak. Tampilake nganggo #_EVENTORGANIZERS utawa #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.','Organizers imported from CSV files'=>'Panyelenggara sing diimpor saka berkas CSV','Orphaned events may show on your event lists but not point to real event pages, and can be deleted.'=>'Acara yatim bisa katon ing dhaptar acara sampéyan nanging ora nuding menyang kācā acara sing nyata, lan bisa dibusak.','Other'=>'Liyane','Our CSS file will be EXCLUDED on all of these pages. Takes precedence over inclusion rules.'=>'Berkas CSS kita bakal DIKEJĀBAKAKÉ ing kabèh kācā iki. Luwih diutamakaké tinimbang aturan panyakupan.','Our CSS file will only be INCLUDED on all of these pages.'=>'Berkas CSS kita mung bakal DILEBOKAKÉ ing kabèh kācā iki.','Our theme has multiple CSS variables that can be overriden easily. The options below could be overriden just as easily via one line of CSS in your %s settings area, for example %s'=>'Tema kita nduwèni pirang-pirang variabel CSS sing bisa ditimpa kanthi gampang. Pilihan ing ngisor bisa ditimpa kanthi gampang uga lumantar siji baris CSS ing area setélan %s sampéyan, contoné %s','Output format (advanced)'=>'Format output (lanjutan)','Override Default Formats?'=>'Nimpa Format Gawan?','Override Defaults'=>'Timpa Gawan','Override Excerpts with Formats?'=>'Nimpa Kutipan nganggo Format?','Override calendar on events page?'=>'Timpa tanggalan ing kācā acara?','Override calendar shortcode?'=>'Timpa shortcode tanggalan?','Override with Formats?'=>'Timpa mawa Format?','Overrides the default calendar shortcode. You can also use [events_fullcalendar] instead.'=>'Nimpa shortcode tanggalan gawan. Sampéyan uga bisa nganggo [events_fullcalendar] kanggo gantiné.','Owner'=>'Pemilik','PDF tickets and invoices'=>'Tiket lan invoice PDF','PHP mail function'=>'Fungsi mail PHP','Page heading'=>'Irahan kācā','Pages'=>'Kācā','Pages using TEC shortcodes or blocks'=>'Kācā sing nganggo shortcode utawa blok TEC','Pardon the interruption... we hope you\'re enjoying Events Manager, and if so, we\'d really appreciate a positive review on the wordpress.org repository!'=>'Nyuwun pangapunten ngganggu... kita ngarep-arep sampeyan seneng nganggo Events Manager, lan yen mangkono, kita bakal matur nuwun banget yen sampeyan nulis ulasan positif ing repositori wordpress.org!','Parent %s'=>'%s Babon','Parent %s:'=>'%s Babon:','Parent Event'=>'Acara Babon','Parent Event Categories'=>'Kategori Acara Babon','Parent Event Category:'=>'Kategori Acara Babon:','Parent Event Tag:'=>'Tenger Acara Babon:','Parent Event Tags'=>'Tenger Acara Babon','Parent Location'=>'Lokasi Babon','Parent Repeating Event'=>'Acara Bola-balik Babon','Password'=>'Tembung Sandi','Password Lost and Found'=>'Sandhi Ilang lan Ditemokaké','Past'=>'Kapungkur','Past And Present Bookings'=>'Pemesanan Kepungkur lan Saiki','Past Events'=>'Acara Kapungkur','Past events'=>'Acara sing wis liwat','Pause'=>'Jeda','Paused'=>'Dijeda','Payment Information'=>'Informasi Pembayaran','Payment and Confirmation'=>'Pembayaran lan Konfirmasi','Payments with PayPal, Stripe, Square, Authorize.net or offline'=>'Pembayaran nganggo PayPal, Stripe, Square, Authorize.net utawa luring','Pending'=>'Ngenténi','Pending Spaces'=>'Panggonan sing Ngenténi','Pending and Approved'=>'Ngenteni lan Disetujoni','Pending booking email'=>'Email pemesanan ngenteni','Pending reschedule via primary recurrence.'=>'Ngenteni dijadwalaké manèh liwat pengulangan utama.','Pending reschedule.'=>'Ngenteni dijadwalaké manèh.','Pending review'=>'Ngenténi review','Performance Optimization'=>'Optimasi Kadigdayan','Permalink Slug'=>'Slug Pranālā Ajeg','Permalink Slugs'=>'Slug Pranālā Ajeg','Permalink slug must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens and forward slashes.'=>'Slug pranālā ajeg kudu isi mung huruf cilik, angka, tanda hubung lan garis miring.','Permanently deletes an Events Manager booking.'=>'Mbusak pemesanan Events Manager kanthi permanèn.','Personal Details'=>'Detil Pribadi','Personal details have successfully been modified.'=>'Detil pribadi kasil diowahi.','Phone'=>'Telpon','Phone Number'=>'Nomer Telpon','Phone Numbers'=>'Nomer Telpon','Phone number'=>'Nomer telpon','Phone numbers can be used for further contact for both those that make bookings and submit events. We offer an advanced international-compatible phone input field with multiple options which standardize and ensure valid/consistent international phone numbers are provided by your users.'=>'Nomer telpon bisa dienggo kanggo kontak luwih lanjut, kanggo sing nggawé pemesanan lan sing ngirim acara. Kita nawakaké kolom input telpon internasional sing canggih mawa pirang-pirang pilihan sing nyeragamaké lan mesthekaké nomer telpon internasional sing dilebokaké panganggo sampéyan sah/konsisten.','Physical'=>'Fisik','Physical Locations'=>'Lokasi Fisik','Physical Spaces'=>'Panggonan Fisik','Physical Venue'=>'Papan Fisik','Pie Chart'=>'Grafik Lingkaran','Pills'=>'Pil','Pixelite'=>'Pixelite','Placeholders for customizing event pages'=>'Placeholder kanggo ngraciki kaca acara','Placeholders: %1$s and %2$s plus the usual booking placeholders.'=>'Placeholder: %1$s lan %2$s sarta placeholder pemesanan sing lumrah.','Please <a href="%s">Log In</a> to view your bookings.'=>'Mangga <a href="%s">Mlebu Log</a> kanggo ndeleng pemesanan sampéyan.','Please add a User ID.'=>'Mangga tambahaké ID Panganggo.','Please check the communications consent box so we can contact you if necessary.'=>'Mangga centhang kothak persetujuan komunikasi supaya kita bisa ngubungi sampéyan yèn perlu.','Please check the consent box so we can collect and store your submitted information.'=>'Mangga centhang kotak persetujuan supaya kita bisa ngumpulaké lan nyimpen informasi sing sampéyan kirim.','Please choose a virtual platform for this event.'=>'Mangga pilih platform virtual kanggo acara iki.','Please confirm that you wish to withdraw from the following booking. This step submits your declaration of withdrawal.'=>'Mangga konfirmasi yèn sampéyan arep mundur saka pemesanan ing ngisor iki. Langkah iki ngirim pratelan mundur sampéyan.','Please enter a valid URL for this event location.'=>'Mangga lebokna URL sing sah kanggo lokasi acara iki.','Please enter a valid URL.'=>'Mangga lebokna URL sing valid.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Mangga lebokna alamat email sing valid.','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'Mangga lebokna nomer telpon sing sah.','Please enter a valid ticket price e.g. 10.50 (no currency signs)'=>'Mangga lebokna rega tiket sing sah, contoné 10.50 (tanpa tandha mata uang)','Please enter dates and times for your first recurrence pattern in the recurrence section.'=>'Mangga lebokna tanggal lan wektu kanggo pola pengulangan sing kapisan ing bagean pengulangan.','Please enter your Location ID, or leave blank for no location.'=>'Mangga lebokaké ID Lokasi sampéyan, utawa kosongaké yèn ora ana lokasi.','Please enter your Location ID.'=>'Mangga lebokaké ID Lokasi sampéyan.','Please fill in all required fields correctly.'=>'Mangga isi kabèh kolom sing dibutuhaké kanthi bener.','Please provide a dashicons class, url to a png/svg file, or leave blank for default menu icon.'=>'Mangga wènèhi kelas dashicons, url menyang berkas png/svg, utawa kosongké kanggo ikon menu gawan.','Please provide a valid phone number.'=>'Mangga wènèhi nomer telpon sing valid.','Please provide some link text for this event location URL.'=>'Mangga lebokna teks pranālā kanggo URL lokasi acara iki.','Please select a valid location.'=>'Mangga pilih lokasi sing sah.','Please select at least one space to proceed with your booking.'=>'Mangga pilih paling ora siji panggonan kanggo nerusaké pemesanan sampéyan.','Please specify what days of the week this event should occur on.'=>'Mangga tamtokna dinā ing minggu nalika acara iki kudu kelakon.','Please supply a valid email format.'=>'Mangga lebokna format email sing sah.','Please update your network and when you\'re happy with the changes you can also finalize the migration by deleting unecessary data in the %s page.'=>'Mangga anyaraké jaringan sampéyan lan yèn wis marem karo owah-owahané sampéyan uga bisa ngrampungaké migrasi kanthi mbusak data sing ora perlu ing kācā %s.','Please upload a valid txt file containing Events Manager import settings.'=>'Mangga unggah berkas txt sing valid sing isine setelan impor Events Manager.','Please visit the %s to see migration options.'=>'Mangga bukak %s kanggo ndeleng pilihan migrasi.','Please wait while the booking is being submitted.'=>'Mangga ngenteni nalika pemesanan lagi dikirim.','Plural'=>'Jamak','Plural version of the Custom Post Type (CPT) name, used internally.'=>'Versi jamak saka jeneng Custom Post Type (CPT), digunakaké sacara internal.','Plural version of the Custom Post Type name, used internally.'=>'Versi jamak saka jeneng Custom Post Type, digunakaké sacara internal.','Plural version of the Type Key, used internally. For example, workshop would be workshops.'=>'Versi jamak saka Kunci Tipe, digunakaké sacara internal. Contone, workshop dadi workshops.','Popular %s'=>'%s Kondang','Popular Event Categories'=>'Kategori Acara Kondang','Popular Event Tags'=>'Tenger Acara Kondang','Post Classes'=>'Kelas Pos','Postcode'=>'Kode Pos','Preparing'=>'Nyiapaké','Prevent unnecessary loading of JavaScript files on pages where they are not needed.'=>'Nyegah pemuatan berkas JavaScript sing ora perlu ing kācā sing ora mbutuhaké.','Preview Formats'=>'Pratinjau Format','Preview Start Times'=>'Pratinjau Wektu Wiwitan','Preview mode is enabled. Only site admins will see the difference, our new default formats will be used instead of your current formats. You can continue to edit/save this settings page without overwriting saved settings.'=>'Mode pratinjau diaktifake. Mung admin situs sing weruh bédané, format gawan anyar kita bakal digunakaké ing panggonané format sampéyan saiki. Sampéyan bisa terus nyunting/nyimpen kācā setélan iki tanpa nimpa setélan sing wis disimpen.','Previous Period'=>'Periode Sadurunge','Previous Year'=>'Taun Sadurunge','Previous page'=>'Kācā sadurungé','Price'=>'Rega','Pricing'=>'Rega','Privacy Consent'=>'Persetujuan Privasi','Privacy Policy and Consent'=>'Kabijakan Privasi lan Persetujuan','Pro Add-On'=>'Add-On Pro','Pro installs alongside the free Events Manager plugin. Every license includes one year of updates and Pro support.'=>'Pro diinstal bebarengan karo plugin Events Manager gratis. Saben lisensi kalebu pembaruan lan dhukungan Pro sajrone setaun.','Processing ...'=>'Lagi diproses ...','Profile'=>'Profil','Progress'=>'Kemajuan','Provide one of `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, or a multipart `file` upload.'=>'Wènèhana salah siji saka `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, utawa unggahan `file` multipart.','Published'=>'Diterbitaké','Published Event'=>'Acara sing Dipacak','Push notifications for the <a href="%s">mobile app</a>. When enabled, registered devices receive real-time pushes for bookings and events on this site, and the app exposes per-type notification preferences to the user.'=>'Kabar push kanggo <a href="%s">aplikasi seluler</a>. Nalika diaktifaké, piranti sing wis kadaftar nampa push wektu nyata kanggo pemesanan lan acara ing situs iki, lan aplikasi nuduhake pilihan kabar per tipe marang panganggo.','QR code check-in from your phone'=>'Check-in kode QR saka telpon sampeyan','Quantity'=>'Jumlah','RSS'=>'RSS','RSS Scope'=>'Jangkauan RSS','RSS description format'=>'Format katrangan RSS','RSS limit'=>'Wates RSS','RSS main description'=>'Katrangan utama RSS','RSS main title'=>'Judul utama RSS','RSS title format'=>'Format judul RSS','RSVP'=>'RSVP','RSVP - %s'=>'RSVP - %s','RSVP Modifications'=>'Owah-owahan RSVP','RSVP Status'=>'Status RSVP','RSVP Syncing'=>'Sinkronisasi RSVP','Re-Check Updates'=>'Priksa Maneh Nganyari','Re-Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Acara sing Dikirim Manèh Ngenteni Persetujuan','Re-order.'=>'Urutaké manèh.','Read more on our blog'=>'Waca luwih akèh ing blog kita','Read our announcement'=>'Waca woro-woro kita','Read-only abilities for retrieving Events Manager events, locations, bookings, categories, and tags.'=>'Kemampuan mung-waca kanggo njupuk acara, lokasi, pemesanan, kategori, lan tenger Events Manager.','Reason (optional)'=>'Alesan (opsional)','Received on: %s'=>'Ditampa ing: %s','Received: %s'=>'Ditampa: %s','Recent Bookings'=>'Pemesanan Anyar','Recent Events Manager updates have made security improvements to how events are output, specifically with Shortcodes. The result is that some shortcode created prior to these updates will be displayed as raw/escaped HTML rather than content.'=>'Nganyari Events Manager pungkasan nambah keamanan ing cara acara ditampilaké, utamané karo Shortcode. Akibaté, sawetara shortcode sing digawé sadurungé nganyari iki bakal ditampilaké minangka HTML mentah/ter-escape, dudu isi.','Reconnect'=>'Sambung Manèh','Recurrence %s'=>'Pengulangan %s','Recurrence %s cannot start after they end.'=>'Pengulangan %s ora bisa diwiwiti sawisé rampung.','Recurrence Interval'=>'Interval Pengulangan','Recurrences'=>'Pengulangan','Recurrences last all day.'=>'Pengulangan sedina muput.','Recurrences that currently take place within new unavailable dates will be %s'=>'Pengulangan sing saiki ana ing tanggal ora kasedhiya anyar bakal %s','Recurrences will end on:'=>'Pengulangan bakal rampung ing:','Recurrences will span between:'=>'Pengulangan bakal nyakup antarané:','Recurrences will start from:'=>'Pengulangan bakal diwiwiti saka:','Recurring'=>'Bola-balik','Recurring %s'=>'%s Bola-balik','Recurring Event'=>'Acara Bola-balik','Recurring Events'=>'Acara Bola-balik','Recurring Events Picker'=>'Pamilih Acara Bola-balik','Recurring events (Pro)'=>'Acara bola-balik (Pro)','Recurring events allow you to create one event page with recurring dates on the same page. Recurrences have their own bookings assigned to them, but can be linked with shared tickets.'=>'Acara bola-balik ngidini sampéyan nggawé siji kācā acara mawa tanggal bola-balik ing kācā sing padha. Saben pengulangan nduwèni pemesanan dhéwé, nanging bisa disambungaké mawa tiket bareng.','Recurring events have a picker in order to load the right booking form, choose your picker style for your booking forms.'=>'Acara bola-balik nduwé pamilih kanggo ngunggahaké formulir pemesanan sing bener, pilih gagrag pamilih kanggo formulir pemesanan sampéyan.','Redirect any other old addresses, such as single dates of recurring events, series pages and calendar views, once The Events Calendar is deactivated'=>'Alihaké alamat lawas liyané, kayata tanggal tunggal acara bola-balik, kācā seri lan tampilan tanggalan, sawisé The Events Calendar dinonaktifaké','Refresh'=>'Segerna','Region'=>'Wilayah','Region:'=>'Wilayah:','Registration Email Templates'=>'Cithakan Email Registrasi','Registration Information'=>'Informasi Pendaftaran','Registration email'=>'Email registrasi','Registration email subject'=>'Subyek email registrasi','Reject'=>'Tolak','Rejected'=>'Ditolak','Rejected booking email'=>'Email pemesanan ditolak','Remember Me'=>'Élingānā Aku','Remember and hide checkbox'=>'Éling lan delikaké kotak centhang','Remember and show checkbox'=>'Éling lan tampilaké kotak centhang','Remember filtering options'=>'Elingi opsi panyaringan','Remember these settings'=>'Elingi setélan iki','Remembering Consent'=>'Éling Persetujuan','Remove'=>'Buwang','Remove Image'=>'Ngilangi Gambar','Remove Orphaned Events'=>'Buwang Acara Yatim','Remove or reorder columns below.'=>'Busak utawa tatani manèh kolom ing ngisor.','Remove this recurrence.'=>'Buwang pengulangan iki.','Remove this ticket booking'=>'Busak pemesanan tiket iki','Rename %s?'=>'Ganti jeneng %s?','Renew license'=>'Gawé anyar lisensi','Renew or upgrade'=>'Gawé anyar utawa upgrade','Repeat a number of times'=>'Baleni sawetara kali','Repeat interval "%s" is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Interval baleni "%s" dudu wilangan bulat 1 utawa luwih.','Repeat interval (every 1, 2, 3 ...)'=>'Interval baleni (saben 1, 2, 3 ...)','Repeat on day of the month (1 to 31, or last)'=>'Baleni ing tanggal saka sawulan (1 nganti 31, utawa last)','Repeat on these dates'=>'Baleni ing tanggal-tanggal iki','Repeat on week of the month (first to fourth, or last)'=>'Baleni ing minggu saka sawulan (first nganti fourth, utawa last)','Repeat on weekdays'=>'Baleni ing dina minggu','Repeat rules Events Manager does not have'=>'Aturan baleni sing ora ana ing Events Manager','Repeat until (date)'=>'Baleni nganti (tanggal)','Repeat value "%s" is not understood. Use daily, weekly, monthly or yearly.'=>'Nilai baleni "%s" ora dimangerteni. Gunakna daily, weekly, monthly utawa yearly.','Repeated events are similar to recurrences, but each event is independent of each other with its own page on your site and entirely separate bookings. You can mass-edit the recurrences by editing your repeating event.'=>'Acara bola-balik padha karo pengulangan, nanging saben acara mandhiri lan nduwèni kācā dhéwé ing situs sampéyan, uga pemesanan sing pisah babar blas. Sampéyan bisa ndandani kabèh pengulangan kanthi ndandani acara bola-balik sampéyan.','Repeating'=>'Bola-balik','Repeating %s'=>'%s Bola-balik','Repeating Event'=>'Acara Bola-balik','Repeating Events'=>'Acara Bola-balik','Repeating Events Template'=>'Cithakan Acara Bola-balik','Repeats'=>'Baleni','Repeats (daily, weekly, monthly or yearly)'=>'Baleni (daily, weekly, monthly utawa yearly)','Replace TEC shortcodes and blocks in posts and pages with Events Manager equivalents'=>'Ganti shortcode lan blok TEC ing kiriman lan kācā nganggo sing padha saka Events Manager','Require locations for events?'=>'Wajibaké lokasi kanggo acara?','Required'=>'Dibutuhaké','Required?'=>'Kudu?','Reschedule'=>'Jadwalaké Manèh','Reschedule %s Times?'=>'Jadwalaké Manèh Wektu %s?','Reschedule Events'=>'Jadwalaké Manèh Acara','Reschedule Recurrences?'=>'Jadwalaké Manèh Pengulangan?','Resend Email'=>'Kirim Ulang Email','Reserved unconfirmed spaces?'=>'Cadhangaké panggonan sing durung dikonfirmasi?','Reset'=>'Setél Ulang','Reset Event Timezones'=>'Setél Ulang Zona Wektu Acara','Reset Events Manager'=>'Setel Ulang Events Manager','Reset Timezones'=>'Setél Ulang Zona Wektu','Reset this form to create a location or search again.'=>'Setel ulang formulir iki kanggo gawé lokasi utawa nggolèki manèh.','Reset to default value?'=>'Balèkaké menyang nilai gawan?','Resheduled recurrences that fall outside new pattern will be %s'=>'Pengulangan sing dijadwalaké manèh lan tiba ing njaba pola anyar bakal %s','Responsive'=>'Responsif','Responsive Behaviour'=>'Prilaku Responsif','Restrict to'=>'Watesi kanggo','Restrict uploads to a specific type of file. Leave as "Any Type" to allow all.'=>'Watesi unggahan menyang tipe berkas tartamtu. Tinggalake minangka "Tipe Apa Wae" kanggo ngidinake kabeh.','Result'=>'Asil','Results per Page'=>'Kasil saben Kācā','Resume'=>'Terusake','Resume Previous Attempt (All Blogs)'=>'Terusaké Upaya Sadurungé (Kabèh Blog)','Retrieves Events Manager %s.'=>'Njupuk %s Events Manager.','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager events.'=>'Njupuk kumpulan acara Events Manager sing wis disaring.','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager locations.'=>'Njupuk kumpulan lokasi Events Manager sing wis disaring.','Retrieves booking availability, spaces, and ticket availability for one event.'=>'Njupuk kasedhiyan pemesanan, panggonan, lan kasedhiyan tiket kanggo siji acara.','Retrieves bookings visible to the current user.'=>'Njupuk pemesanan sing katon kanggo panganggo saiki.','Retrieves one Events Manager %s by ID.'=>'Njupuk siji %s Events Manager miturut ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager event by ID.'=>'Njupuk siji acara Events Manager miturut ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager location by ID.'=>'Njupuk siji lokasi Events Manager miturut ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager ticket by ID.'=>'Njupuk siji tiket Events Manager miturut ID.','Retrieves one booking by ID if visible to the current user.'=>'Njupuk siji pemesanan miturut ID yèn katon kanggo panganggo saiki.','Retrieves tickets for one Events Manager event.'=>'Njupuk tiket kanggo siji acara Events Manager.','Returns countries with their ISO-3166 alpha-2 code and translated display name. By default returns the full ISO list — useful for populating a country picker. Pass `only_available: true` to narrow the result to countries that have at least one stored location row.'=>'Ngasilaké negara-negara kanthi kode alpha-2 ISO-3166 lan jeneng tampilan sing wis diterjemahaké. Kanthi gawan ngasilaké dhaptar ISO lengkap, migunani kanggo ngisi pamilih negara. Lebokna `only_available: true` kanggo mbatesi asil menyang negara sing nduwèni paling ora siji baris lokasi sing disimpen.','Returns the distinct list of region names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` to narrow results to one country.'=>'Ngasilaké dhaptar jeneng wilayah sing béda-béda sing ana ing lokasi Events Manager. Lebokna `country` kanggo mbatesi asil menyang siji negara.','Returns the distinct list of state/province names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` and/or `region` to narrow results.'=>'Ngasilaké dhaptar jeneng negara bagian/provinsi sing béda-béda sing ana ing lokasi Events Manager. Lebokna `country` lan/utawa `region` kanggo mbatesi asil.','Returns the distinct list of town/city names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country`, `region`, and/or `state` to narrow results.'=>'Ngasilaké dhaptar jeneng kutha sing béda-béda sing ana ing lokasi Events Manager. Lebokna `country`, `region`, lan/utawa `state` kanggo mbatesi asil.','Returns the exact fields, payload locations, payment options, and a ready-to-submit example payload needed to create a booking for one event. Call this before create-booking.'=>'Ngasilaké kolom pas, panggonan payload, pilihan pembayaran, lan conto payload sing siap dikirim sing dibutuhaké kanggo nggawé pemesanan kanggo siji acara. Celuken iki sadurungé create-booking.','Revert to viewing your previously saved fromats.'=>'Bali ndeleng format sing sampéyan simpen sadurungé.','Revoked'=>'Dicabut','Right of Withdrawal (EU)'=>'Hak Mbatalake (EU)','Rings'=>'Ring','Roll back'=>'Balèkaké','Rollback'=>'Pambalèkan','Rolled back'=>'Wis dibalèkaké','Row'=>'Larik','Rows imported'=>'Larik sing diimpor','Rows skipped'=>'Larik sing dilewati','Run again (sync changes)'=>'Jalanaké maneh (sinkronaké owah-owahan)','Running…'=>'Lagi mlaku…','SMTP Encryption'=>'Enkripsi SMTP','SMTP authentication is often needed. If you use Gmail, make sure to set this parameter to Yes'=>'Otentikasi SMTP asring dibutuhake. Yen sampeyan nggunakake Gmail, priksa manawa nyetel parameter iki dadi Ya','SMTP password'=>'Sandhi SMTP','SMTP username'=>'Jeneng panganggo SMTP','Sale Averages'=>'Rata-rata Dodolan','Sales'=>'Dodolan','Same as <em>Date Format</em>, but this is used for the datepickers used by Events Manager.'=>'Padha karo <em>Format Tanggal</em>, nanging iki digunakaké kanggo pamilih tanggal sing digunakaké Events Manager.','Same concept as the body classes option, but some themes also use the <code>post_class()</code> function within page content to differentiate styling between post types.'=>'Konsepé padha karo pilihan kelas body, nanging sawetara tema uga nggunakaké fungsi <code>post_class()</code> ing isi kācā kanggo mbédakaké gagrag antarane tipe pos.','Sanitize shortcode content?'=>'Sanitasi isi shortcode?','Save'=>'Nyimpen','Save %d%%'=>'Irit %d%%','Save Changes'=>'Simpen Owahan','Save Settings'=>'Simpen Setelan','Save Ticket'=>'Simpen Tiket','Save imported events and locations as'=>'Simpen acara lan lokasi sing diimpor minangka','Save your settings for this to take effect!'=>'Simpen setélan sampéyan supaya iki bisa mlaku!','Saved, but the featured image could not be attached: %s. To fix it: call upload-media (use content_base64 if the source blocks server-side fetches, e.g. Unsplash), then either pass featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location on that same upload-media call, or pass the returned attachment id as featured_image to update-event / update-location.'=>'Wis disimpen, nanging gambar fitur ora bisa disampiraké: %s. Cara ndandani: celuken upload-media (gunakna content_base64 yèn sumber ngalangi pengambilan saka sisih server, contoné Unsplash), banjur lebokna featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location ing panggilan upload-media sing padha, utawa lebokna id lampiran sing dibalèkaké minangka featured_image menyang update-event / update-location.','Scope'=>'Jangkauan','Scope of the locations'=>'Jangkauan lokasi','Search'=>'Nggolèki','Search %s'=>'Nggolèki %s','Search %s...'=>'Nggolèki %s...','Search Event Categories'=>'Nggolèki Kategori Acara','Search Event Tags'=>'Nggolèki Tenger Acara','Search Events'=>'Nggolèki Acara','Search Filter Label'=>'Label Panyaring Panggolékan','Search Form'=>'Formulir Nggoleki','Search Forms'=>'Formulir Nggoleki','Search Locations'=>'Nggolèki Lokasi','Search Repeating Events'=>'Nggolèki Acara Bola-balik','Search Results View Type'=>'Tipe Tampilan Kasil Panggolékan','Search bookings'=>'Nggolèki pemesanan','Search button text'=>'Teks tombol nggoleki','Search form will be pre-selected with this country.'=>'Formulir nggoleki bakal wis milih negara iki.','Search forms'=>'Formulir nggoleki','Searching...'=>'Lagi nggolèki...','See All'=>'Deleng Kabèh','See original translation.'=>'Deleng terjemahan asli.','Select Location'=>'Pilih Lokasi','Select a Timezone to reset all your blog events to.'=>'Pilih Zona wektu kanggo nyetel ulang kabèh acara blog sampéyan.','Select a blog and click the button next to it to clean up that specific blog. You must clean up one blog at a time.'=>'Pilih blog lan klik tombol ing sandhingé kanggo ngresiki blog tartamtu kasebut. Sampéyan kudu ngresiki siji blog saben sepisan.','Select a blog...'=>'Pilih blog...','Select a date'=>'Pilih tanggal','Select a group you admin to attach this event to it. Note that all other admins of that group can modify the booking.'=>'Pilih klompok sing sampéyan kelola kanggo nyambungaké acara iki. Elinga yèn kabèh admin liyané ing klompok kuwi bisa ngowahi pemesanan.','Select a time'=>'Pilih wektu','Select date range'=>'Pilih rentang tanggal','Select dates'=>'Pilih tanggal','Select number of spaces'=>'Pilih jumlah panggonan','Select the booking you wish to withdraw from.'=>'Pilih pemesanan sing arep sampéyan mundur.','Select the editor type you\'d like to use for submitting content in your dashboard.'=>'Pilih tipe tukang ndandani sing arep dienggo kanggo ngirim isi ing dasbor sampéyan.','Select the method to send email notification.'=>'Pilih cara kanggo ngirim kabar email.','Select the options below and export all the records you have currently filtered (all pages) into a spreadsheet format.'=>'Pilih opsi ing ngisor lan ekspor kabèh rekaman sing saiki disaring (kabèh kācā) dadi format spreadsheet.','Select the view types a user can select to display on the default search form, you can override this selection using the %s argument in shortcodes and PHP functions.'=>'Pilihen tipe view sing bisa dipilih panganggo kanggo ditampilaké ing formulir nggoleki gawan, sampéyan bisa nimpa pilihan iki nganggo argumen %s ing shortcode lan fungsi PHP.','Select which archetypes this site will use and choose a default type.'=>'Pilih archetype endi sing bakal digunakaké situs iki lan pilih tipe gawan.','Select yes to allow bookings and tickets for events.'=>'Pilih ya kanggo ngidinaké pemesanan lan tiket kanggo acara.','Select yes to disable Events Manager from enabling thumbnails (some themes may already have this enabled, which we cannot be turned off here).'=>'Pilih ya kanggo nyegah Events Manager ngaktifaké miniatur (sawetara tema mbok menawa wis ngaktifaké iki, lan ora bisa dipateni ing kéné).','Select yes to enable the attributes feature'=>'Pilih ya kanggo ngaktifaké fitur atribut','Select yes to enable the category features'=>'Pilih ya kanggo ngaktifaké fitur kategori','Select yes to enable the tag features'=>'Pilih ya kanggo ngaktifaké fitur tetenger','Select yes to select location from a drop-down menu; location selection will be faster, but you will lose the ability to insert locations with events'=>'Pilih ya kanggo milih lokasi saka menu dropdown; pemilihan lokasi bakal luwih cepet, nanging sampéyan ora bisa nglebokaké lokasi bareng acara','Sell event tickets through your WooCommerce cart and checkout, with bookings kept in sync with orders, and take payment with any gateway WooCommerce supports. Sold separately on Woo.com and not included in Pro Plus.'=>'Adola tiket acara liwat kranjang lan checkout WooCommerce sampeyan, kanthi pemesanan sing disinkronaké karo pesenan, lan trima pembayaran nganggo gateway apa waé sing didhukung WooCommerce. Didol kapisah ing Woo.com lan ora kalebu ing Pro Plus.','Send Email'=>'Kirim Email','Send HTML Emails?'=>'Kirim Email HTML?','Send cancelled booking email?'=>'Ngirim email pemesanan dibatalaké?','Sends a general email to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled, which is customized in your %s setings.'=>'Ngirim email umum menyang kabèh pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi lan sing ngenténi kanggo acara sing dibatalaké, sing ditatani ing setélan %s sampéyan.','Sent to the consumer as the legally-required acknowledgment of receipt. It records the withdrawal statement and the exact date and time of receipt, and confirms receipt only — not the validity of the withdrawal.'=>'Dikirim marang konsumen minangka pangalembānā tampa sing dibutuhaké hukum. Isiné nyathet pratélan pambatalan lan tanggal lan wektu tampa sing pas, lan mung ngonfirmasi tampa, ora absahé pambatalan.','Separate %s with commas'=>'Pisahna %s nganggo koma','Separate Range Inputs?'=>'Input Rentang Kapisah?','Separate event categories with commas'=>'Pisahna kategori acara nganggo koma','Separate event tags with commas'=>'Pisahna tenger acara nganggo koma','Series pass, paid with booking #%d'=>'Pass seri, dibayar nganggo pemesanan #%d','Server API Credentials'=>'Kredensial API Server','Set booking status'=>'Setel status pemesanan','Setting this to no will allow you to submit events without locations. You can use the <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder to selectively display location information.'=>'Yèn iki diset ora, sampéyan bisa ngirim acara tanpa lokasi. Sampéyan bisa nggunakaké placeholder kondisional <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> utawa <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> kanggo nuduhake informasi lokasi sacara selektif.','Setting this to yes will also make your images crop efficiently with the %s feature in the %s plugin.'=>'Nyetel iki menyang ya uga bakal ndadèkaké gambar sampéyan di-crop kanthi efisien nganggo fitur %s ing plugin %s.','Setting this to yes will make all events save in the main site event tables (EM must also be activated). This allows you to share events across different blogs, such as showing events in your network whilst allowing users to display and manage their events within their own blog. Bear in mind that activating this will mean old events created on the sub-blogs will not be accessible anymore, and if you switch back they will be but new events created during global events mode will only remain on the main site.'=>'Yen disetel dadi ya, kabeh acara bakal disimpen ing tabel acara situs utama (EM uga kudu diaktifake). Iki ngidini sampeyan nuduhake acara ing antarane blog sing beda-beda, kayata nampilake acara ing jaringan sampeyan nalika ngidini panganggo nampilake lan ngatur acarane dhewe ing blog dhewe-dhewe. Elinga yen ngaktifake iki tegese acara lawas sing digawe ing sub-blog ora bakal bisa diakses maneh, lan yen sampeyan mbalik maneh acara kasebut bakal bisa diakses nanging acara anyar sing digawe sajrone mode acara global mung bakal tetep ing situs utama.','Setting this to yes will make categories display as a page rather than an archive.'=>'Nyetel iki dadi Yā bakal nampilaké kategori minangka kācā, dudu arsip.','Settings'=>'Setélan','Settings > Emails'=>'Setélan > Email','Settings Page'=>'Kācā Setélan','Settings have been reset back to default. Your events, locations and categories have not been modified.'=>'Setelan wis disetel ulang menyang gawan. Acara, lokasi lan kategori sampeyan ora diowahi.','Settings imported.'=>'Setelan wis diimpor.','Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding'=>'Dekode HTML Entity Shortcode','Shortcodes and blocks'=>'Shortcode lan blok','Shorten the calendar headings containing the days of the week, use 0 for the full name.'=>'Cendhakaké irah-irahan tanggalan sing isiné dinā ing saminggu, gunakna 0 kanggo jeneng lengkap.','Show'=>'Tampilake','Show "all events" link at bottom'=>'Tampilake pranālā "kabèh acara" ing ngisor','Show Advanced Options'=>'Tampilake Opsi Lanjutan','Show Advanced Search'=>'Katonaké Panggolèkan Tutug','Show Flags'=>'Tuduhaké Gendéra','Show Long Events?'=>'Tampilaké Acara Dawa?','Show Search'=>'Tuduhaké Panggolékan','Show Selected Dialcode'=>'Tuduhaké Kode Telpon sing Dipilih','Show all events link at bottom?'=>'Tampilake pranālā kabèh acara ing ngisor?','Show categories?'=>'Tampilaké kategori?','Show countries?'=>'Tampilaké negara?','Show date range?'=>'Tampilaké rentang tanggal?','Show dates in timeslots?'=>'Tampilaké tanggal ing slot wektu?','Show distance options?'=>'Tampilaké pilihan jarak?','Show events search?'=>'Tuduhaké panggolékan acara?','Show footer link?'=>'Tuduhaké pranālā ing sikil kācā?','Show form again?'=>'Tuduhaké formulir manèh?','Show fully booked timeslots?'=>'Tampilaké slot wektu sing kebak dipesen?','Show geolocation search?'=>'Tampilaké panggolékan geolokasi?','Show hide/show trigger?'=>'Tampilaké pemicu tampil/delik?','Show label'=>'Label katonaké','Show list on day with single event?'=>'Tampilaké daftar ing dinā sing namung duwé siji acara?','Show locations search?'=>'Tampilaké panggolèkan lokasi?','Show long events'=>'Tampilake acara dawa','Show main search bar?'=>'Tampilaké bilah nggoleki utama?','Show member-only tickets?'=>'Tampilaké tiket khusus anggota?','Show multiple tickets if logged out?'=>'Tampilaké pirang-pirang tiket yèn durung mlebu log?','Show number of locations'=>'Tampilake jumlah lokasi','Show regions?'=>'Tampilaké wilayah?','Show search filters on page load'=>'Tampilake filter panggolèkan nalika kaca dimuat','Show some love?'=>'Nuduhaké dhukungan?','Show sorting icon?'=>'Tampilaké ikon nyortir?','Show spaces left?'=>'Tampilaké panggonan sing isih ana?','Show states?'=>'Tampilaké negara bagéan?','Show tags?'=>'Tampilaké tetenger?','Show text search?'=>'Tampilaké panggolékan teks?','Show the flag of the selected country code and in the country selection list of the phone input field.'=>'Tuduhaké gendéra kode negara sing dipilih lan ing dhaptar pilihan negara ing kolom input telpon.','Show the join link publicly, for example on the event page and in calendar feeds'=>'Tampilake pranālā melu kanthi umum, contone ing kācā acara lan ing feed tanggalan','Show the sorting icon to change the ordering of search results.'=>'Tampilaké ikon nyortir kanggo ngowahi urutan kasil panggolékan.','Show ticket table in single ticket mode?'=>'Tampilaké tabel tiket ing mode tiket tunggal?','Show towns/cities?'=>'Tampilaké kutha/kuthā?','Show unavailable tickets?'=>'Tampilaké tiket sing ora sumadya?','Show upcoming timeslots on the initial booking form load before a visitor chooses a calendar date.'=>'Tampilaké slot wektu sing bakal teka nalika formulir pemesanan dimuat pisanan sadurungé pengunjung milih tanggal tanggalan.','Show upcoming timeslots?'=>'Tampilaké slot wektu sing bakal teka?','Show virtual events filter?'=>'Tampilake saringan acara virtual?','Show/Hide Filters'=>'Tampilake/Delikake Filter','Shown in place of the link until then. %s is replaced with the number of minutes.'=>'Ditampilake minangka gantine pranālā nganti wektu iku. %s diganti karo cacahé menit.','Shows events, posts or other post types in an AJAX month, week or day calendar that visitors can filter by category or tag. Events Manager integrates with it automatically.'=>'Nampilake acara, kiriman utawa jinis kiriman liyané ing tanggalan AJAX wulanan, mingguan utawa dinan sing bisa disaring pengunjung miturut kategori utawa tenger. Events Manager terintegrasi karo iki kanthi otomatis.','Sign In'=>'Mlebu','Sign Up'=>'Daftar','Similar to label but used in instances when referring to one single %s type.'=>'Padha karo label nanging digunakaké nalika ngrujuk marang siji tipe %s.','Since the event is recurring, you must specify an event end date greater than the start date.'=>'Amarga acara iki bola-balik, sampéyan kudu nemtokaké tanggal rampung acara sing luwih saka tanggal wiwit.','Single'=>'Tunggal','Single %s Format'=>'Format %s Siji','Single %s Page'=>'Kācā %s Tunggal','Single %s page format'=>'Format kācā %s tunggal','Single %s title format'=>'Format judul %s tunggal','Single Location/Event Map Format'=>'Format Peta Lokasi/Acara Siji','Single dot'=>'Titik tunggal','Single ticket mode?'=>'Mode tiket tunggal?','Site Categories'=>'Kategori Situs','Site admins will be allowed to rename the base event and location %s on their individual sites.'=>'Admin situs bakal diidinaké ngganti jeneng %s acara lan lokasi dhasar ing situs masing-masing.','Skip rows already on this site: events with the same name and start, locations with the same name'=>'Lewati larik sing wis ana ing situs iki: acara kanthi jeneng lan wiwitan sing padha, lokasi kanthi jeneng sing padha','Skip the row'=>'Lewati larik iki','Skipped'=>'Dilewati','Slug'=>'Slug','Slugs'=>'Slug','Small'=>'Cilik','Small Calendar'=>'Tanggalan Cilik','Sold Out'=>'Entek','Some WordPress themes don\'t follow best practices when generating navigation menus, and so the automatic title rewriting feature may cause problems, if your menus aren\'t working correctly on the event pages, try setting this to \'Yes\', and provide an appropriate HTML title format below.'=>'Sawetara tema WordPress ora nuruti praktik paling apik nalika nggawé menu navigasi, mula fitur panulisan ulang judul otomatis bisa nyebabaké masalah, yèn menu sampéyan ora mlaku kanthi bener ing kācā acara, cobanen nyetel iki menyang \'Ya\', lan wènèhana format judul HTML sing cocog ing ngisor.','Something went wrong saving your %s to the index table. Please inform a site administrator about this.'=>'Ana sing ora beres nalika nyimpen %s sampéyan menyang tabel indeks. Mangga kabari administrator situs.','Something went wrong with the recurrence update...'=>'Ana sing ora beres ing nganyari pengulangan...','Sorting'=>'Nyortir','Sorting Order'=>'Urutan Panyortiran','Spaces'=>'Panggonan','Spaces confirmed'=>'Panggonan sing wis dikonfirmasi','Split by timeslots?'=>'Pisahaké miturut slot wektu?','Spreadsheet'=>'Lembar Kerja','Stack By'=>'Tumpuk Miturut','Stacked metaboxes'=>'Kothak meta ditumpuk','Standard'=>'Standar','Standard Ticket'=>'Tiket Standar','Start'=>'Wiwiti','Start Date'=>'Tanggal Wiwitan','Start Time'=>'Wektu Wiwitan','Start comparison date'=>'Tanggal wiwitan pambandhingan','Start date'=>'Tanggal wiwitan','Start import'=>'Wiwiti impor','Start migration'=>'Wiwiti pamindhahan','Start time'=>'Wektu wiwitan','Start time is required.'=>'Wektu wiwit dibutuhaké.','Start/End'=>'Wiwitan/Pungkasan','Started'=>'Wis diwiwiti','State'=>'Negara Bagian','State or province'=>'Negara bagian utawa provinsi','State/County'=>'Provinsi/Kabupatèn','State/County:'=>'Negara Bagian/Kabupatèn:','Statistic Averages/Totals'=>'Rata-rata/Total Statistik','Status'=>'Status','Status reason'=>'Alesan status','Status: %s'=>'Status: %s','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager by subscribing to our newsletter!'=>'Tetep ngerti fitur, tips, lan wartane Events Manager sing paling anyar kanthi langganan buletin kita!','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager!'=>'Tetep ngerti fitur, tips, lan wartane Events Manager sing paling anyar!','Step 1 button'=>'Tombol langkah 1','Stopped on an error'=>'Mandheg amarga kesalahan','Styling Options'=>'Pilihan Gagrag','Sub Total'=>'Subtotal','Submit %s'=>'Kirim %s','Submit Booking'=>'Kirim Pemesanan','Submit Changes'=>'Kirim Owahan','Submit button text'=>'Teks tombol kirim','Submit button text (payment)'=>'Teks tombol kirim (pembayaran)','Submit button text (processing)'=>'Teks tombol kirim (diproses)','Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Acara sing Dikirim Ngenteni Persetujuan','Subscribe'=>'Langganan','Subscribe Now'=>'Langganan Saiki','Subscribe to Our Newsletter'=>'Langganan Buletin Kita','Subscribe to our newsletter to receive exclusive content, early access to new features, and helpful event management tips directly to your inbox.'=>'Langganan buletin kita kanggo nampa konten eksklusif, akses awal menyang fitur anyar, lan tips manajemen acara sing migunani langsung ing kothak mlebu sampeyan.','Subsite Archetype Mode'=>'Mode Archetype Subsitus','Subsites choose from network list'=>'Subsitus milih saka dhaptar jaringan','Subtotals will exclude taxes and display taxes separately.'=>'Subtotal bakal ora kalebu pajeg lan nampilaké pajeg kanthi kapisah.','Success Message'=>'Pesen Kasil','Successful booking'=>'Pemesanan kasil','Successful pending booking'=>'Pemesanan ngenteni kasil','Successfully Updated Message'=>'Pesen Kasil Dianyaraké','Successfully deleted all timeranges.'=>'Kasil mbusak kabèh rentang wektu.','Successfully saved %d timeranges.'=>'Kasil nyimpen %d rentang wektu.','Successfully saved %s'=>'Kasil nyimpen %s','Successfully updated %s'=>'Kasil nganyari %s','Super Advanced Mode'=>'Mode Tutug Banget','Surcharges (After Taxes)'=>'Biaya Tambahan (Sawise Pajeg)','Surcharges Before Taxes'=>'Biaya Tambahan Sadurunge Pajeg','Tabbed metaboxes'=>'Kothak meta mawa tab','Tag'=>'Tenger','Tag Related Placeholders'=>'Placeholder Related Tenger','Tag pages'=>'Kācā tenger','Tags'=>'Tetenger','Tags dropdown label'=>'Label dropdown tetenger','Tags list page'=>'Kācā dhaptar tetenger','Take bookings and payments on your own site, through your own payment gateway account, with no commission taken.'=>'Trima pemesanan lan pembayaran ing situs sampeyan dhéwé, liwat akun gateway pembayaran sampeyan dhéwé, tanpa komisi.','Tax'=>'Pajeg','Tax Rate'=>'Tarif Pajeg','Taxes'=>'Pajeg','Taxes included'=>'Wis kalebu pajeg','Taxonomy not found.'=>'Taksonomi ora ditemokaké.','Term could not be deleted.'=>'Istilah ora bisa dibusak.','Term name is required.'=>'Jeneng istilah dibutuhaké.','Term not found.'=>'Istilah ora ditemokaké.','Test Email Settings'=>'Uji Setelan Email','Text shown in place of the link until then'=>'Teks sing ditampilake minangka gantine pranālā nganti wektu iku','Text with link to calendar day page with all events for that day if there are more events than the limit above, leave blank for no link as the day number is also a link.'=>'Teks nganggo pranālā menyang kācā dinā tanggalan sing isiné kabèh acara ing dinā kasebut yèn acara luwih akèh tinimbang watesan ing ndhuwur, kosongaké yèn ora péngin pranālā amarga nomer dinā uga minangka pranālā.','That is not a CSV file. In your spreadsheet program, save or export the sheet as CSV first.'=>'Kuwi dudu berkas CSV. Ing program lembar kerja sampeyan, simpen utawa ekspor lembar kasebut minangka CSV dhisik.','That was tried a moment ago. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'Iki lagi waé dicoba. Mangga ngenteni sawetara menit lan coba manèh.','The %s account that hosts this event is no longer connected. Reconnect it or choose another account for the event.'=>'Akun %s sing nampung acara iki wis ora disambungake manèh. Sambungna manèh utawa pilih akun liyané kanggo acara iki.','The Events Calendar is still active. It doesn\'t need to be: Events Manager reads its data directly, so you can deactivate it and its add-ons first. Once migrated, Events Manager uses the same web addresses, so the two plugins compete for them until The Events Calendar is deactivated. Your Events Calendar data is not changed either way.'=>'The Events Calendar isih aktif. Sejatiné ora perlu: Events Manager maca datané langsung, dadi sampeyan bisa nonaktifaké kuwi lan add-on-é dhisik. Sawisé dipindhahaké, Events Manager nggunakaké alamat web sing padha, mula plugin loro kuwi rebutan alamat kasebut nganti The Events Calendar dinonaktifaké. Data Events Calendar sampeyan ora diowahi ing kasus apa waé.','The SMTP host. Usually it corresponds to \'localhost\'. If you use Gmail, set this value to \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.'=>'Host SMTP. Biasane cocog karo \'localhost\'. Yen sampeyan nggunakake Gmail, setel nilai iki dadi \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.','The add-on list can be refreshed once a day. Please try again tomorrow.'=>'Daftar add-on bisa disegerake sapisan saben dina. Mangga coba manèh sesuk.','The advanced search can be styled in a section-based format, with expandable sections, or directly inline with static headings. If you want headings for some sections and not others, choose Headings and leave specific section heading labels blank in settings further down.'=>'Panggolékan tutug bisa ditata nganggo format adhedhasar bagéan, nganggo bagéan sing bisa dibuka, utāwā langsung inline nganggo irah-irahan statis. Yèn sampéyan péngin irah-irahan kanggo sawetara bagéan lan ora kanggo liyané, pilihen Irah-irahan lan kosongaké label irah-irahan bagéan tartamtu ing setélan ing ngisor.','The bundled OAuth library is not loaded, so the AI / MCP setup screen is unavailable.'=>'Pustaka OAuth sing disertakaké ora dimuat, mula layar setélan AI / MCP ora kasedhiya.','The calendar headings uses abbreviated weekdays'=>'Irah-irahan tanggalan nganggo dinā sing disingkat','The country'=>'Negara','The country "%s" is not recognized and was left empty.'=>'Negara "%s" ora dikenali lan dikosongaké.','The date "%s" in the list of dates is not understood.'=>'Tanggal "%s" ing daftar tanggal ora dimangerteni.','The day of the month "%s" is not understood. Use 1 to 31, or last.'=>'Tanggal saka sawulan "%s" ora dimangerteni. Gunakna 1 nganti 31, utawa last.','The default minimum width, in pixels, that each grid item can shrink to fit on one line.'=>'Jembaré minimum gawan, ing piksel, sing bisa diciyutaké saben item kothak supaya muat ing siji baris.','The default value is blank so that the booking submission button appears just below the %s section.'=>'Nilai gawan kosong supaya tombol pengiriman pemesanan katon pas ing ngisor bagéan %s.','The description of the event that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Katrangan acara sing bakal katon ing tanggalan.','The email "%s" is not an email address and was left out.'=>'Email "%s" dudu alamat email lan ditinggal.','The end date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Tanggal pungkasan "%s" ora dimangerteni.','The end is before the start.'=>'Pungkasan luwih dhisik tinimbang wiwitan.','The end time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Wektu pungkasan "%s" ora dimangerteni.','The event name. Example: Birthday party'=>'Jeneng acara. Conto: Pesta ulang taun','The featured image was left out: %s'=>'Gambar unggulan ditinggal: %s','The file content does not match its file extension.'=>'Isi berkas ora cocog karo ekstensi berkas.','The file could not be read.'=>'Berkas ora bisa diwaca.','The file did not upload. Choose a CSV file and try again.'=>'Berkas ora kasil diunggah. Pilih berkas CSV lan coba manèh.','The file does not appear to be a valid Microsoft Office document.'=>'Berkas iki katon dudu dokumen Microsoft Office sing valid.','The file does not appear to be a valid PDF.'=>'Berkas iki katon dudu PDF sing valid.','The file has no column named "%s".'=>'Berkas ora duwé kolom kanthi jeneng "%s".','The file is empty.'=>'Berkas kosong.','The file is too big! Maximum allowed size: '=>'Berkas kegedhèn! Ukuran maksimal sing diolèhaké: ','The file needs a first row of column names and at least one row below it.'=>'Berkas kudu duwé larik kapisan kanthi jeneng kolom lan paling sethithik siji larik ing ngisoré.','The first row holds the column names. On the next screen you match each column to a field and see how the first rows will import, before anything is saved. A file made for the CSV importer of The Events Calendar works as it is.'=>'Larik kapisan isi jeneng kolom. Ing layar candhake sampeyan nyocogaké saben kolom karo kolom data lan ndeleng kepriye larik-larik kapisan bakal diimpor, sadurunge ana sing disimpen. Berkas sing digawé kanggo importer CSV The Events Calendar bisa digunakaké kaya sing ana.','The following blog timezones could not be successfully reset:'=>'Zona wektu blog ing ngisor iki ora bisa disetel ulang kanthi kasil:','The following booking is %s :'=>'Pemesanan ing ngisor iki %s :','The following options will re-enable this behaviour. If you notice escaped content (raw HTML) displayed on your site, you can enable these temporarily whilst you fix the underlying issue.'=>'Opsi ing ngisor iki bakal ngaktifaké maneh prilaku kasebut. Yèn sampéyan nemu isi ter-escape (HTML mentah) ing situs sampéyan, sampéyan bisa ngaktifaké iki sauntara nalika ndandani masalah dhasaré.','The format of a single %s in a list.'=>'Format saka %s tunggal ing daftar.','The format of a single %s page title.'=>'Format judul kācā %s tunggal.','The format of a single %s page.'=>'Format kācā %s siji.','The format of a single category page title.'=>'Format judul kācā kategori siji.','The format of a single tag page title.'=>'Format judul kācā tenger siji.','The format of any events in a list.'=>'Format saka acara apa waé ing daftar.','The format of each event when displayed in the full calendar.'=>'Format saben acara nalika ditampilaké ing tanggalan lengkap.','The format of the description of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Format katrangan saben item ing feed RSS acara.','The format of the events the list inserted in the category page through the %s element.'=>'Format acara ing dhaptar sing disèlèhaké ing kācā kategori lumantar unsur %s.','The format of the events the list inserted in the location page through the %s element.'=>'Format acara ing dhaptar sing disèlèhaké ing kācā lokasi lumantar unsur %s.','The format of the events the list inserted in the tag page through the <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element.'=>'Format acara ing dhaptar sing disèlèhaké ing kācā tenger lumantar unsur <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> lan <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code>.','The format of the month/year header of the calendar.'=>'Format sesirahan wulan/tahun ing tanggalan.','The format of the next upcoming event in this %s.'=>'Format acara sabanjuré ing %s iki.','The format of the text appearing in the balloon describing the location.'=>'Format teks sing katon ing balon sing njlèntrèhaké lokasi.','The format of the title of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Format judul saben item ing feed RSS acara.','The format used to display %s content on single pages or elsewhere on your site.'=>'Format sing digunakaké kanggo nampilaké isi %s ing kācā tunggal utāwā ing panggonan liya ing situs sampéyan.','The image is too big! Maximum allowed dimensions: '=>'Gambar kegedhèn! Dimensi maksimal sing diolèhaké: ','The image is too small! Minimum allowed dimensions: '=>'Gambar kekecilan! Dimensi minimal sing diolèhaké: ','The image uploaded successfully but was not set as a featured image: %s The attachment ID is in this response — pass it to update-event/update-location `featured_image` once the target is editable.'=>'Gambar kasil diunggah nanging ora disetel minangka gambar fitur: %s ID lampiran ana ing respons iki, lebokna menyang `featured_image` update-event/update-location yèn target wis bisa disunting.','The input field is an example of our phone number input field. Play with the settings below and the it will update automatically to show you a preview.'=>'Kolom input iki minangka conto kolom input nomer telpon kita. Cobanen setélan ing ngisor lan kolom iki bakal dianyaraké kanthi otomatis kanggo nuduhake pratinjau.','The language used to make this booking was %s'=>'Bāsā sing dienggo kanggo pemesanan iki yaiku %s','The largest share of an event\'s spaces, as a percentage, that all visitors\' holds together can take at once, so nobody can hold a whole event. Once it is reached, visitors can still book the remaining spaces but they are not held for them. Enter 100 for no limit.'=>'Pangsa panggonan acara paling gedhé, kanthi persentase, sing bisa dijupuk dening kabèh tahanan pengunjung bebarengan, supaya ora ana sing bisa nahan sakabèhing acara. Yèn wis tekan, pengunjung isih bisa mesen panggonan sing isih ana nanging ora ditahan kanggo dheweke. Lebokna 100 yèn ora ana watesan.','The last date the event can fall on.'=>'Tanggal pungkasan sing bisa dadi tanggal acara.','The latitude and longitude are not a pair of coordinates and were left out.'=>'Garis lintang lan garis bujur dudu pasangan koordinat lan ditinggal.','The link will be shown %s minutes before the event starts.'=>'Pranālā bakal ditampilake %s menit sadurunge acara diwiwiti.','The location "%1$s" could not be created: %2$s'=>'Lokasi "%1$s" ora bisa digawé: %2$s','The location "%s" was not on this site, so it was created with its name only. Add its address, or import a locations file first.'=>'Lokasi "%s" durung ana ing situs iki, mula digawé mung nganggo jeneng. Tambahna alamaté, utawa impor berkas lokasi dhisik.','The location address'=>'Alamat lokasi','The location information that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Informasi lokasi sing bakal katon ing tanggalan.','The location town'=>'Kutha lokasi','The main description of your RSS events feed.'=>'Katrangan utama feed RSS acara sampéyan.','The main title of your RSS events feed.'=>'Judul utama feed RSS acara sampéyan.','The maximum allowed size for images uploaded, in bytes'=>'Ukuran maksimum sing diidinake kanggo gambar sing diunggah, ing bita','The maximum height an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Dhuwure maksimum sing bisa diduweni gambar sing diunggah. Gambar sing luwih gedhe bakal ditolak. Kosongake kanggo ngidinake ukuran apa wae.','The maximum number of files a user can upload at once. Leave blank for unlimited.'=>'Jumlah maksimum berkas sing bisa diunggah panganggo bebarengan. Kosongake kanggo tanpa watesan.','The maximum size in bytes per uploaded file.'=>'Ukuran maksimum ing bita saben berkas sing diunggah.','The maximum width an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Ambane maksimum sing bisa diduweni gambar sing diunggah. Gambar sing luwih gedhe bakal ditolak. Kosongake kanggo ngidinake ukuran apa wae.','The message displayed when no %s are available.'=>'Pesen sing katon nalika ora ana %s sing sumadya.','The message displayed when no events are available.'=>'Pesen sing katon nalika ora ana acara sing sumadya.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by %s when no events are available.'=>'Pesen sing katon ing dhaptar sing digawé déning %s nalika ora ana acara sing sumadya.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> when no events are available.'=>'Pesen sing katon ing dhaptar sing digawé déning <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> lan <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> nalika ora ana acara sing sumadya.','The minimum height an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Dhuwure minimum sing bisa diduweni gambar sing diunggah. Gambar sing luwih cilik bakal ditolak. Kosongake kanggo ngidinake ukuran apa wae.','The minimum width an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Ambane minimum sing bisa diduweni gambar sing diunggah. Gambar sing luwih cilik bakal ditolak. Kosongake kanggo ngidinake ukuran apa wae.','The name is empty.'=>'Jeneng kosong.','The name of the location'=>'Jeneng lokasi','The number of times to repeat, "%s", is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Cacah baleni, "%s", dudu wilangan bulat 1 utawa luwih.','The numerical units shown to those searching by distance. Use comma-separated numbers, such as "25,50,100".'=>'Satuan angka sing katon kanggo sing nggoleki miturut jarak. Gunakna angka sing dipisah koma, kayata "25,50,100".','The option below allows you to disable user accounts, yet you will still see the supplied personal information for each booking.'=>'Opsi ing ngisor iki ngidinaké sampéyan nonaktifaké akun panganggo, nanging sampéyan isih bakal weruh informasi pribadi sing disadhiyakaké kanggo saben pemesanan.','The options below are applied to the %s placeholders.'=>'Pilihan ing ngisor iki dileksanakaké marang placeholder %s.','The page containing the %s shortcode. Create a page with that shortcode and select it here.'=>'Kācā sing ngandhut shortcode %s. Gawé kācā nganggo shortcode kuwi lan pilih ing kéné.','The port through which you e-mail notifications will be sent. Make sure the firewall doesn\'t block this port'=>'Port sing bakal digunakake kanggo ngirim kabar e-mail sampeyan. Priksa manawa firewall ora ngalangi port iki','The provider rate limit was reached, so this will be retried shortly.'=>'Watesan laju panyedhia wis kecandhak, mula iki bakal dicoba manèh sadhela manèh.','The repeat rule and the extra dates were combined into a list of %d dates.'=>'Aturan baleni lan tanggal tambahan digabung dadi daftar saka %d tanggal.','The repeat rule gives more than %d dates.'=>'Aturan baleni ngasilaké luwih saka %d tanggal.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date, so the event has no dates yet.'=>'Aturan baleni ora ngasilaké tanggal antarané tanggal wiwitan lan tanggal baleni nganti, mula acara durung duwé tanggal.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date.'=>'Aturan baleni ora ngasilaké tanggal antarané tanggal wiwitan lan tanggal baleni nganti.','The repeat-until date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Tanggal baleni nganti "%s" ora dimangerteni.','The repeat-until date is before the start date.'=>'Tanggal baleni nganti luwih dhisik tinimbang tanggal wiwitan.','The repeating event has been converted into a recurring event.'=>'Acara bola-balik wis diowahi dadi acara sing bola-balik.','The repeating events have been converted into recurring events.'=>'Acara baleni wis diowahi dadi acara bola-balik.','The right-of-withdrawal feature is currently disabled in Events Manager settings.'=>'Fitur hak mbatalake saiki dinonaktifaké ing setélan Events Manager.','The selected country code will also show the dialcode, such as +1 for the US.'=>'Kode negara sing dipilih uga bakal nuduhake kode telpon, kayata +1 kanggo AS.','The selected country will be chosen by default if auto-detect is disabled, additionally any numbers submitted whilst Phone Numbers were disabled will be considered as belonging to this country and reformatted accordingly when used for communication or display purposes.'=>'Negara sing dipilih bakal dipilih kanthi gawan yèn deteksi otomatis dinonaktifaké, saliyané iku nomer apa waé sing dikirim nalika Nomer Telpon dinonaktifaké bakal dianggep kagolong negara iki lan diformat ulang miturut kabutuhan nalika dienggo kanggo komunikasi utawa tampilan.','The setting above is new, due to our new calendar display options. Your previous format was %s'=>'Setélan ing ndhuwur iki anyar, amarga pilihan tampilan tanggalan anyar kita. Format sampéyan sadurungé yaiku %s','The settings below are used when using the %s placeholder'=>'Setélan ing ngisor iki dienggo nalika nggunakaké placeholder %s','The start date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Tanggal wiwitan "%s" ora dimangerteni.','The start date is empty.'=>'Tanggal wiwitan kosong.','The start time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Wektu wiwitan "%s" ora dimangerteni.','The statutory cooling-off period is 14 days. Late submissions are still accepted and flagged for your review rather than silently rejected.'=>'Wektu mikir ulang miturut hukum yaiku 14 dina. Kiriman sing telat isih ditampa lan ditandhani kanggo sampéyan tinjau, ora ditolak meneng-menengan.','The text shown when a booking is being submitted, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Teks sing ditampilaké nalika pemesanan lagi dikirim, %s bakal diganti total sing kudu dibayar.','The text shown when a booking is not free, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Teks sing ditampilaké nalika pemesanan ora gratis, %s bakal diganti total sing kudu dibayar.','The text used by the submit button. To use an image instead, enter the full url starting with %s or %s.'=>'Teks sing digunakaké tombol kirim. Kanggo nggunakaké gambar, lebokna url lengkap diwiwiti nganggo %s utawa %s.','The ticket %s is no longer available.'=>'Tiket %s wis ora kasedhiya.','The time zone "%s" is not recognized. Use a name such as America/New_York or an offset such as UTC+2.'=>'Zona wektu "%s" ora dikenali. Gunakna jeneng kayata America/New_York utawa offset kayata UTC+2.','The tip text that is shown for the advanced search trigger.'=>'Teks pitunjuk sing katon kanggo pemicu panggolékan tutug.','The title that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Judul sing bakal katon ing tanggalan.','The unique name (singular) used to identify %s in the database. Use lowercase alphanumeric characters, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Jeneng unik (tunggal) sing digunakaké kanggo ngenali %s ing basis data. Gunakna mung aksara alfanumerik huruf cilik, tanda hubung lan garis ngisor.','The uploaded file is no longer on the server. Upload it again.'=>'Berkas sing diunggah wis ora ana ing server. Unggahen manèh.','The uploads folder is not writable.'=>'Folder unggahan ora bisa ditulisi.','The virtual location for this event is not ready yet. Please try again shortly.'=>'Lokasi virtual kanggo acara iki durung siyap. Mangga coba manèh sadhela manèh.','The website "%s" is not a web address and was left out.'=>'Situs web "%s" dudu alamat web lan ditinggal.','The week of the month "%s" is not understood. Use first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'Minggu saka sawulan "%s" ora dimangerteni. Gunakna first, second, third, fourth utawa last.','The weekday "%s" is not understood.'=>'Dina minggu "%s" ora dimangerteni.','Theme Templates'=>'Cithakan Tema','There are not enough physical spaces left for this booking.'=>'Panggonan fisik sing isih ana ora cukup kanggo pemesanan iki.','There are not enough virtual spaces left for this booking.'=>'Panggonan virtual sing isih ana ora cukup kanggo pemesanan iki.','There is a newer version of Events Manager Pro which is recommended for this current version of Events Manager as new features have been added. Please go to the plugin website and download the latest update.'=>'Ana versi Events Manager Pro sing luwih anyar sing dianjuraké kanggo versi Events Manager saiki amarga fitur-fitur anyar wis ditambahaké. Mangga bukak situs plugin lan undhuh nganyaran paling anyar.','There was a problem adding custom fields to your recurring events.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nambah kolom kustom menyang acara bola-balik sampéyan.','There was a problem adding tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nambah tiket menyang pengulangan sampéyan.','There was a problem creating a user account, please contact a website administrator.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nggawé akun panganggo, mangga hubungi administrator situs.','There was a problem deleting bookings for the event.'=>'Ana masalah nalika mbusak pemesanan kanggo acara kuwi.','There was a problem deleting the timerange.'=>'Ana masalah nalika mbusak rentang wektu.','There was a problem saving the booking.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen pemesanan.','There was a problem saving the event timeslots to the database. Please contact an administrator if the issue persists.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen slot wektu acara menyang database. Mangga hubungi administrator yèn masalah terus.','There was a problem saving the recurring events.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen acara bola-balik.','There was a problem saving the ticket booking.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen pemesanan tiket.','There was a problem saving the ticket.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen tiket.','There was a problem saving the timerange.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nyimpen rentang wektu.','There was a problem updating tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Ana masalah nalika nganyari tiket ing pengulangan sampéyan.','There was an error connecting to %s: %s'=>'Ana kesalahan nalika nyambung menyang %s: %s','There was an error upgrading your site, please try again or contact support.'=>'Ana kesalahan nalika upgrade situs sampéyan, coba manèh utawa hubungi dhukungan.','There was an error uploading the image.'=>'Ana kaluputan nalika ngunggah gambar.','There was an error whilst migrating your times to our new timezone-aware formats. Below is a list of errors:'=>'Ana kaluputan nalika migrasi wektu sampéyan menyang format anyar sing ngerti zona wektu. Ing ngisor iki daftar kaluputané:','There were some errors saving your location.'=>'Ana sawetara kesalahan nalika nyimpen lokasi sampéyan.','There were some issues whilst disconnecting from your %s account(s) :'=>'Ana sawetara masalah nalika medhot saka akun %s sampéyan :','These can be overridden when using shortcode or template tags.'=>'Iki bisa ditimpa nalika nggunakaké shortcode utawa tag cithakan.','These countries will be excluded from the country selection list.'=>'Negara-negara iki bakal dikejābā saka dhaptar pilihan negara.','These formats can be used on %s pages or on other areas of your site displaying an %s.'=>'Format iki bisa digunakaké ing kācā %s utāwā ing area liya ing situs sampéyan sing nampilaké %s.','These formats can be used when WordPress automatically displays %s excerpts on your site and %s is enabled in your %s settings tab.'=>'Format iki bisa digunakaké nalika WordPress nampilaké kutipan %s ing situs sampéyan kanthi otomatis lan %s diaktifaké ing tab setélan %s sampéyan.','These formats will be used on your events page. This will also be used if you do not provide specified formats in other event lists, like in shortcodes.'=>'Format iki bakal digunakaké ing kācā acara sampéyan. Iki uga bakal digunakaké yèn sampéyan ora nyadhiyakaké format tartamtu ing daftar acara liyané, kaya ing shortcode.','These headings appear above sections of the booking form. Leave blank for no heading.'=>'Irah-irahan iki katon ing ndhuwur bagéan formulir pemesanan. Kosongké yèn ora péngin irah-irahan.','These options are the defaults applied to lists being showing in Grouped List view mode and can be overriden in individual lists using shortcodes, blocks, widgets etc.'=>'Pilihan iki minangka gawan sing ditrapaké ing daftar sing katon ing mode tontonan Daftar Klompok lan bisa ditimpa ing saben daftar nganggo shortcode, blok, widget, lsp.','These options have security implications and are intended for transition! For more information, please see our %s.'=>'Opsi-opsi iki nduwé implikasi keamanan lan mung kanggo masa transisi! Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, mangga deleng %s kita.','These pages allow you to provide an event management interface outside the admin area on whatever page you want on your website. Bear in mind that this is overridden by BuddyPress if activated.'=>'Kācā-kācā iki ngidinaké sampéyan nyediakaké antarmuka pangelolaan acara ing njaba area admin ing kācā apa waé ing situs sampéyan. Elinga yèn iki ditimpa BuddyPress yèn diaktifaké.','These spaces cannot be held for you right now, but you can still book them while they are available.'=>'Panggonan iki ora bisa ditahan kanggo sampeyan saiki, nanging sampeyan isih bisa mesen nalika isih sumadya.','This %s has timeslots, you are viewing'=>'%s iki duwe slot wektu, sampeyan lagi ndeleng','This %s was submitted by a guest. You will find their details in the <em>Anonymous Submitter Info</em> box'=>'%s iki dikirim déning tamu. Rincianné ana ing kothak <em>Info Pengirim Anonim</em>','This CPT name is already used by an existing WordPress post type. Please choose another name.'=>'Jeneng CPT iki wis digunakaké dening tipe kiriman WordPress sing ana. Mangga pilih jeneng liyané.','This Month'=>'Sasi iki','This Year'=>'Taun iki','This accepts %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Iki nampa placeholder %s lan %s.','This accepts %s placeholders.'=>'Iki nampa placeholder %s.','This accepts %s, %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Iki nampa placeholder %s, %s lan %s.','This action aill be applied to every attendee belonging to the selected %s. Do you want to continue?'=>'Aksi iki bakal ditrapaké ing saben peserta sing kagolong ing %s sing dipilih. Arep nerusaké?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the %s belongs to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Aksi iki bakal ditrapaké ing kabèh pemesanan sing kagolong ing %s. Arep nerusaké?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the selected %s belong to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Aksi iki bakal ditrapaké ing kabèh pemesanan sing kagolong ing %s sing dipilih. Arep nerusaké?','This booking form has expired, please reload the page and try again.'=>'Formulir pemesanan iki wis kadaluwarsa, muatên manèh kācā lan coba manèh.','This booking has already been submitted, please check your email for its confirmation.'=>'Pemesanan iki wis dikirim, mangga mriksa email sampéyan kanggo konfirmasiné.','This booking has already been submitted.'=>'Pemesanan iki wis dikirim.','This button text would be shown for a free booking'=>'Teks tombol iki bakal ditampilaké kanggo pemesanan gratis','This cannot be undone.'=>'Iki ora bisa dibatalake.','This confirms receipt of your declaration only. We will review it and contact you regarding any refund due.'=>'Iki mung konfirmasi yèn pratelan sampéyan wis ditampa. Kita bakal mriksa lan ngubungi sampéyan babagan pengembalian dana apa waé sing dadi hak sampéyan.','This content will appear just above your code for the %s list format below. Default is blank'=>'Isi iki bakal katon pas ing ndhuwur kode sampéyan kanggo format daftar %s ing ngisor. Gawané kothong','This content will appear just above your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Isi iki bakal katon pas ing ndhuwur kode sampéyan kanggo format daftar acara gawan. Gawané kothong','This content will appear just below your code for the %s list format above. Default is blank'=>'Isi iki bakal katon pas ing ngisor kode sampéyan kanggo format daftar %s ing ndhuwur. Gawané kothong','This content will appear just below your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Isi iki bakal katon pas ing ngisor kode sampéyan kanggo format daftar acara gawan. Gawané kothong','This disables user registrations for bookings.'=>'Iki nonaktifake pendaftaran panganggo kanggo pemesanan.','This email already exists in our system, please log in to register to proceed with your booking.'=>'Email iki wis ana ing sistem kita, mangga mlebu log kanggo nerusaké pemesanan sampéyan.','This event has been cancelled.'=>'Acara iki wis dibatalake.','This event has ended and can no longer be joined.'=>'Acara iki wis rampung lan ora bisa dilu manèh.','This event has no virtual location to join.'=>'Acara iki ora duwé lokasi virtual kanggo dilu.','This event has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'Acara iki duwé kesalahan validasi lan ora bisa dipacak nganti dibenakaké:','This event is fully booked.'=>'Acara iki wis kebak pesenan.','This event is not available or has been cancelled'=>'Acara iki ora kasedhiya utawa wis dibatalake','This event is not available or has been cancelled.'=>'Acara iki ora sumadya utawa wis dibatalake.','This event is not open for joining yet.'=>'Acara iki durung dibukak kanggo diluwi.','This event spans every day between the beginning and end date, with start/end times applying to each day.'=>'Acara iki nyakup saben dina antarané tanggal wiwitan lan pungkasan, kanthi wektu wiwitan/pungkasan ditrapaké ing saben dina.','This file holds'=>'Berkas iki isiné','This is a %s event.'=>'Iki acara %s.','This is a %s recurrence of %s.'=>'Iki minangka pengulangan %s saka %s.','This is a recurring %s. You can find all %s on this page, or click on individual %s to view recurrence-specific bookings.'=>'Iki minangka %s bola-balik. Sampeyan bisa nemokake kabeh %s ing kaca iki, utawa klik %s individu kanggo ndeleng pemesanan khusus pengulangan.','This is a translated event, therefore your time, location and booking information is handled by your original event translation.'=>'Iki acara terjemahan, mula informasi wektu, lokasi lan pemesanan sampéyan diurus déning terjemahan acara asli sampéyan.','This is a translated location, so address information is handled by your original location translation. You can provide translations for certain fields which will override the original translation.'=>'Iki lokasi terjemahan, mula informasi alamat diurus déning terjemahan lokasi asli sampéyan. Sampéyan bisa maringi terjemahan kanggo kolom tartamtu sing bakal ngganti terjemahan asli.','This is also the default setting for responsive calendars without a fixed size.'=>'Iki uga minangka setélan gawan kanggo tanggalan responsif tanpa ukuran tetep.','This is for advanced users, you should know what you\'re doing here or things will not work properly. For more information on how these options work see our <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization recommendations</a>'=>'Iki kanggo panganggo tingkat lanjut, sampéyan kudu ngerti apa sing ditindakaké ing kéné utawa samubarang ora bakal mlaku kanthi bener. Kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap bab cara kerjané pilihan-pilihan iki pirsani <a href="%s" target="_blank">rekomendasi optimasi</a> kita','This is not a required step to enable any extra functionality, and therefore is not urgent. Only until you are happy with the upgrade and are confident you don\'t need to downgrade, finalize your upgrade by deleting and discontinuing these fields.'=>'Iki dudu langkah sing kudu dilakoni kanggo ngaktifaké fungsi tambahan, mula ora urgen. Nalika sampéyan wis marem karo upgrade lan yakin ora perlu downgrade, rampungaké upgrade sampéyan kanthi mbusak lan mungkasi kolom-kolom iki.','This is only applicable when %s is not active.'=>'Iki namung kanggo nalika %s ora aktif.','This is only used when showing events from other blogs.'=>'Iki namung digunakaké nalika nampilaké acara saka blog liya.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is confirmed. This will be sent automatically if approvals are required and the booking is approved. If approvals are disabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Iki dikirim nalika pemesanan sawijining wong wis dikonfirmasi. Iki bakal dikirim kanthi otomatis yèn butuh persetujuan lan pemesanan disetujoni. Yèn persetujuan dinonaktifaké, iki dikirim nalika panganggo pisanan ngirim pemesanané.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is pending. If approvals are enabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Iki dikirim nalika pemesanan sawijining wong lagi ngenteni. Yèn persetujuan diaktifaké, iki dikirim nalika panganggo pisanan ngirim pemesanané.','This is specific to bookings made by the user, not bookings that may have been made to events they own.'=>'Iki mung kanggo pemesanan sing digawé panganggo, dudu pemesanan sing bisa digawé kanggo acara sing diduwèni.','This is the definite date after which bookings will be closed for this event, regardless of individual ticket settings above. Default value will be the event start date.'=>'Iki tanggal pungkasan sawisé kuwi pemesanan ditutup kanggo acara iki, ora preduli setélan tiket individu ing ndhuwur. Nilai gawan yaiku tanggal wiwitan acara.','This is your primary recurrence, other recurring %s will use these advanced settings as their default settings if left blank.'=>'Iki pengulangan utama sampéyan, %s bola-balik liyané bakal nggunakake setélan lanjutan iki minangka setélan gawan yèn dikosongaké.','This join link is not valid. Please use the link from your booking confirmation.'=>'Pranālā melu iki ora sah. Mangga nggunakaké pranālā saka konfirmasi pemesanan sampeyan.','This link is invalid or has expired. Please request a new one.'=>'Pranālā iki ora sah utawa wis kadaluwarsa. Mangga njaluk sing anyar.','This month'=>'Wulan iki','This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Jaringan iki nuduhake siji set tabel acara lan pemesanan, dadi nyopot pasang saka situs iki bakal mbusak acara lan pemesanan saka saben situs ing jaringan kanthi permanen. Copot pasang saka %s.','This only setting only matters if you selected \'Yes\' to above. You will notice the events page titles aren\'t being rewritten, and you have a new title underneath the default page name. This is where you control the HTML of this title. Make sure you keep the #_PAGETITLE placeholder here, as that\'s what is rewritten by events manager. To control what\'s rewritten in this title, see settings further down for page titles.'=>'Setélan iki mung penting yèn sampéyan milih \'Ya\' ing dhuwur. Sampéyan bakal weruh judul kācā acara ora ditulis ulang, lan ana judul anyar ing ngisoré jeneng kācā gawan. Ing kéné sampéyan ngontrol HTML judul iki. Pastèkaké sampéyan tetep nyimpen placeholder #_PAGETITLE ing kéné, amarga iku sing ditulis ulang déning events manager. Kanggo ngontrol apa sing ditulis ulang ing judul iki, pirsani setélan ing ngisor kanggo judul kācā.','This option allows you to select the default category when adding an event.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidini sampéyan milih kategori gawan nalika nambah acara.','This option allows you to select the default location when adding an event.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidini sampéyan milih lokasi gawan nalika nambah acara.','This option allows you to select which page to use as an events page. If you do not select an events page, to display event lists you can enable event archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidini sampéyan milih kācā endi sing dienggo minangka kācā acara. Yèn sampéyan ora milih kācā acara, kanggo nuduhake dhaptar acara sampéyan bisa ngaktifaké arsip acara utawa nggunakaké shortcode lan/utawa tag cithakan sing cocog.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidinaké sampéyan milih kācā endi sing dienggo minangka kācā %s.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page. If you do not select a %s page, to display lists you can enable archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidinaké sampéyan milih kācā endi sing dienggo minangka kācā %s. Yèn sampéyan ora milih kācā %s, kanggo nampilaké dhaptar sampéyan bisa ngaktifaké arsip utawa nganggo shortcode lan/utawa template tag sing cocog.','This options allows to display the full-sized calendar on the events page, instead of the default list.'=>'Pilihan iki ngidini nuduhake tanggalan ukuran kebak ing kācā acara, ora dhaptar gawan.','This page corresponds to the <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s page. Its content will be overridden by Events Manager, although if you include the word CONTENTS (exactly in capitals) and surround it with other text, only CONTENTS will be overwritten. If you want to change the way your events look, go to the <a href=\'%s\'>settings</a> page. '=>'Kaca iki cocog karo kaca <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s. Isine bakal ditimpa dening Events Manager, nanging yen sampeyan nyertakake tembung CONTENTS (persis nganggo huruf kapital) lan ngubengi nganggo teks liyane, mung CONTENTS sing bakal ditimpa. Yen sampeyan pengin ngowahi tampilan acara sampeyan, bukaa kaca <a href=\'%s\'>setelan</a>. ','This page is where people that have made bookings for an event can go and view their previous bookings.'=>'Kācā iki panggonan wong sing wis nggawé pemesanan kanggo sawijining acara bisa ndelok pemesanan sakdurungé.','This section allows you to configure parts of this plugin that will improve performance on your site and increase page speeds by reducing extra files from being unnecessarily included on pages as well as reducing server loads where possible. This only applies to pages outside the admin area.'=>'Bagéan iki ngidini sampéyan ngatur bagéan plugin iki sing bakal nambah kadigdayan situs sampéyan lan nambah kacepetan kācā kanthi nyuda berkas tambahan sing ora perlu dilebokaké ing kācā uga nyuda beban server yèn bisa. Iki mung ditrapaké ing kācā njaba area admin.','This setting was not changed.'=>'Setelan iki ora diganti.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a fixed-size %s calendar.'=>'Setélan iki bakal ditrapaké yèn sampéyan milih nampilaké tanggalan %s kanthi ukuran tetep.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a size %s calendar.'=>'Setélan iki bakal ditrapaké yèn sampéyan milih nampilaké tanggalan ukuran %s.','This setting will not apply to bookings using payment gateways, see individual gateways for approval settings.'=>'Setélan iki ora ditrapaké kanggo pemesanan sing nganggo gateway pembayaran, deleng gateway masing-masing kanggo setélan persetujuan.','This site is activated under a license that has expired. Deactivate it from your licenses page, then activate it again here and choose your %s license.'=>'Situs iki diaktifaké nganggo lisensi sing wis kadaluwarsa. Nonaktifna saka kācā lisensi sampeyan, banjur aktifna manèh ing kéné lan pilih lisensi %s sampeyan.','This text will be shown only if the default (free) button is not an image.'=>'Teks iki mung bakal ditampilaké yèn tombol gawan (gratis) dudu gambar.','This ticket is the child of a recurring event ticket. Values can be overriden for this recurrence. Blank text values will default to the parent ticket value, checkboxes like this %s will inherit parent ticket values.'=>'Tiket iki minangka anak saka tiket acara bola-balik. Nilai bisa diganti kanggo pengulangan iki. Nilai teks kothong bakal nggunakake nilai tiket babon, dene kotak centhang kaya iki %s bakal nuruni nilai tiket babon.','This uses a slightly different format to the others on here, for a list of characters to use, visit the <a href="%s">reference page</a>'=>'Iki nganggo format sing rada beda saka liyané ing kéné, kanggo daftar karakter sing bisa digunakaké, tilikana <a href="%s">kācā rujukan</a>','This week'=>'Minggu iki','This will be sent automatically when a booking is rejected. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Iki bakal dikirim kanthi otomatis nalika pemesanan ditolak. Ora ana gunané yèn pemesanan ora butuh persetujuan.','This will be sent to event admins when a booking is rejected.'=>'Iki bakal dikirim menyang admin acara nalika pemesanan ditolak.','This will be sent to the person when they first submit their booking. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Iki bakal dikirim menyang wong kasebut nalika pisanan ngirim pemesanané. Ora ana gunané yèn pemesanan ora butuh persetujuan.','This will be sent when a user cancels their booking.'=>'Iki bakal dikirim nalika panganggo mbatalaké pemesanané.','This will be used in admin menus and other areas identifying the type of %s you are working with.'=>'Iki bakal digunakaké ing menu admin lan area liyané sing nandhani tipe %s sing lagi sampéyan garap.','This will control how many %s are shown on one list by default.'=>'Iki ngatur pira %s sing katampilaké ing sak dhaptar kanthi gawan.','This will control how many events are shown on one list by default.'=>'Iki ngatur pira acara sing katampilaké ing sak dhaptar kanthi gawan.','This will delete all event recurrence posts/pages, and unify them into one URL. Any 404 pages resulting from these will automatically 302-redirect to the recurring event (which will be a new URL).'=>'Iki bakal mbusak kabeh pos/kaca pengulangan acara, lan nyawijekake dadi siji URL. Kaca 404 apa wae sing muncul saka iki bakal otomatis dialihake kanthi 302 menyang acara bola-balik (sing bakal dadi URL anyar).','Thousands Separator'=>'Pamisah Èwu','Thumbnails'=>'Miniatur','Ticket'=>'Tiket','Ticket %s has a higher minimum spaces requirement than the maximum spaces allowed.'=>'Tiket %s duwé syarat minimum panggonan sing luwih dhuwur tinimbang maksimum panggonan sing diidinaké.','Ticket Capacity'=>'Kapasitas Tiket','Ticket Description'=>'Katrangan Tiket','Ticket ID'=>'ID Tiket','Ticket ID.'=>'ID tiket.','Ticket Name'=>'Jeneng Tiket','Ticket Name (Ascending)'=>'Jeneng Tiket (Munggah)','Ticket Name (Descending)'=>'Jeneng Tiket (Mudhun)','Ticket Options'=>'Opsi Tiket','Ticket Price'=>'Rega Tiket','Ticket Price (Ascending)'=>'Rega Tiket (Munggah)','Ticket Price (Descending)'=>'Rega Tiket (Mudhun)','Ticket Spaces'=>'Panggonan Tiket','Ticket Total'=>'Total Tiket','Ticket Type'=>'Tipe Tiket','Ticket UUID'=>'UUID Tiket','Ticket booking created'=>'Pemesanan tiket digawé','Ticket could not be deleted.'=>'Tiket ora bisa dibusak.','Ticket could not be saved.'=>'Tiket ora bisa disimpen.','Ticket created'=>'Tiket digawé','Ticket for %s'=>'Tiket kanggo %s','Ticket not found.'=>'Tiket ora ditemokaké.','Tickets'=>'Tiket','Tickets / Booking'=>'Tiket / Pemesanan','Tickets and RSVPs'=>'Tiket lan RSVP','Tickets with bookings cannot be deleted.'=>'Tiket sing wis ana pemesanané ora bisa dibusak.','Tickets within recurrences that already have bookings WILL NOT be deleted, the ticket will be deactivated instead to prevent further bookings.'=>'Tiket ing pengulangan sing wis ana pemesanané ORA bakal dibusak, nanging tiket bakal dinonaktifaké supaya ora ana pemesanan manèh.','Tickets within recurrences without any bookings will be deleted.'=>'Tiket ing pengulangan sing ora ana pemesanané bakal dibusak.','Time Format'=>'Format Wektu','Time Separator'=>'Pamisah Wektu','Time zone'=>'Zona wektu','Timerange'=>'Rentang wektu','Timeranges cannot overlap with each other.'=>'Rentang wektu ora olèh tumpang tindih.','Times'=>'Wektu','Timeslot date format'=>'Format tanggal slot wektu','Timeslot time format'=>'Format wektu slot wektu','Timeslots'=>'Slot Wektu','Timeslots require %s and has been disabled automatically to prevent undesired results.'=>'Slot wektu mbutuhaké %s lan wis dinonaktifaké kanthi otomatis kanggo nyegah asil sing ora dikarepaké.','Timezone'=>'Zona wektu','Title'=>'Judul','To help with the transition, we\'re providing you with a Preview mode you can activate below, which will temporarily use our new formatting options only for you to see (other site visitors will see your site as usual). If you\'re happy with the changes, you can switch over completely, or revert individual formats within these settings pages.'=>'Kanggo mbantu transisi, kita nyedhiyakaké Mode pratinjau sing bisa sampéyan aktifake ing ngisor, sing bakal nggunakake opsi format anyar kita sauntara mung kanggo sampéyan (pengunjung situs liyané bakal weruh situs sampéyan kaya biasa). Yèn sampéyan marem karo owah-owahané, sampéyan bisa pindhah kabèh, utawa mbalèkaké format individu ing kācā setélan iki.','To manage the whole set, <a href="%s">edit the repeating event template</a>.'=>'Kanggo ngatur kabèh set, <a href="%s">sunting cithakan acara bola-balik</a>.','To update your network blogs with the latest Events Manager automatically, click the update button below.'=>'Kanggo nganyari blog jaringan sampeyan nganggo Events Manager paling anyar kanthi otomatis, klik tombol nganyari ing ngisor iki.','To view your bookings, please visit %s after logging in.'=>'Kanggo ndeleng pemesanan sampéyan, mangga bukak %s sawisé mlebu log.','Today'=>'Dina iki','Today\'s events'=>'Acara dinā iki','Tomorrow\'s events'=>'Acara sesuk','Tooltip'=>'Pitutur','Total'=>'Total','Total Bookings'=>'Total Pemesanan','Total Price'=>'Total Rega','Total Sales'=>'Total Dodolan','Total Spaces'=>'Total Panggonan','Total Tickets'=>'Total Tiket','Town'=>'Kuthā','Translated Event Information'=>'Informasi Acara sing Diterjemahaké','Translated Location Information'=>'Informasi Lokasi sing Diterjemahaké','Try again'=>'Coba manèh','Trying to perform an illegal action.'=>'Nyoba nindakaké aksi sing ora sah.','URL'=>'URL','URLs'=>'URL','Uh Oh! For some reason WordPress could not create an events page for you (or you just deleted it). Not to worry though, all you have to do is create an empty page, name it whatever you want, and select it as your events page in your <a href="%s">settings page</a>. Sorry for the extra step! If you know what you are doing, you may have done this on purpose, if so <a href="%s">ignore this message</a>'=>'Wah! WordPress ora bisa nggawe kaca acara kanggo sampeyan (utawa sampeyan lagi wae mbusak). Ora usah kuwatir, sampeyan mung perlu nggawe kaca kothong, dijenengi sakarepmu, lan pilih minangka kaca acara sampeyan ing <a href="%s">kaca setelan</a>. Nyuwun pangapunten kanggo langkah tambahan iki! Yen sampeyan ngerti apa sing sampeyan lakoni, mbok menawa sampeyan sengaja nglakoni iki, yen mangkono <a href="%s">lirwakake pesen iki</a>','Unapprove'=>'Ora disetujoni','Unauthorized Access'=>'Akses Ora Sah','Unavailable Dates'=>'Tanggal Ora Kasedhiya','Unconfirm'=>'Batalake Konfirmasi','Unconfirmed'=>'Durung Dikonfirmasi','Undo'=>'Baléni','Undo Changes'=>'Baléni Owah-owahan','Undo Migration'=>'Baléni Pindhahan','Uninstall'=>'Copot Pasang','Uninstall Events Manager'=>'Copot Pasang Events Manager','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'Copot Pasang lan Deaktifasi','Uninstall/Reset'=>'Copot Instalasi/Setél Ulang','Unknown migration source.'=>'Sumber pamindhahan ora dingerteni.','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'Yèn ora ditimpa nganggo parameter %s ing shortcode utāwā argumen PHP, tanggalan kanthi gawan bakal misahaké acara miturut slot wektu yèn ing dinā sing padha utāwā nampilaké siji acara kanggo dinā kasebut sing nyakup kabèh rentang slot wektu.','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'Yèn ora ditetepaké nganggo parameter %s, tanggalan kanthi gawan bakal tetep ing ukuran sing dipilih ora preduli jembaré tanggalan. Ukuran tanggalan responsif bakal nyesuaké saka cilik nganti gedhé miturut jembaré tanggalan ing layar.','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'Format berkas ora dikenali, MIME type berkas ora cocog karo ekstensi berkas.','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'Format gambar ora dikenali, data header EXIF gambar rusak utawa ora ana.','Up to %d%% off'=>'Nganti diskon %d%%','Upcoming'=>'Bakal Teka','Upcoming %s'=>'%s sing Bakal Teka','Upcoming Events'=>'Acara sing Bakal Teka','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'Wates slot wektu sing bakal teka','Update %s'=>'Anyaraké %s','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'Nganyaran 7.3.7 uga kalebu pangapikan kanggo editor blok (Gutenberg). Deleng %s kanggo rincian.','Update Blogs'=>'Anyaraké Blog','Update Event Category'=>'Anyaraké Kategori Acara','Update Event Tag'=>'Anyaraké Tenger Acara','Update Network'=>'Anyaraké Jaringan','Update booking'=>'Anyaraké pemesanan','Update event'=>'Anyaraké acara','Update location'=>'Anyaraké lokasi','Update preview'=>'Anyari pratinjau','Update process has finished.'=>'Proses nganyari wis rampung.','Update ticket'=>'Anyaraké tiket','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'Anyaraké katrangan alamat sampéyan ing ndhuwur kanggo ngasilaké lokasi peta sing tepat.','Updated'=>'Dianyari','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Nganyari %s Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'Nganyari pemesanan Events Manager. Gateway pembayaran ora bisa diganti sawisé pemesanan digawé: ngirim gateway sing béda bakal ditolak, lan ngirim manèh sing saiki bakal digatèkaké.','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'Nganyari acara Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'Nganyari lokasi Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'Nganyari tiket Events Manager.','Updates and support until %s'=>'Pembaruan lan dhukungan nganti %s','Upgrade to %s'=>'Upgrade menyang %s','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'Upgrade menyang %s kanggo pilihan luwih akèh!','Upload Limits'=>'Watesan Unggahan','Upload a file'=>'Unggah berkas','Upload a file first.'=>'Unggah berkas dhisik.','Upload and match columns'=>'Unggah lan cocogna kolom','Upload media'=>'Unggah media','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Unggah zip ing Plugin > Tambah Plugin Anyar, banjur aktifna lisensi sampeyan saka setélané.','Upload/change picture'=>'Ngunggah/ganti gambar','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'Jenis berkas sing diunggah ora diolèhaké. Jenis berkas sing diolèhaké: %s','Uploads'=>'Unggah','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'Ngunggah gambar (utawa media liyané) menyang pustaka media WordPress lan ngasilaké ID lampirané. Nampa `source_url` kanggo njupuk gambar umum, bita base64 liwat `content_base64` + `filename`, utawa `id` sing wis ana kanggo nggolèki lampiran sing wis ana. Yèn URL umum ngalangi pengambilan saka sisih server (contoné Unsplash) nganggo `content_base64`. Kanggo njadikaké unggahan minangka gambar fitur acara/lokasi ing sak panggilan, lebokna `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; yèn ora, lebokna ID sing dibalèkaké minangka `featured_image` menyang update-event / update-location, utawa minangka `image` menyang update-category / update-tag. (Cathetan: `post_id` namung nglebokaké lampiran ing sawijining pos ing pustaka, dudu nyetel gambar fitur.)','Use 24h Format?'=>'Gunakna Format 24 Jam?','Use Defaults'=>'Gunakna Gawan','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'Gunakake otentikasi SMTP?','Use Visual Editor?'=>'Nggunakaké Piranti dandani Visual?','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'Gunakna singkatan, contoné Jemuah = Jum. Migunani kanggo bāsā tartamtu sing singkatané beda saka jeneng lengkap.','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'Nggunakaké dropdown kanggo lokasi?','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'Gunakna format internasional diwiwiti nganggo `+` lan kode negara, contoné `+447400123456`.','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'Gunakna pembangun UI ing ngisor iki kanggo nggawé lan ngatur tipe acara tambahan (archetype).','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'Gunakna tombol ing ngisor iki kanggo nyopot Events Manager kanthi lengkap saka sistem sampéyan utawa nyetel ulang Events Manager menyang setélan asli lan njaga data acara sampéyan.','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'Digunakaké yèn kutipan wis ditetepaké.','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'Digunakaké yèn kutipan durung ditetepaké.','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'Digunakaké kanggo ngatur format saben acara ing daftar nalika mratinjau siji tanggal ing popup modal.','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'Digunakaké kanggo nampilaké siji acara nalika mode pratinjau disetel menyang %s.','User Capabilities'=>'Kapabilitas Panganggo','User Fields'=>'Kolom Panganggo','User can book'=>'Panganggo bisa mesen','User can create and edit %s'=>'Panganggo bisa nggawe lan ngedit %s','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'Panganggo bisa mbusak kategori lan tenger %s.','User can delete other users %s'=>'Panganggo bisa mbusak %s panganggo liya','User can delete their own %s'=>'Panganggo bisa mbusak %s darbeke dhewe','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'Panganggo bisa ngedit kategori lan tenger %s.','User can edit other users %s'=>'Panganggo bisa ngedit %s panganggo liya','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'Panganggo bisa ngatur pemesanan individu lan setelan pemesanan acara panganggo liya.','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'Panganggo bisa ngunggah gambar bareng acara lan lokasine.','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'Panganggo bisa nggunakake lan ngatur pemesanan karo acarane.','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'Panganggo bisa nggunakake lokasi panganggo liya kanggo acarane.','User can view private %s'=>'Panganggo bisa ndeleng %s pribadi','User must log in'=>'Panganggo kudu mlebu log','Username'=>'Jeneng panganggo','Username: %s'=>'Jeneng panganggo: %s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'Panganggo bisa ngelola pemesanan kanggo acarané ing kācā iki.','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'Panganggo saiki bisa nggunakaké tukang ndandani WordPress kanggo ngetik HTML kanthi gampang ing formulir pangiriman.','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'Panganggo bisa macak %s lan nglewati persetujuan admin apa wae','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'Panganggo bisa ndelok pemesanan kanggo acara liyané ing kācā iki.','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'Panganggo bisa ndelok, nambah lan nyunting %s ing kācā iki.','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'Panganggo bakal bisa nggawé tipe kiriman acara racikan tambahan ing subsitus dhéwé.','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'Panganggo sing nduwé akun (sing bakal digawé nganggo cara liya nalika mode iki diaktifaké) isih bakal bisa mlebu log lan mesen sing disambungaké menyang akuné kaya biasa.','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'Panganggo sing nduwèni idin sing cocog bisa ngelola acara lan pemesanan acara kasebut dhéwé ing kācā-kācā ing ngisor iki.','Value'=>'Bijiné','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Kapasitas papan, dienggo bareng kabèh tiket sing kalebu akses fisik. Kosongna yen ora ana watesan.','Venues'=>'Papan','View'=>'Delengen','View %s'=>'Deleng %s','View As'=>'Deleng Minangka','View Bookings'=>'Deleng Pemesanan','View Event'=>'Nonton Acara','View Event Bookings'=>'Deleng Pemesanan Acara','View Location'=>'Nonton Lokasi','View Range'=>'Rentang Tampilan','View Timeslot'=>'Deleng Slot Wektu','View Types'=>'Tipe View','View all posts in %s'=>'Mirsani kabèh kiriman ing %s','View event details'=>'Deleng detil acara','View license'=>'Deleng lisensi','View/Edit Event'=>'Deleng/Edit Acara','Viewing a general WordPress taxonomy page such as %s will show a list of events just like it would regular posts for a regular category or tag. Below you can edit things such as the order events are displayed, or completely override the archive look with our formats feature.'=>'Nyawang kācā taksonomi WordPress umum kaya %s bakal nampilaké dhaptar acara kaya kanggo tulisan biasa ing kategori utawa tenger. Ing ngisor sampéyan bisa nyunting kaya urutan tampilan acara, utawa nimpa sakabèhé tampilan arsip nganggo fitur format kita.','Views'=>'View','Virtual'=>'Virtual','Virtual Events'=>'Acara Virtual','Virtual Locations'=>'Lokasi Virtual','Virtual Platform'=>'Platform Virtual','Virtual Spaces'=>'Panggonan Virtual','Virtual Venue'=>'Papan Virtual','Virtual and Hybrid Events'=>'Acara Virtual lan Hibrida','Virtual capacity, shared by all tickets that include virtual access. Leave blank for no limit, or the limit of your virtual platform if it has one.'=>'Kapasitas virtual, dienggo bareng kabèh tiket sing kalebu akses virtual. Kosongna yen ora ana watesan, utawa watesan platform virtual sampeyan yen duwé.','Virtual events only'=>'Acara virtual wae','WARNING : Restrict your API key to prevent unauthorized use and quota theft. See our %s page for more information.'=>'PÈNGET : Batesana kunci API sampéyan kanggo nyegah panggunaan tanpa idin lan nyolong kuota. Pirsani kācā %s kita kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap.','WARNING! This cannot be undone and will overwrite all event timezones, you may want to back up your database first!'=>'PÈNGET! Iki ora bisa dibatalaké lan bakal nimpa kabèh zona wektu acara, sampéyan mbok menawa kudu nyerep basis data dhisik!','WARNING! You will delete ALL recurrences of this event, including booking history associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.'=>'PÈNGET! Sampéyan bakal mbusak KABÈH pengulangan acara iki, kalebu riwayat pemesanan sing gegandhèngan karo acara apa waé ing pengulangan iki. Kanggo njaga informasi pemesanan, bukak acara tunggal sing cocog lan simpen kanggo nyopot saka seri pengulangan iki.','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'PENGET: Tumindak iki ora bisa dibatalake.','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'PÈNGET: Iki yaiku %s.','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'PÈNGET: Iki acara kagolong ing grup "%s". Admin grup liyané uga bisa ngowahi acara iki.','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'PÈNGET: Iki yaiku pengulangan ing sakumpulan acara bola-balik.','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'Kompatibilitas WPML','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'Ngenténi sinkronisasi karo panyedhia.','Waitlist'=>'Dhaptar Tunggu','Waitlist Approved'=>'Dhaptar Tunggu Disetujoni','Waitlist Expired'=>'Dhaptar Tunggu Kadaluwarsa','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'Pengin nganggo editor blok? Saiki sampéyan bisa ngaktifaké iki ing kācā %s.','Warning!'=>'Pènget!','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Pènget: Ngganti jeneng CPT bisa nduwé akibat sing luwih amba lan bisa mengaruhi plugin liyané sing kerja khusus karo jeneng custom post type iki. Apa sampéyan yakin arep nerusaké?','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'Pènget: Ngowahi nilai-nilai iki bisa njalari informasi sing sadurunge didelikake dadi katon kanggo kabeh panganggo.','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'Kita bakal nggunakake %s kanggo panggolèkan.','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'Kita ngumpulake lan nyimpen informasi sing sampeyan kirim marang kita babagan acara (lan lokasi sing cocog) sing pengin sampeyan publikasi ing situs kita.','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'Kita ngumpulake lan nyimpen informasi sing sampeyan kirim marang kita nalika nggawe pemesanan, kanggo tujuan nyisihake panggonan sing sampeyan jaluk ing acara kita lan njaga cathetan kehadiran.','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'Kita ora bisa nemokaké pemesanan sing cocog karo referensi lan alamat email kuwi. Mangga priksa loro-lorone lan coba manèh.','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'Kita ora bisa nemokaké pemesanan aktif kanggo alamat email sampéyan.','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'Kita ora bisa verifikasi pemesanan kuwi. Mangga miwiti manèh.','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'Kita nrapaké sawetara aturan gagrag tema sing mbantu nyeragamaké tampilan Events Manager ing macem-macem tema lan nimpa tema umum. Iki winates ing komponen kita nanging bakal nyegah tema sampéyan ngambil alih samubarang kayata fon, ukuran fon, struktur formulir lsp. Sampéyan uga bisa nonaktifaké gagrag ketat kanggo komponen individu ing ngisor.','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'Kita bisa nggunakake cookie kanggo nyimpen sementara informasi babagan pemesanan sing lagi dilakoni uga pesen kesalahan/konfirmasi nalika ngirim utawa ngatur acara lan lokasi sampeyan.','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'Kita nyaranaké ngaktifaké fitur iki, amarga kabèh nomer disimpen ing standar internasional %s. Senajan sampéyan mbutuhaké nomer nasional saka siji negara, supaya cocog karo kabèh fitur sing gandhèng karo telpon, yèn ora mung kolom teks prasaja sing disedhiyakaké kanggo input telpon.','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'Kita nyaranake supaya iki tetep diaktifake kajaba sampeyan ngalami masalah nalika ngonfigurasi email sampeyan.','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'Disaranaké sampéyan nggawé serep database! Sawisé upgrade dirampungaké, sampéyan ora bisa downgrade menyang versi plugin sing luwih lawas. Iki ora bisa dibatalaké.','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'Kita nyaranaké banget sampéyan mirsani %s kita sadurungé nonaktifaké gagrag apa waé ing kéné, ing akèh kasus sampéyan bisa nggawé owahan gedhé mung mawa sawetara baris CSS utawa PHP','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'Kita nyaranaké banget supaya sampéyan nyerep basis data sadurungé nindakaké tindakan iki, amarga yèn ora bisa ora dibatalaké!','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'Kita nggunakake layanan Google kanggo nggawe peta lan nyedhiyakake pangisian otomatis nalika nggolèki acara miturut lokasi, sing bisa ngumpulake data liwat browser sampeyan miturut <a href="%s">kabijakan privasi</a> Google.','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'Kita bakal nyoba ndeteksi lokasi panganggo adhedhasar zona wektu browsere lan milih negara sing cocog kanthi otomatis.','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'Kita tansah nggawé dandanan, nambah fitur lan ndandani bug ing antarané rilis. Owah-owahan iki kita gawé sacara bertahap ing antarané nganyari lan kita sadhiyakaké minangka versi pangembangan. Sampéyan bisa ngundhuh iki sacara manual, nanging kita wis nggawé luwih gampang. <strong>Pènget:</strong> Versi pangembangan ora tansah dites kanthi tuntas sadurungé dirilis, gunakna kanthi wicaksana!','Website'=>'Situs web','Week %d'=>'Minggu %d','Weekly'=>'Saben minggu','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'Sugeng rawuh ing Events Manager v6! Nganyaran paling anyar iki kalebu sawetara pangapikan UI gedhé, sing mbutuhaké sampéyan nganyari format sampéyan.','What the file holds'=>'Isiné berkas','When'=>'Kapan','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'Nalika Events Manager nampilaké daftar acara, prilaku gawané yaiku urutan miturut tanggal wiwitan kanthi munggah. Kanggo ngowahi iki, owahana nilai ing ndhuwur.','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'Nalika pemesanan ora bisa ditindakaké amarga kesalahan nalika ngisi formulir. Ing ngisor iki bakal ana dhaptar kesalahan dinamis.','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'Nalika pemesanan ora bisa ditindakaké amarga kekurangan panggonan.','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'Nalika panganggo nindakaké pemesanan, pesen umpanbalik ditampilaké gumantung ing asilé, sing bisa dinatani ing ngisor iki.','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'Nalika pemesanan wis kacathet lan dikonfirmasi.','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'Nalika pemesanan wis kacathet nanging ngenteni.','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'Nalika tamu nyoba mesen nganggo email sing wis kadaftar ing akun panganggo.','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'Nalika panganggo tamu mesen kanggo pisanan ing Events Manager, akun panganggo anyar digawé kanggo dhèwèké lan kredensialé dikirim ing email kapisah, sing bisa diowahi ing ngisor iki.','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'Nalika panganggo mbatalaké pemesanané, pesen iki bakal ditampilaké kanggo ngonfirmasi pembatalan kasebut.','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'Nalika panganggo milih mbatalaké pemesanan, pènget iki ditampilaké supaya dikonfirmasi.','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'Nalika panganggo ngowahi acara sing wis dipacak, acara kasebut bakal bali menyang status ngenteni tinjauan lan ora bakal dipacak nganti sampéyan nyetujoni maneh.','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'Nalika panganggo kudu mlebu log sadurungé mesen.','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'Nalika panganggo ngirim acarané, sampéyan bisa nuduhake formulir acara anyar manèh.','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'Nalika acara dibatalake, email umum dikirim menyang kabèh pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi lan sing ngenteni kanggo acara sing dibatalake kasebut.','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'Nalika nggawé acara anyar, zona wektu iki bakal diterapaké kanthi gawan.','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'Nalika nggawé acara, apa sampéyan péngin wektu ditampilaké ing format 24 jam?','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'Nalika nuduhake peta embed kanggo lokasi, pilih informasi apa sing bakal dienggo Google kanggo nggawé peta, saben pilihan ngasilaké asil sing béda.','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'Nalika nampilake %s global ing situs utama, sampeyan duwe opsi supaya panganggo ndeleng detil %s ing situs utama utawa diarahake menyang sub-situs.','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'Nalika nampilaké rega tiket lan total pemesanan, apa pajeg kalebu otomatis?','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'Nalika diaktifaké, kolom nomer telpon bakal nyakup format lan validasi internasional (utawa nasional) khusus.','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'Nalika diaktifaké, aplikasi seluler bisa ndaftaraké piranti lan nampa kabar push. Mateni iki bakal mandhegaké kabèh push metu lan ndelikaké pilihan kabar ing aplikasi kanggo situs iki.','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'Yèn diaktifaké, panganggo bisa ngurutaké tiketé dhéwé nganggo seret lan selehaké. Yèn diaktifaké, urutan sing disimpen luwih utama tinimbang urutan tiket gawan ing ngisor iki.','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'Nalika nampilaké dhaptar kategori, urutan iki dienggo.','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'Nalika nampilaké arsip acara kanggo %s, urutan iki dienggo.','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'Nalika nampilaké dhaptar tetenger, urutan iki dienggo.','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'Yèn ora ana tiket sing dipilih, teks iki bakal katon minangka gantiné ringkesan pemesanan, ngajak panganggo milih tiket.','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'Nalika milih tiket ing formulir pemesanan, rega bakal dirinci kanthi dinamis ing ringkesan sadurungé tombol konfirmasi pemesanan.','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'Nalika ngirim acara, sampéyan bisa milih nganggo siji pamilih tanggal kanggo tanggal wiwitan/pungkasan, utāwā kolom kapisah kanggo saben tanggal.','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'Nalika pemesanan dibatalaké, email status pambatalan uga bisa dikirim kanthi mandhiri saka kabar pambatalan acara umum.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'Nalika ukuran %s kurang saka %s, kolom nggoleki lan tombol ing bilah utama bisa tetep ing siji baris lan diowahi ukuranné, utāwā dipecah dadi pirang-pirang baris. Yèn sampéyan péngin njaga kabèh pilihan tembung panggolékan, pirang-pirang baris bakal luwih apik amarga yèn ora bakal katon pepet ing layar cilik lan nggawé pengalaman nggoleki luwih elek. Sampéyan uga bisa ndelikaké kolom nggoleki tartamtu ing setélan ing ngisor kanggo nyuda kerumitan layar nalika formulir nggoleki nyusut.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'Nalika ukuran %s kurang saka %s, kolom iki bisa didelikaké ing formulir nggoleki utama kanggo ngirit papan tontonan. Sampéyan isih bisa ngaktifaké kolom iki supaya katon ing setélan nggoleki tutug.','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'Nalika sampéyan nyimpen %s iki, kabèh pengulangan ing set iki bakal dibusak. Arep nerusaké?','Where'=>'Ing ngendi','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'Apa tiket iki ngidinaké peserta melu sacara fisik, virtual, utawa loro-lorone, ing acara hibrida.','Why'=>'Sebabé','Will be imported'=>'Bakal diimpor','Will be skipped'=>'Bakal dilewati','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'Nganggo placeholder %s, teks ing ngisor iki bakal digunakaké.','Withdrawal page'=>'Kācā pambatalan','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'Wektu pambatalan (dina)','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'Kabijakan / pandhuan pambatalan','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'Pambatalan ditampa kanggo pemesanan #%d','Within'=>'Ing jero','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'Ing area admin jaringan, mung setélan khusus jaringan sing bakal diekspor utawa diimpor. Kanggo setélan saben situs, mangga tiliki situs sing gegandhèngan ing jaringan sampéyan.','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce didol kapisah ing Woo.com','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'Pesenan tiket WooCommerce dadi','WordPress %s Archives'=>'Arsip %s WordPress','Work it out from the file'=>'Ketemokna saka berkas','Would you like to allow users to submit bookings anonymously? If so, you can use the new [event_form] shortcode or <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag with this enabled.'=>'Apa sampéyan arep ngidinaké panganggo nggawé pemesanan sacara anonim? Yèn ya, sampéyan bisa nggunakaké shortcode [event_form] anyar utawa tag cithakan <code>em_event_form()</code> nalika iki diaktifaké.','Yearly'=>'Taunan','Yes'=>'Yā','Yesterday'=>'Wingi','You <strong>must</strong> have assigned a %s page in your <a href="%s">main blog settings</a> for this to work.'=>'Sampeyan <strong>kudu</strong> wis nemtokake kaca %s ing <a href="%s">setelan blog utama</a> supaya iki bisa makarya.','You already have booked a seat at this event.'=>'Sampéyan wis mesen panggonan ing acara iki.','You are adding unavailable dates.'=>'Sampéyan lagi nambah tanggal ora kasedhiya.','You are currently attending this event.'=>'Sampéyan saiki melu acara iki.','You are currently viewing options for an archetype. These can override the default options with the follwoing available options.'=>'Sampeyan lagi ndeleng opsi kanggo archetype. Iki bisa nimpa opsi gawan nganggo opsi sing kasedhiya ing ngisor iki.','You are currently viewing your public page, this is what other users will see.'=>'Saiki sampéyan lagi nyawang kācā umum sampéyan, iki sing bakal dideleng panganggo liyané.','You are in Events Manager debug mode. To turn debug mode off, go to the <a href="%s">settings</a> page.'=>'Sampéyan lagi ana ing mode debug Events Manager. Kanggo mateni mode debug, tindakna menyang kācā <a href="%s">setélan</a>.','You are successfully connected to the following %s account:'=>'Sampéyan kasil nyambung menyang akun %s ing ngisor iki:' . "\0" . 'Sampéyan kasil nyambung menyang akun-akun %s ing ngisor iki:','You are switching location type, if you update this event your event previous location data will be deleted.'=>'Sampéyan lagi ngganti tipe lokasi, yèn acara iki dianyari, data lokasi acara sadurungé bakal dibusak.','You are trying to book a non-existent ticket for this event.'=>'Sampéyan nyoba mesen tiket sing ora ana kanggo acara iki.','You are viewing individual recurrences of %s.'=>'Sampéyan lagi mirsani saben pengulangan saka %s.','You can add private notes below for internal reference that only event managers will see.'=>'Sampeyan bisa nambah catetan pribadi ing ngisor iki kanggo referensi internal sing mung bakal dideleng dening pengelola acara.','You can add styles to your maps to give them a unique look. Build one using the %s or choose from the many free templates on %s paste the generated JSON code here.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nambah gagrag ing peta sampéyan supaya katon unik. Gawé nganggo %s utawa pilih saka akèh cithakan gratis ing %s banjur tèmplèk kode JSON sing digawé ing kéné.','You can allow different location types which can be assigned to an event. For more information see our %s.'=>'Sampéyan bisa ngidinaké macem-macem tipe lokasi sing bisa ditemtokaké kanggo acara. Kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap pirsani %s kita.','You can allow users to publicly submit events on your blog by using the %s shortcode, and enabling anonymous submissions below.'=>'Sampéyan bisa ngidinaké panganggo ngirim acara sacara umum ing blog sampéyan nganggo shortcode %s, lan ngaktifaké pangiriman anonim ing ngisor.','You can also %s into a single recurring event.'=>'Sampéyan uga bisa %s dadi siji acara bola-balik.','You can also add event attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on event pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Sampéyan uga bisa nambah atribut acara ing kéné, siji saben baris mawa format iki <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. Atribut kasebut ora bakal katon ing kācā acara kajaba sampéyan nglebokaké ing cithakan liyané ing ngisor, nanging sampéyan mbok menawa pengin nyimpen informasi tambahan bab acara kanggo kabutuhan liyané. <a href=\'%s\'>Katrangan luwih lengkap bab placeholder.</a>','You can also add location attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on location pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Sampéyan uga bisa nambah atribut lokasi ing kéné, siji saben baris mawa format iki <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. Atribut kasebut ora bakal katon ing kācā lokasi kajaba sampéyan nglebokaké ing cithakan liyané ing ngisor, nanging sampéyan mbok menawa pengin nyimpen informasi tambahan bab acara kanggo kabutuhan liyané. <a href=\'%s\'>Katrangan luwih lengkap bab placeholder.</a>','You can also request specific consent from your users to be contacted via supplied communication options (Email, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.), this can be separate to your privacy policy, given that this relates to consenting to non-essential communication such as marketing or non-email-based reminders.'=>'Sampéyan uga bisa njaluk persetujuan khusus saka panganggo supaya bisa dihubungi liwat pilihan komunikasi sing diwènèhaké (Email, Telpon, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram lsp.), iki bisa kapisah saka kabijakan privasi sampéyan, amarga gegayutan karo persetujuan komunikasi sing ora wigati kayata marketing utawa pangeling non-email.','You can also reset all events of a blog to a new timezone in %s'=>'Sampéyan uga bisa nyetel manèh kabèh acara saka sawijining blog menyang zona wektu anyar ing %s','You can change the permalink structure of your events, locations, categories and tags here. Be aware that you may want to set up redirects if you change your permalink structures to maintain SEO rankings.'=>'Sampéyan bisa ngowahi struktur pranālā ajeg acara, lokasi, kategori lan tetenger sampéyan ing kéné. Élinga yèn sampéyan mbok menawa kudu nyiyapaké pangalihan yèn ngowahi struktur pranālā ajeg supaya peringkat SEO tetep kajaga.','You can choose to show a popup modal or inline under the main search bar triggered by an icon on the main search bar.'=>'Sampéyan bisa milih nampilaké modal popup utāwā inline ing ngisor bilah nggoleki utama sing dipicu ikon ing bilah nggoleki utama.','You can choose whether or not to show unavailable tickets to visitors.'=>'Sampéyan bisa milih apa arep nampilaké tiket sing ora sumadya marang pengunjung.','You can create more than one "type" of event, which can have its own admin section, URL structure, calendar and formatting. For example, you may have events, appointments, and workshops all running under the Events Manager engine!'=>'Sampéyan bisa nggawé luwih saka siji "tipe" acara, sing saben-saben bisa nduwé bagéan admin, struktur URL, tanggalan lan pamormatan dhéwé. Contone, sampéyan bisa nduwé acara, janjian, lan lokakarya kabèh mlaku ing mesin Events Manager!','You can disable ALL styling altogether by setting this to \'no\'. By doing so, nothing will be styled, AT ALL, by Events Manager in the front-end. Basically, it\'s up to you and your theme!'=>'Sampéyan bisa nonaktifaké SAKABÈHING gagrag kanthi nyetel iki menyang \'ora\'. Mengkono, ora ana apa waé sing bakal digagrag, BABAR BLAS, déning Events Manager ing ngarep. Intiné, kabèh gumantung sampéyan lan tema sampéyan!','You can disable this email by leaving the subject blank.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nonaktifake email iki kanthi ngosongaké subyek.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with a %s to prevent getting overwritten.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nyunting saben pengulangan lan misahaké saka %s supaya ora katimpa.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this %s.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nyunting saben pengulangan lan misahaké saka %s iki.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this recurring event.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nyunting saben pengulangan lan nglepasaké saka acara bola-balik iki.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this repeating event.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nyunting saben pengulangan lan misahaké saka acara bola-balik iki.','You can have single or multiple tickets, where certain tickets become available under certain conditions, e.g. early bookings, group discounts, maximum bookings per ticket, etc.'=>'Sampéyan bisa duwé tiket siji utawa akèh, ing ngendi tiket tartamtu dadi kasedhiya miturut kahanan tartamtu, kayata pemesanan awal, diskon klompok, pemesanan maksimal saben tiket, lan liya-liyané.','You can hide or leave the consent box checked for registered users who have provided consent previously.'=>'Sampéyan bisa ndelikaké utawa ninggalaké kotak persetujuan tetep dicenthang kanggo panganggo terdaftar sing wis weneh persetujuan sakdurungé.','You can join from %s.'=>'Sampeyan bisa melu saka %s.','You can log into our site here : %s'=>'Sampéyan bisa mlebu log ing situs kita ing kéné : %s','You can now give fine grained control with regards to what your users can do with events. Each user role can have perform different sets of actions.'=>'Saiki sampeyan bisa menehi kontrol sing luwih rinci babagan apa sing bisa ditindakake panganggo sampeyan karo acara. Saben parāgā panganggo bisa nindakake set tumindak sing beda-beda.','You can only convert a repeating %s'=>'Sampéyan mung bisa ngowahi %s bola-balik','You can reset your events to a new timezone and also complete the final migration step by deleting unecessary data in %s'=>'Sampéyan bisa nyetel manèh acara sampéyan menyang zona wektu anyar lan uga ngrampungaké langkah migrasi pungkasan kanthi mbusak data sing ora perlu ing %s','You can use Google Maps to show where your events are located. For more information on using maps, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a>.'=>'Sampéyan bisa nggunakaké Google Maps kanggo nuduhake panggonané acara sampéyan. Kanggo katrangan luwih lengkap bab nggunakaké peta, <a href="%s">pirsani dokumentasi kita</a>.','You can view your event here:'=>'Sampéyan bisa nonton acara sampéyan ing kéné:','You cannot RSVP to this booking with %s'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa RSVP kanggo pemesanan iki nganggo %s','You cannot book more than %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa mesen luwih saka %1$d panggonan kanggo tiket %2$s.','You cannot book more than %d spaces for this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa mesen luwih saka %d panggonan kanggo acara iki.','You cannot change the CPT type of %s to %s. This custom post type already exists.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa ngowahi jinis CPT %s dadi %s. Jinis pos kustom iki wis ana.','You cannot delete a ticket that has a booking on it.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa mbusak tiket sing wis ana pemesanané.','You cannot delete tickets if there are any bookings associated with them. Please delete these bookings first.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa mbusak tiket yèn ana pemesanan sing gandhèng karo tiket kuwi. Mangga busak pemesanan iki dhisik.','You cannot edit saved locations here.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa nyunting lokasi sing wis disimpen ing kéné.','You cannot manage this %s.'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa ngelola %s iki.','You cannot read private %s'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa maca %s pribadi','You cannot view others %s'=>'Sampéyan ora bisa ndeleng %s liyané','You do not have any bookings.'=>'Sampéyan durung duwé pemesanan.','You do not have permission to attach media to that post.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyampiraké media menyang pos kuwi.','You do not have permission to change this booking status.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngowahi status pemesanan iki.','You do not have permission to create bookings through the API.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nggawé pemesanan liwat API.','You do not have permission to create/edit %s.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nggawé/nyunting %s.','You do not have permission to delete %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak %s','You do not have permission to delete event terms.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak istilah acara.','You do not have permission to delete others %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak %s liyané','You do not have permission to delete this booking.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak pemesanan iki.','You do not have permission to delete this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak acara iki.','You do not have permission to delete this location.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak lokasi iki.','You do not have permission to delete this ticket.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo mbusak tiket iki.','You do not have permission to do that.'=>'Sampeyan ora duwé idin kanggo nindakaké kuwi.','You do not have permission to edit %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting %s','You do not have permission to edit others %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting %s liyané','You do not have permission to edit that event, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting acara kuwi, mula gambar sing diunggah ora disetel minangka gambar fitur.','You do not have permission to edit that location, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting lokasi kuwi, mula gambar sing diunggah ora disetel minangka gambar fitur.','You do not have permission to edit this attachment.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting lampiran iki.','You do not have permission to edit this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyunting acara iki.','You do not have permission to manage %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngelola %s','You do not have permission to manage event terms.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngelola istilah acara.','You do not have permission to manage others %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngelola %s liyané','You do not have permission to manage this booking.'=>'Sampéyan ora nduwé idin kanggo ngatur pemesanan iki.','You do not have permission to manage tickets for this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngelola tiket kanggo acara iki.','You do not have permission to migrate data.'=>'Sampeyan ora duwé idin kanggo mindhahaké data.','You do not have permission to publish %s'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo macak %s','You do not have permission to save this booking.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyimpen pemesanan iki.','You do not have permission to save this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyimpen acara iki.','You do not have permission to save this location.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nyimpen lokasi iki.','You do not have permission to send a test email, or this page has expired. Please reload the settings page and try again.'=>'Sampeyan ora duwe ijin kanggo ngirim email uji, utawa kaca iki wis kadaluwarsa. Mangga muat ulang kaca setelan lan coba maneh.','You do not have permission to update this ticket.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo nganyari tiket iki.','You do not have permission to upload images'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngunggah gambar','You do not have permission to upload media.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ngunggah media.','You do not have permission to view this booking.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ndelok pemesanan iki.','You do not have permission to view this event.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ndelok acara iki.','You do not have permission to view this location.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ndelok lokasi iki.','You do not have permission to view this ticket.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé idin kanggo ndelok tiket iki.','You do not have the rights to manage this %s.'=>'Sampéyan ora duwé hak kanggo ngelola %s iki.','You do not have the rights to manage this event.'=>'Sampeyan ora duwe hak kanggo ngatur acara iki.','You do not have the rights to manage this ticket.'=>'Sampeyan ora duwe hak kanggo ngatur tiket iki.','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Events Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Sampéyan durung duwé atribut kustom sing ditetepaké ing setélan cithakan Events Manager apa waé. Mangga tambahaké ing <a href=\'%s\'>kācā setélan</a>','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Locations Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Sampéyan durung netepaké atribut kustom ing setélan cithakan Locations Manager apa waé. Mangga tambahna ing <a href=\'%s\'>kācā setélan</a>','You have %s confirmed bookings'=>'Sampéyan duwé %s pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi','You have %s pending bookings'=>'Sampéyan duwé %s pemesanan sing ngenténi','You have a confirmed booking'=>'Sampéyan duwé siji pemesanan sing wis dikonfirmasi','You have a pending booking'=>'Sampéyan duwé siji pemesanan sing ngenténi','You have chosen to add or edit your current unavailable dates for all recurrences. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Sampéyan milih nambah utawa nyunting tanggal ora kasedhiya saiki kanggo kabèh pengulangan. Mangga waca pènget iki kanthi premati!','You have chosen to edit your %s times. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Sampéyan milih nyunting wektu %s. Mangga waca pènget iki kanthi premati!','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. If you shorten the date range, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be cancelled or deleted.'=>'Sampéyan milih nyunting rentang tanggal pengulangan. Yèn sampéyan nyepetaké rentang tanggal, pengulangan apa waé sing ana ing njaba rentang anyar bakal dibatalake utawa dibusak.','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Sampéyan milih nyunting rentang tanggal pengulangan. Mangga waca pènget iki kanthi premati!','You have confirmed your attendance.'=>'Sampéyan wis ngonfirmasi kerawuhan sampéyan.','You have currently disabled %s'=>'Saiki sampéyan wis nonaktifake %s','You have currently enabled %s'=>'Saiki sampéyan wis ngaktifaké %s','You have declined your attendance, your booking is now cancelled.'=>'Sampéyan wis nolak kanggo rawuh, pemesanan sampéyan saiki dibatalake.','You have declined your attendance.'=>'Sampéyan wis nolak kanggo rawuh.','You have not defined a date range long enough to create a recurrence.'=>'Sampéyan durung nemtokaké rentang tanggal sing cukup dawa kanggo nggawé pengulangan.','You have not definitively confrimed your attendance.'=>'Sampéyan durung ngonfirmasi kerawuhan kanthi pasti.','You have successfully created an account at %s'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil nggawé akun ing %s','You have successfully disconnected from your %s account.'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil medhot saka akun %s sampéyan.' . "\0" . 'Sampéyan wis kasil medhot saka akun-akun %s sampéyan.','You have successfully finalized upgrading your site.'=>'Sampéyan kasil ngrampungaké upgrade situs sampéyan.','You have successfully migrated to Events Manager v6 formatting! We hope you enjoy the changes. In case you had some special formatting you realize you needed, there\'s the undo option below, it will reset all your migrated formats to how they were previoiusly. You can migrate again or individuall migrate each option within the settings page.'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil pindhah menyang format Events Manager v6! Muga-muga sampéyan seneng karo owah-owahané. Yèn sampéyan duwé format khusus sing ternyata sampéyan butuhaké, ana opsi mbaleni ing ngisor, sing bakal ngesetel ulang kabèh format sing dipindhahaké kaya sadurungé. Sampéyan bisa pindhah manèh utawa pindhah siji-siji saben opsi ing kācā setélan.','You have successfully submitted your event, which will be published pending approval.'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil ngirim acara sampéyan, sing bakal dipacak sawisé disetujoni.','You have successfully updated to Events Manager %s'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil nganyari menyang Events Manager %s','You have successfully updated your event, which will be republished pending approval.'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil nganyari acara sampéyan, sing bakal dipacak manèh sawisé disetujoni.','You must allow us to collect and store your data in order for us to process your booking.'=>'Sampéyan kudu ngidinaké kita ngumpulaké lan nyimpen data sampéyan supaya kita bisa ngolah pemesanan sampéyan.','You must be logged in to view bookings.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu kanggo ndelok pemesanan.','You must book at least %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mesen paling ora %1$d panggonan kanggo tiket %2$s.','You must check the box allowing us to communicate with you via your provided contact methods.'=>'Sampéyan kudu nyentang kothak sing ngolèhaké kita ngubungi sampéyan liwat cara kontak sing sampéyan wènèhaké.','You must log in or register to make a booking.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu log utawa ndaftar kanggo nggawé pemesanan.','You must log in to cancel your booking.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu log kanggo mbatalake pemesananmu.','You must log in to view and manage your bookings.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu log kanggo ndeleng lan ngelola pemesanan sampéyan.','You must log in to view and manage your events.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu log kanggo ndeleng lan ngelola acara sampéyan.','You must log in to view and manage your locations.'=>'Sampéyan kudu mlebu log kanggo ndeleng lan ngelola lokasi sampéyan.','You must request at least one space to book an event.'=>'Sampéyan kudu njaluk paling ora siji panggonan kanggo mesen acara.','You nave successfully migrated to the default v6 formatting options, enjoy! We have an undo option, just in case...'=>'Sampéyan wis kasil pindhah menyang opsi format gawan v6, nikmatana! Kita nyedhiyakaké opsi mbaleni, mung kanggo jaga-jaga...','You will also need supply an OAuth redirect url to %s. Your url for this site is : %s'=>'Sampéyan uga kudu nyadyakaké URL pangalihan OAuth marang %s. URL sampéyan kanggo situs iki yaiku: %s','You\'ll need to create an App with %s and obtain the App credentials by going to %s.'=>'Sampéyan kudu nggawé App nganggo %s lan éntuk kredensial App kanthi menyang %s.','Your %s details are incorrect and cannot be published, please correct these errors first:'=>'Rincian %s sampéyan salah lan ora bisa dipacak, mangga didandani kesalahan iki dhisik:','Your %s license includes this add-on.'=>'Lisensi %s sampeyan kalebu add-on iki.','Your Details'=>'Detil Sampéyan','Your account has been successfully connected with %s!'=>'Akun sampéyan wis kasil disambungaké karo %s!','Your booking does not include virtual access to this event, or it is not confirmed yet.'=>'Pemesanan sampeyan ora kalebu akses virtual menyang acara iki, utawa durung dikonfirmasi.','Your booking emails show the venue to every attendee, including those with virtual-only tickets. Use %1$s for the Where line in %2$s so each attendee sees the venue, their join link or both.'=>'Email pemesanan sampeyan nampilaké papan kanggo saben peserta, kalebu sing mung duwé tiket virtual. Gunakna %1$s kanggo larik Ing ngendi ing %2$s supaya saben peserta weruh papan, pranālā melu utawa loro-lorone.','Your booking has been recorded'=>'Pemesanan sampéyan wis kacathet','Your booking is now unconfirmed'=>'Pemesanan sampéyan saiki durung dikonfirmasi','Your confirmed booking email has no join link, so attendees with virtual access will not receive one by email. Add %1$s to it in %2$s.'=>'Email pemesanan wis dikonfirmasi sampeyan ora duwé pranālā melu, mula peserta kanthi akses virtual ora bakal nampa kuwi liwat email. Tambahna %1$s menyang kuwi ing %2$s.','Your current settings will be saved for this selected view.'=>'Setélan sampéyan saiki bakal disimpen kanggo tampilan sing dipilih iki.','Your declaration of withdrawal has been received.'=>'Pratelan mundur sampéyan wis ditampa.','Your event #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been approved.'=>'Acara sampéyan #_EVENTNAME tanggal #_EVENTDATES wis disetujoni.','Your event details are incorrect and recurrences cannot be created, please correct these errors first:'=>'Rincian acara sampéyan salah lan pengulangan ora bisa digawé, mangga didandani kesalahan iki dhisik:','Your hold on these spaces has ended. You can still book them while they are available.'=>'Penahanan panggonan iki wis rampung. Sampéyan isih bisa mesen yèn isih sumadya.','Your last attempt to reset all blogs to a certain timezone did not complete successfully. You can attempt to reset only those blogs that weren\'t completed by selecting your desired timezone again and then %s from the dropdowns below'=>'Upaya pungkasan sampéyan kanggo nyetel ulang kabèh blog menyang zona wektu tartamtu ora rampung kanthi kasil. Sampéyan bisa nyoba nyetel ulang mung blog sing durung rampung kanthi milih zona wektu sing dikarepaké maneh lan banjur %s saka dropdown ing ngisor iki','Your name'=>'Jeneng sampéyan','Your own legal withdrawal policy and model withdrawal form, shown on the withdrawal page. Events Manager does not generate legal text — paste your own from your legal adviser.'=>'Kabijakan pambatalan hukum sampéyan dhéwé lan formulir pambatalan model, sing ditampilaké ing kācā pambatalan. Events Manager ora nggawé teks hukum, tèmplèkna dhéwé saka penasihat hukum sampéyan.','Your plan'=>'Paket sampeyan','Your search filter settings will be selected automatically.'=>'Setélan panyaring panggolékan sampéyan bakal dipilih kanthi otomatis.','Your session expired, please try again.'=>'Sési sampéyan kadaluwarsa, mangga coba manèh.','Your spaces are held for %s while you complete your booking.'=>'Panggonan sampéyan ditahan suwéné %s nalika sampéyan ngrampungaké pemesanan.','Your user account cannot publish events or locations in Events Manager. Run the import as an administrator.'=>'Akun pangguna sa